ght-cli：コードの記録と生成","ko":"AI 에이전트 Playwright-cli: 코드 기록 및 생성","es":"Herramientas de AI: playwright-cli para automatización","fr":"Outils d''IA: playwright-cli pour l''automatisation","de":"KI-Tools: playwright-cli für Automatisierung","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Playwright-CLI","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Playwright-CLI","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Playwright-CLI","en":"playwright-cli"},"description":{"zh":"Playwright-cli是用于记录和生成Playwright代码、检查选择器和截取网页屏幕截图的CLI工具","ja":"Playwright-cliはPlaywrightコードを記録・生成し、セレクターを検査し、Webページのスクリーンショットを取得するCLIツール","ko":"Playwright-cli는 Playwright 코드를 기록하고 생성하며 선택자를 검사하고 웹 페이지의 스크린샷을 캡처하는 CLI 도구","es":"Playwright-cli es una herramienta de línea de comandos para acciones comunes de Playwright, que permite grabar y generar código, inspeccionar selectores y ca...","fr":"Playwright-cli est un outil de ligne de commande pour les actions courantes de Playwright, qui permet d''enregistrer et de générer du code, d''inspecter des sé...","de":"Playwright-cli ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool für gängige Playwright-Aktionen, mit dem Sie Code aufzeichnen und generieren, Selektoren inspizieren und Bildschir...","pt":"O Playwright-CLI é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para automação de tarefas com Playwright, permitindo gravar e gerar código, inspecionar seletores e tir...","ru":"Playwright-CLI — это инструмент командной строки для автоматизации задач с Playwright, позволяющий записывать и генерировать код, инспектировать селекторы и ...","ar":"Playwright-CLI هي أداة سطر الأوامر للautomatisation المهام مع Playwright، مما يسمح بتسجيل وإنشاء код، وفحص محددات وتصوير الشاشة.","en":"CLI for common Playwright actions. Record and generate Playwright code, inspect selectors and take screenshots."},"definition":{"en":"CLI for common Playwright actions. Record and generate Playwright code, inspect selectors and take screenshots."},"features":{"zh":["记录和生成Playwright代码","检查选择器","截取网页屏幕截图","提高开发效率","支持多种浏览器","易于使用的CLI界面"],"ja":["Playwrightコードの記録と生成","セレクターの検査","Webページのスクリーンショットの取得","開発効率の向上","複数のブラウザをサポート","使いやすいCLIインターフェイス"],"ko":["Playwright 코드의 기록 및 생성","선택자의 검사","웹 페이지의 스크린샷 캡처","개발 효율성의 향상","다중 브라우저 지원","사용하기 쉬운 CLI 인터페이스"],"es":["Grabación y generación de código Playwright","Inspección de selectores","Captura de pantallas","Interfaz de línea de comandos","Automatización de tareas"],"fr":["Enregistrement et génération de code Playwright","Inspection de sélecteurs","Capture d''écrans","Interface de ligne de commande","Automatisation de tâches"],"de":["Aufzeichnung und Generierung von Playwright-Code","Inspektion von Selektoren","Bildschirmfotos","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle","Automatisierung von Aufgaben"],"pt":["Gravação e geração de código Playwright","Inspecção de seletores","Captura de screenshots","Automação de tarefas com Playwright","Interface de linha de comando"],"ru":["Запись и генерация кода Playwright","Инспекция селекторов","Сделать скриншот","Автоматизация задач с Playwright","Интерфейс командной строки"],"ar":["تسجيل وإنشاء код Playwright","فحص محددات","تصوير الشاشة","الautomatisation المهام مع Playwright","واجهة سطر الأوامر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Playwright-cli","Playwright-cli教程","Playwright代码生成","选择器检查工具","网页截图工具","Playwright-cli安装","Playwright-cli设置指南","Playwright-cli替代品","Playwright-cli vs Selenium"],"ja":["Playwright-cliの使い方","Playwright-cliチュートリアル","Playwrightコードの生成","セレクター検査ツール","Webページスクリーンショットツール","Playwright-cliのインストール","Playwright-cliの設定ガイド","Playwright-cliの代替品","Playwright-cli vs Selenium"],"ko":["Playwright-cli 사용법","Playwright-cli 튜토리얼","Playwright 코드 생성","선택자 검사 도구","웹 페이지 스크린샷 도구","Playwright-cli 설치","Playwright-cli 설정 가이드","Playwright-cli 대체품","Playwright-cli vs Selenium"],"es":["cómo usar playwright-cli","qué es playwright","alternativas a playwright","playwright vs selenium","instalación de playwright-cli","guía de configuración de playwright"],"fr":["comment utiliser playwright-cli","qu''est-ce que playwright","alternatives à playwright","playwright vs selenium","installation de playwright-cli","guide de configuration de playwright"],"de":["wie man playwright-cli verwendet","was ist playwright","alternativen zu playwright","playwright vs selenium","installation von playwright-cli","konfigurationsanleitung für playwright"],"pt":["como usar Playwright-CLI","o que é Playwright-CLI","Playwright-CLI alternative","Playwright-CLI vs Selenium","instalar Playwright-CLI","guia de configuração do Playwright-CLI"],"ru":["как использовать Playwright-CLI","что такое Playwright-CLI","Playwright-CLI альтернатива","Playwright-CLI vs Selenium","установить Playwright-CLI","руководство по настройке Playwright-CLI"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Playwright-CLI","ما هو Playwright-CLI","بديل Playwright-CLI","Playwright-CLI مقابل Selenium","تثبيت Playwright-CLI","دليل إعداد Playwright-CLI"]}},"owner":"microsoft","repo":"playwright-cli","repoPath":"microsoft/playwright-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.121Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"playwright-cli","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with playwright-cli\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\n# open new browser\nplaywright-cli open\n# navigate to a page\nplaywright-cli goto https://playwright.dev\n# interact with the page using refs from the snapshot\nplaywright-cli click e15\nplaywright-cli type \"page.click\"\nplaywright-cli press Enter\n# take a screenshot (rarely used, as snapshot is more common)\nplaywright-cli screenshot\n# close the browser\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open\n# open","body":"# Browser Automation with playwright-cli\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\n# open new browser\nplaywright-cli open\n# navigate to a page\nplaywright-cli goto https://playwright.dev\n# interact with the page using refs from the snapshot\nplaywright-cli click e15\nplaywright-cli type \"page.click\"\nplaywright-cli press Enter\n# take a screenshot (rarely used, as snapshot is more common)\nplaywright-cli screenshot\n# close the browser\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open\n# open and navigate right away\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/\nplaywright-cli goto https://playwright.dev\nplaywright-cli type \"search query\"\nplaywright-cli click e3\nplaywright-cli dblclick e7\nplaywright-cli fill e5 \"user@example.com\"\nplaywright-cli drag e2 e8\nplaywright-cli hover e4\nplaywright-cli select e9 \"option-value\"\nplaywright-cli upload ./document.pdf\nplaywright-cli check e12\nplaywright-cli uncheck e12\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli snapshot --filename=after-click.yaml\nplaywright-cli eval \"document.title\"\nplaywright-cli eval \"el => el.textContent\" e5\nplaywright-cli dialog-accept\nplaywright-cli dialog-accept \"confirmation text\"\nplaywright-cli dialog-dismiss\nplaywright-cli resize 1920 1080\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n### Navigation\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli go-back\nplaywright-cli go-forward\nplaywright-cli reload\n```\n\n### Keyboard\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli press Enter\nplaywright-cli press ArrowDown\nplaywright-cli keydown Shift\nplaywright-cli keyup Shift\n```\n\n### Mouse\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli mousemove 150 300\nplaywright-cli mousedown\nplaywright-cli mousedown right\nplaywright-cli mouseup\nplaywright-cli mouseup right\nplaywright-cli mousewheel 0 100\n```\n\n### Save as\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli screenshot\nplaywright-cli screenshot e5\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=page.png\nplaywright-cli pdf --filename=page.pdf\n```\n\n### Tabs\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli tab-list\nplaywright-cli tab-new\nplaywright-cli tab-new https://example.com/page\nplaywright-cli tab-close\nplaywright-cli tab-close 2\nplaywright-cli tab-select 0\n```\n\n### Storage\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli state-save\nplaywright-cli state-save auth.json\nplaywright-cli state-load auth.json\n\n# Cookies\nplaywright-cli cookie-list\nplaywright-cli cookie-list --domain=example.com\nplaywright-cli cookie-get session_id\nplaywright-cli cookie-set session_id abc123\nplaywright-cli cookie-set session_id abc123 --domain=example.com --httpOnly --secure\nplaywright-cli cookie-delete session_id\nplaywright-cli cookie-clear\n\n# LocalStorage\nplaywright-cli localstorage-list\nplaywright-cli localstorage-get theme\nplaywright-cli localstorage-set theme dark\nplaywright-cli localstorage-delete theme\nplaywright-cli localstorage-clear\n\n# SessionStorage\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-list\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-get step\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-set step 3\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-delete step\nplaywright-cli sessionstorage-clear\n```\n\n### Network\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli route \"**/*.jpg\" --status=404\nplaywright-cli route \"https://api.example.com/**\" --body=''{\"mock\": true}''\nplaywright-cli route-list\nplaywright-cli unroute \"**/*.jpg\"\nplaywright-cli unroute\n```\n\n### DevTools\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli console\nplaywright-cli console warning\nplaywright-cli network\nplaywright-cli run-code \"async page => await page.context().grantPermissions([''geolocation''])\"\nplaywright-cli tracing-start\nplaywright-cli tracing-stop\nplaywright-cli video-start\nplaywright-cli video-stop video.webm\n```\n\n## Open parameters\n```bash\n# Use specific browser when creating session\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chrome\nplaywright-cli open --browser=firefox\nplaywright-cli open --browser=webkit\nplaywright-cli open --browser=msedge\n# Connect to browser via extension\nplaywright-cli open --extension\n\n# Use persistent profile (by default profile is in-memory)\nplaywright-cli open --persistent\n# Use persistent profile with custom directory\nplaywright-cli open --profile=/path/to/profile\n\n# Start with config file\nplaywright-cli open --config=my-config.json\n\n# Close the browser\nplaywright-cli close\n# Delete user data for the default session\nplaywright-cli delete-data\n```\n\n## Snapshots\n\nAfter each command, playwright-cli provides a snapshot of the current browser state.\n\n```bash\n> playwright-cli goto https://example.com\n### Page\n- Page URL: https://example.com/\n- Page Title: Example Domain\n### Snapshot\n[Snapshot](.playwright-cli/page-2026-02-14T19-22-42-679Z.yml)\n```\n\nYou can also take a snapshot on demand using `playwright-cli snapshot` command.\n\nIf `--filename` is not provided, a new snapshot file is created with a timestamp. Default to automatic file naming, use `--filename=` when artifact is a part of the workflow result.\n\n## Browser Sessions\n\n```bash\n# create new browser session named \"mysession\" with persistent profile\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession open example.com --persistent\n# same with manually specified profile directory (use when requested explicitly)\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession open example.com --profile=/path/to/profile\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession click e6\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession close  # stop a named browser\nplaywright-cli -s=mysession delete-data  # delete user data for persistent session\n\nplaywright-cli list\n# Close all browsers\nplaywright-cli close-all\n# Forcefully kill all browser processes\nplaywright-cli kill-all\n```\n\n## Local installation\n\nIn some cases user might want to install playwright-cli locally. If running globally available `playwright-cli` binary fails, use `npx playwright-cli` to run the commands. For example:\n\n```bash\nnpx playwright-cli open https://example.com\nnpx playwright-cli click e1\n```\n\n## Example: Form submission\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com/form\nplaywright-cli snapshot\n\nplaywright-cli fill e1 \"user@example.com\"\nplaywright-cli fill e2 \"password123\"\nplaywright-cli click e3\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Example: Multi-tab workflow\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli tab-new https://example.com/other\nplaywright-cli tab-list\nplaywright-cli tab-select 0\nplaywright-cli snapshot\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Example: Debugging with DevTools\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli click e4\nplaywright-cli fill e7 \"test\"\nplaywright-cli console\nplaywright-cli network\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n```bash\nplaywright-cli open https://example.com\nplaywright-cli tracing-start\nplaywright-cli click e4\nplaywright-cli fill e7 \"test\"\nplaywright-cli tracing-stop\nplaywright-cli close\n```\n\n## Specific tasks\n\n* **Request mocking** [references/request-mocking.md](references/request-mocking.md)\n* **Running Playwright code** [references/running-code.md](references/running-code.md)\n* **Browser session management** [references/session-management.md](references/session-management.md)\n* **Storage state (cookies, localStorage)** [references/storage-state.md](references/storage-state.md)\n* **Test generation** [references/test-generation.md](references/test-generation.md)\n* **Tracing** [references/tracing.md](references/tracing.md)\n* **Video recording** [references/video-recording.md](references/video-recording.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:39:11.097Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Browser Automation Agents needing advanced Playwright code generation and browser interaction capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级Playwright代码生成和浏览器交互能力的浏览器自动化代理。","ja":"ブラウザの自動化エージェントが高度なPlaywrightコード生成とブラウザの相互作用機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 Playwright 코드 생성 및 브라우저 상호 작용 기능이 필요한 브라우저 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de navegador que necesitan generación de código Playwright avanzado y capacidades de interacción con el navegador.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de navigateur nécessitant une génération de code Playwright avancée et des capacités d''interaction avec le navigateur.","de":"Perfekt für Browser-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Playwright-Codegenerierung und Browser-Interaktionsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Navegador que precisam de geração avançada de código Playwright e capacidades de interação com o navegador.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации браузера, требующих продвинутой генерации кода Playwright и возможностей взаимодействия с браузером.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء آليين في المتصفح الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد متقدم من رمز Playwright وقدرات التفاعل مع المتصفح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using Playwright, enabling features like recording and generating Playwright code, inspecting selectors, and taking screenshots via protocols like HTTPS, utilizing libraries such as Playwright for browser automation.","zh":"赋予代理使用Playwright自动化浏览器交互的能力，实现录制和生成Playwright代码、检查选择器以及通过HTTPS等协议使用截图和快照功能，利用Playwright等库进行浏览器自动化。","ja":"エージェントがPlaywrightを使用してブラウザの相互作用を自動化する機能を提供し、Playwrightコードの記録と生成、セレクタの調査、HTTPSなどのプロトコルを使用したスクリーンショットとスナップショット機能などを可能にします。ブラウザの自動化にはPlaywrightなどのライブラリを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Playwright를 사용하여 브라우저 상호 작용을 자동화 할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 Playwright 코드의 기록 및 생성, 선택기 조사, HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 스크린샷 및 스냅샷 기능 등을 가능하게 합니다. 브라우저 자동화에는 Playwright와 같은 라이브러리를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las interacciones del navegador mediante Playwright, lo que permite funciones como grabar y generar código Playwright, inspeccionar selectores y tomar capturas de pantalla a través de protocolos como HTTPS, utilizando bibliotecas como Playwright para la automatización del navegador.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions de navigateur à l''aide de Playwright, ce qui permet des fonctionnalités telles que l''enregistrement et la génération de code Playwright, l''inspection des sélecteurs et la capture d''écran via des protocoles tels que HTTPS, en utilisant des bibliothèques telles que Playwright pour l''automatisation du navigateur.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Browser-Interaktionen mithilfe von Playwright zu automatisieren, wodurch Funktionen wie Aufzeichnen und Generieren von Playwright-Code, Inspektion von Selektoren und Aufnahme von Screenshots über Protokolle wie HTTPS ermöglicht werden, unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie Playwright für die Browser-Automatisierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações de navegador usando Playwright, permitindo recursos como gravação e geração de código Playwright, inspeção de seletor e captura de tela por meio de protocolos como HTTPS, utilizando bibliotecas como Playwright para automação de navegador.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера с помощью Playwright, обеспечивая функции, такие как запись и генерация кода Playwright, инспекция селекторов и захват экрана через протоколы, такие как HTTPS, используя библиотеки, такие как Playwright для автоматизации браузера.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على 자동 أتمتة تفاعلات المتصفح باستخدام Playwright، وتمكين الميزات مثل التسجيل وتوليد رمز Playwright، وفحص المحددات، وتسجيل الشاشة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS، باستخدام مكتبات مثل Playwright لأتمتة المتصفح."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser interactions for testing purposes","Generating Playwright code for complex user flows","Debugging browser issues using screenshot and snapshot features"],"zh":["用于测试目的的浏览器交互自动化","为复杂用户流生成Playwright代码","使用截图和快照功能调试浏览器问题"],"ja":["テスト目的のブラウザの相互作用の自動化","複雑なユーザーフロー用のPlaywrightコードの生成","スクリーンショットとスナップショット機能を使用したブラウザの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["테스트 목적의 브라우저 상호 작용 자동화","복잡한 사용자 흐름을 위한 Playwright 코드 생성","스크린샷 및 스냅샷 기능을 사용한 브라우저 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar interacciones de navegador para fines de prueba","Generar código Playwright para flujos de usuario complejos","Depurar problemas de navegador mediante características de captura y instantánea de pantalla"],"fr":["Automatiser les interactions de navigateur à des fins de test","Générer du code Playwright pour des flux d''utilisateurs complexes","Déboguer les problèmes de navigateur à l''aide de fonctionnalités de capture et d''instantané d''écran"],"de":["Automatisieren von Browser-Interaktionen für Testzwecke","Generieren von Playwright-Code für komplexe Benutzerabläufe","Beheben von Browser-Problemen mithilfe von Screenshot- und Snapshot-Funktionen"],"pt":["Automatizar interações de navegador para fins de teste","Gerar código Playwright para fluxos de usuário complexos","Depurar problemas de navegador usando recursos de captura de tela e instantâneo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать взаимодействия браузера для целей тестирования","Генерировать код Playwright для сложных потоков пользователей","Отлаживать проблемы браузера, используя функции захвата экрана и снимка"],"ar":["أتمتة تفاعلات المتصفح لأغراض الاختبار","توليد رمز Playwright لتدفقات المستخدم المعقدة","تصحيح أخطاء المتصفح باستخدام ميزات تسجيل الشاشة واللقطة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright installation","Limited to browser automation tasks"],"zh":["需要安装Playwright","仅限于浏览器自动化任务"],"ja":["Playwrightのインストールが必要","ブラウザの自動化タスクのみに限定"],"ko":["Playwright 설치가 필요","브라우저 자동화 작업만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Playwright","Limitado a tareas de automatización de navegador"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Playwright","Limité aux tâches d''automatisation de navigateur"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Playwright","Begrenzt auf Browser-Automatisierungsaufgaben"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Playwright","Limitado a tarefas de automação de navegador"],"ru":["Требует установки Playwright","Ограничен задачами автоматизации браузера"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Playwright","محدود بمهام أتمتة المتصفح"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"716a80315821d6694f8ca1331c1e03ecbdf33c88ce8b4042c7684b4c4ff5e4dc","qualityScore":39}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('peterfriese/yt-genius-skill/yt-genius', 'community', 'peterfriese', 'yt-genius-skill', 'peterfriese/yt-genius-skill', 'yt-genius', 0, 0, 39, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.133Z', '2026-03-02T03:41:56.725Z', '4a0e223da237e2d3a7521691233667f6002e5f80641e4a603157fa07567b2abc', '{"id":"peterfriese/yt-genius-skill/yt-genius","name":"yt-genius","description":{"zh":"yt-genius 是一个用于生成 YouTube 元数据和章节的 AI 智能工具，帮助开发者提高视频质量和用户体验","ja":"yt-genius は YouTube メタデータとチャプターを生成する AI エージェントで、開発者がビデオの品質とユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させるのに役立ちます","ko":"yt-genius는 YouTube 메타데이터와 장을 생성하는 AI 에이전트로, 개발자가 비디오 품질과 사용자 경험을 향상시키는 데 도움을 줍니다","es":"yt-genius es una herramienta de AI que genera metadatos y capítulos para videos de YouTube, mejorando la experiencia del usuario","fr":"yt-genius est un outil IA qui génère des métadonnées et des chapitres pour les vidéos YouTube, améliorant l''expérience utilisateur","de":"yt-genius ist ein KI-Tool, das Metadaten und Kapitel für YouTube-Videos erstellt, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern","pt":"O yt-genius é uma ferramenta de IA para gerar metadados e capítulos para vídeos do YouTube, simplificando o processo de edição","ru":"ИИ Агент yt-genius предназначен для генерации метаданных и глав для видео на YouTube, упрощая процесс редактирования","ar":"yt-genius هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لإنشاء أوسمة وفصول لمقاطع فيديو يوتيوب، مما يبسط عملية التحرير","en":"YouTube Genius skill for generating metadata and chapters."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"YouTube Metadata 和章节生成 - AI 智能工具","ja":"YouTube メタデータとチャプター生成 - AI エージェント","ko":"YouTube 메타데이터와 장생성 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de AI: yt-genius para YouTube","fr":"Outils IA: yt-genius pour YouTube","de":"KI-Tools: yt-genius für YouTube","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: yt-genius para Metadados e Capítulos","ru":"ИИ Агенты: yt-genius для Метаданных и Глава","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: yt-genius للأوسمة والفصول","en":"yt-genius"},"description":{"zh":"yt-genius 是一个用于生成 YouTube 元数据和章节的 AI 智能工具，帮助开发者提高视频质量和用户体验","ja":"yt-genius は YouTube メタデータとチャプターを生成する AI エージェントで、開発者がビデオの品質とユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させるのに役立ちます","ko":"yt-genius는 YouTube 메타데이터와 장을 생성하는 AI 에이전트로, 개발자가 비디오 품질과 사용자 경험을 향상시키는 데 도움을 줍니다","es":"yt-genius es una herramienta de AI que genera metadatos y capítulos para videos de YouTube, mejorando la experiencia del usuario","fr":"yt-genius est un outil IA qui génère des métadonnées et des chapitres pour les vidéos YouTube, améliorant l''expérience utilisateur","de":"yt-genius ist ein KI-Tool, das Metadaten und Kapitel für YouTube-Videos erstellt, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern","pt":"O yt-genius é uma ferramenta de IA para gerar metadados e capítulos para vídeos do YouTube, simplificando o processo de edição","ru":"ИИ Агент yt-genius предназначен для генерации метаданных и глав для видео на YouTube, упрощая процесс редактирования","ar":"yt-genius هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لإنشاء أوسمة وفصول لمقاطع فيديو يوتيوب، مما يبسط عملية التحرير","en":"YouTube Genius skill for generating metadata and chapters."},"definition":{"en":"YouTube Genius skill for generating metadata and chapters."},"features":{"zh":["自动生成 YouTube 元数据","支持章节生成","提高视频质量和用户体验","易于使用的 API 接口","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["YouTube メタデータの自動生成","チャプター生成のサポート","ビデオの品質とユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上","簡単な API インターフェース","多くのプログラミング言語をサポート"],"ko":["YouTube 메타데이터 자동 생성","장 생성 지원","비디오 품질과 사용자 경험 향상","쉽게 사용할 수 있는 API 인터페이스","다수의 프로그래밍 언어 지원"],"es":["Generación automática de metadatos","Creación de capítulos personalizados","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario","Integración con la API de YouTube","Compatibilidad con múltiples formatos de video"],"fr":["Génération automatique de métadonnées","Création de chapitres personnalisés","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Intégration avec l''API YouTube","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats de vidéo"],"de":["Automatische Erstellung von Metadaten","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Kapiteln","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Integration mit der YouTube-API","Unterstützung mehrerer Videoformate"],"pt":["Geração de metadados para vídeos do YouTube","Criação de capítulos personalizados","Integração com a API do YouTube","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de vídeo","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Генерация метаданных для видео на YouTube","Создание пользовательских глав","Интеграция с API YouTube","Поддержка нескольких форматов видео","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс"],"ar":["إنشاء أوسمة لمقاطع فيديو يوتيوب","إنشاء فصول مخصصة","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات يوتيوب","دعم عدة صيغ فيديو","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 yt-genius","什么是 YouTube 元数据","yt-genius 替代品","yt-genius 安装","YouTube 章节生成","AI 智能工具","视频质量优化","用户体验改善"],"ja":["yt-genius の使い方","YouTube メタデータとは","yt-genius の代替","yt-genius のインストール","YouTube チャプター生成","AI エージェント","ビデオの品質最適化","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの改善"],"ko":["yt-genius 사용법","YouTube 메타데이터란","yt-genius 대체품","yt-genius 설치","YouTube 장 생성","AI 에이전트","비디오 품질 최적화","사용자 경험 개선"],"es":["herramientas de AI para YouTube","cómo usar yt-genius","yt-genius alternativa","yt-genius vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de yt-genius","guía de configuración de yt-genius","mejora de la experiencia del usuario en YouTube","generación de metadatos para YouTube","creación de capítulos para YouTube"],"fr":["outils IA pour YouTube","comment utiliser yt-genius","yt-genius alternative","yt-genius vs autres outils IA","installation de yt-genius","guide de configuration de yt-genius","amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur sur YouTube","génération de métadonnées pour YouTube","création de chapitres pour YouTube"],"de":["KI-Tools für YouTube","wie man yt-genius verwendet","yt-genius Alternative","yt-genius vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von yt-genius","Einrichtungsanleitung für yt-genius","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung auf YouTube","Erstellung von Metadaten für YouTube","Erstellung von Kapiteln für YouTube"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para youtube","como usar yt-genius","o que é yt-genius","yt-genius vs tubebuddy","yt-genius instalação","yt-genius guia de configuração","melhores ferramentas de ia para youtube","yt-genius alternativa"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ для YouTube","как использовать yt-genius","что такое yt-genius","yt-genius vs tubebuddy","установка yt-genius","руководство по настройке yt-genius","лучшие инструменты ИИ для YouTube","альтернатива yt-genius"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ليوتيوب","كيفية استخدام yt-genius","ما هو yt-genius","yt-genius مقابل tubebuddy","تثبيت yt-genius","دليل إعداد yt-genius","أفضل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ليوتيوب","بديل yt-genius"]}},"owner":"peterfriese","repo":"yt-genius-skill","repoPath":"peterfriese/yt-genius-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.133Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"yt-genius","description":"Expertise in YouTube video optimization, generating metadata (titles, descriptions, chapters, SEO), and repurposing content for social media. Use when the user wants to write titles, descriptions, hashtags, or social posts for a video or script.","bodyPreview":"# YouTube Genius\n\nYou are a YouTube growth expert and content strategist. Your goal is to help the user maximize the reach and engagement of their video content.\n\n## Capabilities\n1.  **Metadata Generation**: Create click-worthy titles, SEO-optimized descriptions, timestamped chapters, info cards, and relevant hashtags.\n2.  **Social Media Repurposing**: Draft posts for Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, and YouTube Community.\n3.  **Content Analysis**: Identify potential \"Shorts\" seg","body":"# YouTube Genius\n\nYou are a YouTube growth expert and content strategist. Your goal is to help the user maximize the reach and engagement of their video content.\n\n## Capabilities\n1.  **Metadata Generation**: Create click-worthy titles, SEO-optimized descriptions, timestamped chapters, info cards, and relevant hashtags.\n2.  **Social Media Repurposing**: Draft posts for Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, and YouTube Community.\n3.  **Content Analysis**: Identify potential \"Shorts\" segments and suggest \"Gemini Nano Banana\" thumbnail concepts.\n4.  **Long-form Repurposing**: Convert transcripts into deep-dive Twitter articles with hero image concepts and embedded media markers.\n\n## Input Handling\nThe user may provide:\n*   **A YouTube URL**: Use the bundled script to fetch the transcript.\n*   **A Document/Text**: The user might provide a script or blog post directly, or point to a file/resource. If they point to a file, READ IT FIRST using your available tools (e.g., `read_resource`, `view_file`) before proceeding.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Get Content\n*   **If URL**: Run `scripts/get_transcript.py <url>`.\n    *   If successful, use the transcript text.\n    *   If it fails, ask the user if they can provide the transcript manually or a file.\n*   **If Document/Text**: Ensure you have read the full content.\n\n### Step 2: Analyze\n*   Identify the core value proposition (the \"Hook\").\n*   Summarize key takeaways.\n*   Analyze the tone (Educational, Entertaining, Rant, News).\n\n### Step 3: Generate Metadata\n**Titles**:\n*   Generate 5 options ranging from \"Safe/Search-based\" to \"High Click-Through Rate (CTR)/Click-baity\".\n*   *Constraint*: If user specifies a style (e.g. \"punchy\"), prioritize that.\n*   *Optimization*: Use power words, curiosity gaps, and clear value promises.\n\n**Description**:\n*   **Hook**: First 2 lines must be compelling (visible above the fold).\n*   **About**: 2-3 paragraphs summarizing the video with SEO keywords naturally integrated.\n*   **Resources**: A dedicated list of links mentioned in the video or relevant documentation. Use placeholders if specific URLs aren''t known (e.g., `[LINK TO FIREBASE DOCS]`).\n*   **Chapters**:\n    *   Generate timestamped chapters based on the transcript''s logical flow.\n    *   *Critical Requirement*: You MUST use the exact timestamps provided in the transcript for the start of each chapter. Do not hallucinate or shift timestamps.\n    *   *Workflow*:\n        1.  Scan the transcript for major topic shifts.\n        2.  Identify the first timestamp for each new section.\n        3.  Format as `[MM:SS] Chapter Title`.\n*   **Hashtags**: 3-5 broad and niche hashtags mixed.\n\n**Extras**:\n*   **Info Cards**: Identify 2-5 moments (timestamped) suitable for YouTube Info Cards (iCards). Suggest the type (Video, Playlist, Link) and the content/label.\n*   **Thumbnail**: Suggest a visual concept using the \"Gemini Nano Banana\" style (colorful, abstract but relevant, high contrast).\n*   **Shorts Scouter**: Identify 1-3 segments (timestamped) that stand alone well.\n\n### Step 4: Social Media Pack (Output)\nDraft copy for:\n1.  **Twitter/X**: A hook + thread starter or a punchy single tweet.\n2.  **LinkedIn**: A structured \"mini-article\" format (Hook -> Problem -> Solution -> Call to Discussion).\n3.  **Bluesky / Threads / Mastodon**: Short, conversational style.\n4.  **Twitter Long-form Article**:\n    *   **Delegation**: Use the `./subskills/article-expert/SKILL.md` subskill to generate a premium long-form article.\n    *   **Context**: Pass the transcript and the identified \"Hook\" to the subskill.\n    *   **Outcome**: The subskill will handle image generation, clipping, and final markdown assembly.\n5.  **YouTube Community**: A poll or \"Behind the scenes\" teaser.\n\n## Rules\n*   **Voice**: Professional but engaging. Avoid generic AI fluff (\"In today''s digital landscape...\"). Beat the \"boring AI\" allegations.\n*   **Formatting**: Use bolding for emphasis. Use lists for readability.\n*   **Feedback**: Always ask if the user wants to refine the titles or adjust the tone.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:41:56.725Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing advanced YouTube metadata optimization and social media repurposing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级YouTube元数据优化和社交媒体重用功能的内容创作代理。","ja":"YouTubeメタデータの高度な最適化およびソーシャルメディアの再利用機能を必要とするコンテンツ作成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 YouTube 메타데이터 최적화 및 소셜 미디어 재사용 기능을 필요한 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de creación de contenido que necesitan una optimización avanzada de metadatos de YouTube y capacidades de reutilización de medios sociales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de création de contenu ayant besoin d''une optimisation avancée des métadonnées YouTube et de capacités de réutilisation des médias sociaux.","de":"Perfekt für Content Creation Agents, die eine erweiterte Optimierung von YouTube-Metadaten und Social-Media-Neunutzungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Criação de Conteúdo que necessitam de otimização avançada de metadados do YouTube e capacidades de reutilização de mídia social.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по созданию контента, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности оптимизации метаданных YouTube и переработки контента в социальных сетях.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين متقدم لبيانات الفيديو على يوتيوب وقدرات إعادة استخدام الوسائط الاجتماعية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate click-worthy titles, SEO-optimized descriptions, and timestamped chapters using metadata generation protocols, and repurpose content for Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads, and YouTube Community posts.","zh":"赋予代理生成点击值得的标题、SEO优化描述和时间戳章节，使用元数据生成协议，并为Twitter/X、LinkedIn、Bluesky、Mastodon、Threads和YouTube社区帖子重用内容。","ja":"メタデータ生成プロトコルを使用してクリック価値のあるタイトル、SEO最適化された説明、タイムスタンプ付きの章を生成し、Twitter/X、LinkedIn、Bluesky、Mastodon、Threads、YouTubeコミュニティの投稿のためにコンテンツを再利用するエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"메타데이터 생성 프로토콜을 사용하여 클릭 가치가 있는 제목, SEO 최적화된 설명 및 타임스탬프가 있는 장을 생성하고 Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads 및 YouTube 커뮤니티 게시물에 대한 콘텐츠를 재사용하는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar títulos atractivos, descripciones optimizadas para SEO y capítulos con marca de tiempo utilizando protocolos de generación de metadatos, y a reutilizar contenido para publicaciones de Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads y YouTube Community.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des titres attractifs, des descriptions optimisées pour le SEO et des chapitres avec horodatage en utilisant des protocoles de génération de métadonnées, et de réutiliser le contenu pour les publications Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads et YouTube Community.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, klickwürdige Titel, SEO-optimierte Beschreibungen und timestampete Kapitel mithilfe von Metadatengenerierungsprotokollen zu generieren und Inhalte für Twitter/X-, LinkedIn-, Bluesky-, Mastodon-, Threads- und YouTube-Community-Beiträge zu repurposen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem títulos atraentes, descrições otimizadas para SEO e capítulos com carimbo de data/hora usando protocolos de geração de metadados, e reutilizem o conteúdo para postagens no Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads e comunidades do YouTube.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать привлекающие внимание заголовки, описания, оптимизированные для поисковых систем, и главы с временными метками, используя протоколы генерации метаданных, а также перерабатывать контент для публикаций в Twitter/X, LinkedIn, Bluesky, Mastodon, Threads и сообществах YouTube.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من خلاله توليد عناوين جذابة ووصف محسن لتحسين محركات البحث والأفصول المحددة زمنيا باستخدام بروتوكولات توليد البيانات الوصفية، وإعادة استخدام المحتوى لنشره على تويتر/إكس، و لينكد إن، وبلوسكاي، وماستودون، وثرودز، ومجتمعات يوتيوب."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating metadata for YouTube videos","Repurposing content for cross-platform social media posts","Identifying potential ''Shorts'' segments for increased engagement"],"zh":["为YouTube视频生成元数据","为跨平台社交媒体帖子重用内容","识别潜在的''Shorts''段以提高参与度"],"ja":["YouTube動画のメタデータを生成する","クロスプラットフォームのソーシャルメディア投稿のためにコンテンツを再利用する","関与度の向上のための潜在的な''Shorts''セグメントを特定する"],"ko":["YouTube 비디오의 메타데이터 생성","크로스 플랫폼 소셜 미디어 게시물에 대한 콘텐츠 재사용","참여도 향상을 위한 잠재적인 ''Shorts'' 세그먼트 식별"],"es":["Generar metadatos para vídeos de YouTube","Reutilizar contenido para publicaciones de medios sociales en varias plataformas","Identificar segmentos potenciales de ''Shorts'' para un mayor compromiso"],"fr":["Générer des métadonnées pour les vidéos YouTube","Réutiliser le contenu pour les publications de médias sociaux sur plusieurs plateformes","Identifier les segments potentiels de ''Shorts'' pour un engagement accru"],"de":["Metadaten für YouTube-Videos generieren","Inhalte für Social-Media-Beiträge auf mehreren Plattformen repurposen","Potenzielle ''Shorts''-Segmente für erhöhtes Engagement identifizieren"],"pt":["Geração de metadados para vídeos do YouTube","Reutilização de conteúdo para postagens de mídia social em várias plataformas","Identificação de segmentos potenciais de ''Shorts'' para aumento do engajamento"],"ru":["Генерация метаданных для видео на YouTube","Переработка контента для постов в социальных сетях на разных платформах","Определение потенциальных сегментов ''Shorts'' для увеличения вовлеченности"],"ar":["توليد بيانات وصفية لفيديوهات يوتيوب","إعادة استخدام المحتوى لنشرات الوسائط الاجتماعية عبر منصات متعددة","تحديد مقاطع قصيرة محتملة لزيادة المشاركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to YouTube API for metadata generation","Limited to YouTube and specified social media platforms"],"zh":["需要访问YouTube API进行元数据生成","仅限YouTube和指定的社交媒体平台"],"ja":["メタデータ生成のためにYouTube APIへのアクセスが必要","YouTubeと指定されたソーシャルメディアプラットフォームのみに限定"],"ko":["메타데이터 생성을 위한 YouTube API 액세스가 필요","YouTube 및 지정된 소셜 미디어 플랫폼만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de YouTube para la generación de metadatos","Limitado a YouTube y plataformas de medios sociales especificadas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API YouTube pour la génération de métadonnées","Limité à YouTube et aux plateformes de médias sociaux spécifiées"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die YouTube-API für die Metadatengenerierung","Begrenzt auf YouTube und spezifizierte Social-Media-Plattformen"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API do YouTube para geração de metadados","Limitado ao YouTube e às plataformas de mídia social especificadas"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к API YouTube для генерации метаданных","Ограничен для YouTube и указанных платформ социальных сетей"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات يوتيوب لتوليد البيانات الوصفية","محدود ليوتيوب ومنصات الوسائط الاجتماعية المحددة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4a0e223da237e2d3a7521691233667f6002e5f80641e4a603157fa07567b2abc","qualityScore":39}');
