","de":"AI-Tools für kollaborative Entwicklung","pt":"Ferramentas de Desenvolvimento AI: wt","ru":"ИИ Агенты для разработки: wt","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين: wt","en":"wt"},"description":{"zh":"wt是一款AI工具，帮助开发者管理上下文、焦点和并行工作，适用于多项目工作流和长时间运行任务","ja":"wtは、コンテキスト、フォーカス、並列作業を管理するAIエージェントです。マルチプロジェクトワークフローと長時間実行タスクに適しています","ko":"wt는 컨텍스트, 포커스 및 병렬 작업을 관리하는 AI 에이전트입니다. 다중 프로젝트 워크플로 및 장기 실행 태스크에 적합합니다","es":"wt es una herramienta de AI Agents para gestionar contexto, enfoque y trabajo paralelo en el desarrollo asistido por IA","fr":"wt est un outil d''Agents IA pour gérer le contexte, la concentration et le travail parallèle dans le développement assisté par IA","de":"wt ist ein AI-Tool für die Verwaltung von Kontext, Fokus und paralleler Arbeit in der KI-gestützten Entwicklung","pt":"wt é uma ferramenta para gerenciar contexto, foco e trabalho paralelo em desenvolvimento assistido por IA, projetada para fluxos de trabalho multi-projeto e ...","ru":"wt - это инструмент для управления контекстом, фокусом и параллельной работой в разработке с ИИ, предназначенный для многопроектных рабочих процессов и сотру...","ar":"wt هي أداة لإدارة السياق والتركيز والعمل الموازي في التطوير المدعوم بالذكاء الاصطناعي، مصممة لتدفقات العمل متعددة المشاريع والتعاون بين البشر والذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"Tools for managing context, focus, and parallel work in AI-assisted development. Designed for multi-project workflows, long-running tasks, and human-AI colla..."},"definition":{"en":"Tools for managing context, focus, and parallel work in AI-assisted development. Designed for multi-project workflows, long-running tasks, and human-AI collaboration."},"features":{"zh":["多项目工作流管理","长时间运行任务管理","人工智能协作支持","上下文管理","焦点管理","并行工作管理"],"ja":["マルチプロジェクトワークフロー管理","長時間実行タスク管理","ヒューマンAIコラボレーションサポート","コンテキスト管理","フォーカス管理","並列作業管理"],"ko":["다중 프로젝트 워크플로 관리","장기 실행 태스크 관리","인간 AI 협력 지원","컨텍스트 관리","포커스 관리","병렬 작업 관리"],"es":["Gestión de contexto para flujos de trabajo múltiples","Colaboración humana-AI para tareas de larga duración","Herramientas para trabajo paralelo y gestión de enfoque"],"fr":["Gestion de contexte pour flux de travail multiples","Collaboration humaine-IA pour tâches de longue durée","Outils pour travail parallèle et gestion de la concentration"],"de":["Kontextverwaltung für Multiple-Workflow","Menschliche KI-Zusammenarbeit für Langzeit-Aufgaben","Tools für parallele Arbeit und Fokusverwaltung"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de contexto para desenvolvimento multi-projeto","Ferramentas para foco e produtividade em desenvolvimento assistido por IA","Suporte para tarefas de longa duração e colaboração humano-IA","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento populares como React e Node.js","Interface de linha de comando (CLI) para automação e personalização"],"ru":["Управление контекстом для многопроектной разработки","Инструменты для фокуса и производительности в разработке с ИИ","Поддержка длинных задач и сотрудничества человека и ИИ","Интеграция с популярными инструментами разработки, такими как React и Node.js","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI) для автоматизации и настройки"],"ar":["إدارة السياق لتطوير المشاريع المتعددة","أدوات للتركيز والإنتاجية في التطوير المدعوم بالذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم للمهام الطويلة والتعاون بين البشر والذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الشائعة مثل React و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) للتحكم الآلي والتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具wt","wt AI工具使用方法","什么是wt AI工具","wt AI工具替代品","wt AI工具与其他工具的比较","wt AI工具安装","wt AI工具设置指南","如何使用wt AI工具进行多项目工作流管理","wt AI工具长时间运行任务管理"],"ja":["AIエージェントwt","wt AIエージェントの使用方法","wt AIエージェントとは","wt AIエージェントの代替品","wt AIエージェントと他のツールの比較","wt AIエージェントのインストール","wt AIエージェントの設定ガイド","wt AIエージェントを使用したマルチプロジェクトワークフローの管理方法","wt AIエージェントの長時間実行タスク管理"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 wt","wt AI 에이전트 사용 방법","wt AI 에이전트是什么","wt AI 에이전트 대체품","wt AI 에이전트와 다른 도구의 비교","wt AI 에이전트 설치","wt AI 에이전트 설정 가이드","wt AI 에이전트를 사용한 다중 프로젝트 워크플로 관리 방법","wt AI 에이전트의 장기 실행 태스크 관리"],"es":["cómo utilizar AI Agents","herramientas de AI para desarrollo","wt vs otras herramientas de AI","instalación de wt","guía de configuración de wt","colaboración humana-AI en el desarrollo"],"fr":["comment utiliser les Agents IA","outils d''IA pour développement","wt vs d''autres outils d''IA","installation de wt","guide de configuration de wt","collaboration humaine-IA dans le développement"],"de":["wie man AI-Tools verwendet","AI-Tools für Entwicklung","wt vs andere AI-Tools","Installation von wt","Konfigurationsanleitung für wt","menschliche KI-Zusammenarbeit in der Entwicklung"],"pt":["ferramentas de desenvolvimento AI","wt alternative","como usar wt","o que é wt","wt vs ferramentas de desenvolvimento tradicionais","instalar wt","guia de configuração do wt"],"ru":["ИИ инструменты для разработки","wt альтернатива","как использовать wt","что такое wt","wt vs традиционные инструменты разработки","установить wt","руководство по настройке wt"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","wt بديل","كيف استخدام wt","ما هو wt","wt مقابل أدوات التطوير التقليدية","تثبيت wt","دليل إعداد wt"]}},"owner":"tatargabor","repo":"wt-tools","repoPath":"tatargabor/wt-tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.139Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"wt","description":"Manage git worktrees for parallel AI agent development. Use this when asked to create, list, open, close, or merge worktrees, or when working with wt-* commands.","bodyPreview":"# Worktree Management Skill\n\nManage git worktrees for parallel AI agent development.\n\n## Context Detection\n\nFirst, detect which mode you''re operating in:\n\n```bash\n# Check if we''re in a worktree (not the main repo)\nif git rev-parse --is-inside-work-tree &>/dev/null; then\n  BRANCH=$(git branch --show-current)\n  if [[ \"$BRANCH\" == change/* ]]; then\n    CHANGE_ID=\"${BRANCH#change/}\"\n    echo \"Running in worktree: $CHANGE_ID\"\n    MODE=\"worktree\"\n  else\n    echo \"Running in main repository\"\n    MODE=\"","body":"# Worktree Management Skill\n\nManage git worktrees for parallel AI agent development.\n\n## Context Detection\n\nFirst, detect which mode you''re operating in:\n\n```bash\n# Check if we''re in a worktree (not the main repo)\nif git rev-parse --is-inside-work-tree &>/dev/null; then\n  BRANCH=$(git branch --show-current)\n  if [[ \"$BRANCH\" == change/* ]]; then\n    CHANGE_ID=\"${BRANCH#change/}\"\n    echo \"Running in worktree: $CHANGE_ID\"\n    MODE=\"worktree\"\n  else\n    echo \"Running in main repository\"\n    MODE=\"main\"\n  fi\nfi\n```\n\n## Central Control Commands\n\nUse these from the main repository to manage worktrees.\n\n### List Worktrees\n\n```bash\nwt-list\n```\n\nList all active worktrees with their change IDs and paths.\n\nTo see remote branches available for checkout:\n```bash\nwt-list --remote\n```\n\n### Create New Worktree\n\n```bash\nwt-new <change-id>\n```\n\nCreates a new worktree at `../<project>-<change-id>/` with branch `change/<change-id>`.\n\nIf the branch exists on remote, it will be checked out and tracked automatically.\n\nTo force create a new branch even if remote exists:\n```bash\nwt-new <change-id> --new\n```\n\n### Open Worktree for Work\n\n```bash\nwt-work <change-id>\n```\n\nOpens the worktree in Zed editor with Claude Code. This launches a new agent session in that worktree context.\n\nTo open in terminal instead:\n```bash\nwt-work <change-id> --terminal\n```\n\n### Close Worktree\n\n```bash\nwt-close <change-id>\n```\n\nRemoves the worktree. Interactive mode asks what to do with the branch:\n1. Keep branch (can reopen later)\n2. Delete local branch only\n3. Delete local and remote branch\n\nNon-interactive options:\n```bash\nwt-close <change-id> --keep-branch      # Keep the branch\nwt-close <change-id> --delete-remote    # Delete both local and remote\n```\n\n### Merge Worktree\n\n```bash\nwt-merge <change-id>\n```\n\nMerges the worktree branch into the target branch (default: main/master).\n\nOptions:\n```bash\nwt-merge <change-id> --target develop   # Merge to specific branch\nwt-merge <change-id> --no-delete        # Keep branch after merge\n```\n\n## Self-Control Commands\n\nUse these from within a worktree to manage your own state.\n\n### Push Current Branch\n\n```bash\ngit push -u origin $(git branch --show-current)\n```\n\nPushes the current branch to remote and sets up tracking.\n\n### Get Current Change ID\n\n```bash\nCHANGE_ID=$(git branch --show-current | sed ''s|change/||'')\necho \"Current change: $CHANGE_ID\"\n```\n\n### Close Own Worktree\n\nFrom within a worktree, you cannot directly close it (the directory is in use). Instead:\n\n1. Commit and push your changes\n2. Exit the agent session\n3. From main repo, run: `wt-close <change-id>`\n\nOr instruct the user:\n```\nTo close this worktree after I exit:\n  cd <main-repo-path>\n  wt-close <change-id>\n```\n\n### Merge Own Work\n\n```bash\nCHANGE_ID=$(git branch --show-current | sed ''s|change/||'')\nwt-merge \"$CHANGE_ID\"\n```\n\nThis will merge your current branch to the target and optionally close the worktree.\n\n## Workflow Examples\n\n### Central Agent: Create and Delegate Work\n\n```bash\n# List current work items\nwt-list\n\n# Create new worktree for a task\nwt-new fix-login-bug\n\n# Open agent in that worktree\nwt-work fix-login-bug\n```\n\n### Worktree Agent: Complete and Hand Off\n\n```bash\n# Check current context\ngit branch --show-current  # -> change/fix-login-bug\n\n# Do work...\n# ...\n\n# Push changes\ngit push -u origin change/fix-login-bug\n\n# Report back to user that work is ready for merge\necho \"Work complete. To merge: wt-merge fix-login-bug\"\n```\n\n### Full Lifecycle\n\n```bash\n# 1. Central agent creates worktree\nwt-new implement-feature\n\n# 2. Central agent opens worktree for work\nwt-work implement-feature\n\n# 3. Worktree agent does the work, pushes\ngit add -A && git commit -m \"Implement feature\"\ngit push -u origin change/implement-feature\n\n# 4. Central agent merges when ready\nwt-merge implement-feature\n\n# 5. Worktree is cleaned up automatically (or use wt-close)\n```\n\n## Project Health Audit\n\n### Scan Project Health\n\n```bash\nwt-audit scan              # Human-readable report\nwt-audit scan --json       # Machine-readable JSON\nwt-audit scan --condensed  # Summary line only\n```\n\nScans 6 project health dimensions:\n- **Claude Code Config** — permissions, hooks, agents, rules\n- **Design Documentation** — docs/design/*.md coverage\n- **OpenSpec Config** — config.yaml context population\n- **Code Quality Signals** — large files, unused code tooling\n- **CLAUDE.md Structure** — conventions, managed sections\n- **Gitignore Coverage** — sensitive file patterns\n\nOutput includes evidence (what exists), delta (✅/⚠️/❌), and guidance (source pointers for what the LLM should READ to create missing content).\n\n### Interactive Remediation\n\nUse `/wt:audit` to scan and interactively address gaps. The skill runs the scan, presents findings, and helps create project-specific content by reading the actual codebase — not templates.\n\n## Orchestration Supervisor\n\n### Sentinel (Agent Mode)\n\nUse `/wt:sentinel` to start and supervise a `wt-orchestrate` run with intelligent monitoring. The agent starts the orchestrator in background, polls state every 15s, and makes decisions on crashes (log diagnosis), checkpoints (auto-approve periodic), and completion (summary report).\n\n```bash\n/wt:sentinel                                    # basic supervision\n/wt:sentinel --spec docs/v5.md --max-parallel 3 # with options\n```\n\n### Sentinel (Bash Fallback)\n\nFor environments without Claude agent access:\n\n```bash\nwt-sentinel                                      # basic crash recovery\nwt-sentinel --spec docs/v5.md --max-parallel 3   # with options\n```\n\nSee `docs/sentinel.md` for full documentation.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:43:23.163Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Multi-Project Agents needing efficient git worktree management for parallel development and human-AI collaboration.","zh":"适用于需要高效git工作树管理的多项目代理，用于并行开发和人工智能协作。","ja":"マルチプロジェクトエージェントが並列開発と人間とAIのコラボレーションに高いgitワークツリーマネージメントを必要とする場合に最適。","ko":"병렬 개발과 인간-AI 협력에 효율적인 git 작업 트리 관리가 필요한 다중 프로젝트 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Multi-Proyecto que necesitan una gestión eficiente de git worktree para desarrollo paralelo y colaboración humano-AI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de multi-projets ayant besoin d''une gestion efficace de git worktree pour le développement parallèle et la collaboration humain-AI.","de":"Perfekt für Multi-Projekt-Agenten, die eine effiziente git worktree-Verwaltung für parallele Entwicklung und menschliche KI-Zusammenarbeit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Multi-Projeto que necessitam de gerenciamento eficiente do git worktree para desenvolvimento paralelo e colaboração humano-AI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Мультипроектных Агентов, требующих эффективного управления git worktree для параллельной разработки и сотрудничества человека и ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل متعدد المشاريع الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة فعالة لشجرة العمل git من أجل التطوير الموازي والتعاون بين الإنسان والذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage git worktrees for parallel AI agent development, utilizing context detection and branch management with git rev-parse and git branch commands, facilitating seamless human-AI collaboration and multi-project workflows.","zh":"赋予代理管理git工作树以实现并行AI代理开发，利用上下文检测和分支管理，使用git rev-parse和git分支命令，实现无缝的人类-AI协作和多项目工作流。","ja":"エージェントにgitワークツリーを管理させて並列AIエージェント開発を実現する。コンテキスト検出とブランチ管理を使用し、git rev-parseとgitブランチコマンドを利用して、無縫の人とAIのコラボレーションとマルチプロジェクトワークフローを実現する。","ko":"에이전트가 git 작업 트리를 관리하여 병렬 AI 에이전트 개발을 가능하게 하며, 컨텍스트 감지 및 브랜치 관리를 사용하고 git rev-parse 및 git 브랜치 명령을 사용하여 인간-AI 협력과 다중 프로젝트 워크플로를 원활하게 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar git worktrees para el desarrollo paralelo de agentes de AI, utilizando la detección de contexto y la gestión de ramas con los comandos git rev-parse y git branch, facilitando una colaboración humana-AI sin problemas y flujos de trabajo de multi-proyecto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les git worktrees pour le développement parallèle d''agents d''IA, en utilisant la détection de contexte et la gestion de branches avec les commandes git rev-parse et git branch, facilitant une collaboration humaine-IA sans problème et des flux de travail multi-projets.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, git worktrees für die parallele Entwicklung von KI-Agenten zu verwalten, unter Verwendung von Kontexterkennung und Branch-Verwaltung mit git rev-parse- und git branch-Befehlen, um eine nahtlose menschliche KI-Zusammenarbeit und Multi-Projekt-Workflows zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar worktrees do git para o desenvolvimento paralelo do agente de IA, utilizando detecção de contexto e gerenciamento de branch com comandos git rev-parse e git branch, facilitando a colaboração humana-IA e fluxos de trabalho de vários projetos sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять worktree git для параллельной разработки агента ИИ, используя обнаружение контекста и управление ветками с помощью команд git rev-parse и git branch, обеспечивая беспрепятственное сотрудничество человека и ИИ и рабочие процессы нескольких проектов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة شجرة العمل git من أجل تطوير عميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الموازي، باستخدام اكتشاف السياق وإدارة الفروع باستخدام أوامر git rev-parse و git branch، و تسهيل التعاون بين الإنسان والذكاء الاصطناعي والتدفقات العملية متعددة المشاريع بشكل متماسك."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing multiple project branches simultaneously","Automating worktree setup for new change IDs","Debugging worktree-specific issues with git rev-parse"],"zh":["同时管理多个项目分支","自动设置新的更改ID的工作树","使用git rev-parse调试工作树特定问题"],"ja":["複数のプロジェクトブランチを同時に管理する","新しい変更IDのワークツリーを自動設定する","git rev-parseを使用してワークツリー固有の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["동시에 여러 프로젝트 브랜치를 관리하는 것","새로운 변경 ID에 대한 작업 트리 설정을 자동화하는 것","git rev-parse를 사용하여 작업 트리 관련 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Gestión de varias ramas de proyecto simultáneamente","Automatización de la configuración del worktree para nuevos IDs de cambio","Depuración de problemas específicos del worktree con git rev-parse"],"fr":["Gestion de plusieurs branches de projet simultanément","Automatisation de la configuration du worktree pour les nouveaux ID de modification","Débogage des problèmes spécifiques du worktree avec git rev-parse"],"de":["Verwaltung mehrerer Projektzweige gleichzeitig","Automatisierung der Worktree-Konfiguration für neue Änderungs-IDs","Fehlerbehebung bei worktree-spezifischen Problemen mit git rev-parse"],"pt":["Gerenciar várias branches de projeto simultaneamente","Automatizar a configuração do worktree para novos IDs de alteração","Depurar problemas específicos do worktree com git rev-parse"],"ru":["Управлять несколькими ветками проекта одновременно","Автоматизировать настройку worktree для новых идентификаторов изменений","Отладить проблемы, специфичные для worktree, с помощью git rev-parse"],"ar":["إدارة فروع متعددة للمشروع في نفس الوقت","توفير إعداد شجرة العمل بشكل تلقائي لأرقام التعريف للتغييرات الجديدة","تصحيح الأخطاء المتعلقة بشجرة العمل باستخدام git rev-parse"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git installation and configuration","Limited to git worktree management"],"zh":["需要git安装和配置","仅限git工作树管理"],"ja":["gitのインストールと設定が必要","gitワークツリーマネージメントに限定"],"ko":["git 설치 및 구성이 필요함","git 작업 트리 관리에만 محدود"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de git","Limitado a la gestión de git worktree"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de git","Limité à la gestion de git worktree"],"de":["Benötigt Installation und Konfiguration von git","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von git worktree"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do git","Limitado ao gerenciamento do worktree do git"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки git","Ограничен управлением worktree git"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين git","محدود بإدارة شجرة العمل git"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"078c4a34e01d5e8b6528ba72b209378725704b8