nstack alternative","release-funstack vs react-router","installation de release-funstack","guide de configuration de release-funstack","bibliothèque de routage react","navigation api"],"de":["wie man release-funstack verwendet","was ist release-funstack","release-funstack alternative","release-funstack vs react-router","installation von release-funstack","konfigurationsanleitung für release-funstack","react-router-bibliothek","navigation api"],"pt":["Release Funstack","Biblioteca de router","Navigation API","React","Routers","Bibliotecas de router"],"ru":["Release Funstack","Библиотека роутера","Navigation API","React","Роутеры","Библиотеки роутеров"],"ar":["Release Funstack","مكتبة راوتر","Navigation API","React","راوترات","مكتبات راوترات"]}},"owner":"uhyo","repo":"funstack-router","repoPath":"uhyo/funstack-router","stars":43,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T14:03:12Z","topics":["react","router"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-funstack","description":"A skill to make a GitHub release for the `@funstack/router` package. Use this skill when the user wants to release a new version of the package.","bodyPreview":"# Release FUNSTACK Skill\n\nTo release a new version of the `@funstack/router` package, follow these steps:\n\n1. Read the `packages/router/package.json` file to determine the current version of the package.\n\n- User may or may not have already updated the version in `package.json`. Ask the user to confirm if they have updated the version. If not, you should update the version based on semantic versioning rules (patch, minor, major) as per user''s instruction.\n\n2. Update the version in `packages/route","body":"# Release FUNSTACK Skill\n\nTo release a new version of the `@funstack/router` package, follow these steps:\n\n1. Read the `packages/router/package.json` file to determine the current version of the package.\n\n- User may or may not have already updated the version in `package.json`. Ask the user to confirm if they have updated the version. If not, you should update the version based on semantic versioning rules (patch, minor, major) as per user''s instruction.\n\n2. Update the version in `packages/router/package.json`, commit and push if necessary.\n\n- The commit message should be `chore: bump version to x.y.z` where `x.y.z` is the new version.\n\n3. Inspect the git log since the last release tag to generate release notes.\n\n- The release notes should summarize the changes made since the last release.\n- Especially, highlight any breaking changes, new features, or important fixes.\n\n4. Use the `gh` CLI to create a new release on GitHub with the new version and the generated release notes.\n\n- The tag name should be `x.y.z` where `x.y.z` is the new version.\n\n5. Inform the user that the release has been created successfully, providing the URL to the release page on GitHub.\n\n## Writing Release Notes\n\nWhen writing release notes, consider the following structure:\n\n```markdown\n## What''s Changed\n\n### Breaking Changes\n\n- Change the `onNavigate` signature to accept an `OnNavigateInfo` object instead of the matched array. (#52)\n\n### Features\n\n- Add new hooks `useRouteParams`, `useRouteState` and `useRouteData` for type-safe state management (#50)\n\n### Improvements\n\n- Improve route matching performance by optimizing the matching algorithm (#20)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/uhyo/funstack-router/compare/0.0.1...0.0.2\n```\n\nNotes:\n\n- Highlight breaking changes if any.\n- Group changes into categories like \"Features\", \"Improvements\", \"Fixes\", etc.\n- Documentation updates and dependency updates should be omitted unless they are significant (e.g. breaking changes).\n- Provide a link to the full changelog comparing the previous version and the new version.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:30:27.285Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for JavaScript Agents involved in package management and versioning, particularly those utilizing the Navigation API and semantic versioning rules.","zh":"Ideal for JavaScript Agents involved in package management and versioning, particularly those utilizing the Navigation API and semantic versioning rules.","ja":"Ideal for JavaScript Agents involved in package management and versioning, particularly those utilizing the Navigation API and semantic versioning rules.","ko":"Ideal for JavaScript Agents involved in package management and versioning, particularly those utilizing the Navigation API and semantic versioning rules.","es":"Ideal para agentes de JavaScript involucrados en la gestión de paquetes y versiones, particularmente aquellos que utilizan la Navigation API y reglas de versiones semánticas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents JavaScript impliqués dans la gestion de packages et de versions, en particulier ceux qui utilisent la Navigation API et les règles de versionnage sémantique.","de":"Ideal für JavaScript-Agents, die an Paketverwaltung und Versionierung beteiligt sind, insbesondere solche, die die Navigation API und semantische Versionsregeln nutzen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes JavaScript envolvidos em gerenciamento de pacotes e versionamento, particularmente aqueles que utilizam a Navigation API e regras de versionamento semântico.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов JavaScript, участвующих в управлении пакетами и версиями, особенно тех, которые используют Navigation API и семантические правила версионирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل جافا سكريبت المشارك في إدارة الحزم وتحديث الإصدار، خاصة تلك التي تستخدم Navigation API وقواعد النسخ الإصدارية الدلالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage and release new versions of the @funstack/router package, leveraging the Router library and adhering to semantic versioning principles, while interacting with package.json files and updating versions based on patch, minor, or major release instructions.","zh":"Empowers agents to manage and release new versions of the @funstack/router package, leveraging the Router library and adhering to semantic versioning principles, while interacting with package.json files and updating versions based on patch, minor, or major release instructions.","ja":"Empowers agents to manage and release new versions of the @funstack/router package, leveraging the Router library and adhering to semantic versioning principles, while interacting with package.json files and updating versions based on patch, minor, or major release instructions.","ko":"Empowers agents to manage and release new versions of the @funstack/router package, leveraging the Router library and adhering to semantic versioning principles, while interacting with package.json files and updating versions based on patch, minor, or major release instructions.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar y publicar nuevas versiones del paquete @funstack/router, aprovechando la biblioteca Router y siguiendo los principios de versiones semánticas, mientras interactúa con archivos package.json y actualiza versiones según las instrucciones de lanzamiento de parches, menores o principales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer et de publier de nouvelles versions du package @funstack/router, en exploitant la bibliothèque Router et en suivant les principes de versionnage sémantique, tout en interagissant avec les fichiers package.json et en mettant à jour les versions en fonction des instructions de publication de correctifs, mineurs ou majeurs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, neue Versionen des @funstack/router-Pakets zu verwalten und zu veröffentlichen, indem es die Router-Bibliothek nutzt und semantische Versionsprinzipien befolgt, während es mit package.json-Dateien interagiert und Versionen basierend auf Patch-, Minor- oder Major-Release-Anweisungen aktualisiert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar e lançar novas versões do pacote @funstack/router, utilizando a biblioteca Router e seguindo os princípios de versionamento semântico, enquanto interage com arquivos package.json e atualiza versões com base em instruções de lançamento de patch, menor ou maior.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять и выпускать новые версии пакета @funstack/router, используя библиотеку Router и соблюдая принципы семантического версионирования, а также взаимодействуя с файлами package.json и обновляя версии на основе инструкций по выпуску патчей, минорных или мажорных релизов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إدارة وإصدار إصدارات جديدة من حزمة @funstack/router، مستخدمًا مكتبة Router ومتّبعًا مبادئ النسخ الإصدارية الدلالية، في الوقت الذي يتفاعل مع ملفات package.json ويعمل على تحديث الإصدارات بناءً على تعليمات إصدار التصحيحات أو الإصدارات الثانوية أو الرئيسية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating version updates in package.json files","Managing releases of the @funstack/router package","Updating package versions based on semantic versioning rules"],"zh":["Automating version updates in package.json files","Managing releases of the @funstack/router package","Updating package versions based on semantic versioning rules"],"ja":["Automating version updates in package.json files","Managing releases of the @funstack/router package","Updating package versions based on semantic versioning rules"],"ko":["Automating version updates in package.json files","Managing releases of the @funstack/router package","Updating package versions based on semantic versioning rules"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de versiones en archivos package.json","Gestionar lanzamientos del paquete @funstack/router","Actualizar versiones de paquetes según reglas de versiones semánticas"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de versions dans les fichiers package.json","Gérer les publications du package @funstack/router","Mettre à jour les versions de packages en fonction des règles de versionnage sémantique"],"de":["Automatisieren von Versionsupdates in package.json-Dateien","Verwalten von Releases des @funstack/router-Pakets","Aktualisieren von Paketversionen basierend auf semantischen Versionsregeln"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de versão em arquivos package.json","Gerenciar lançamentos do pacote @funstack/router","Atualizar versões de pacotes com base em regras de versionamento semântico"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления версий в файлах package.json","Управлять выпусками пакета @funstack/router","Обновлять версии пакетов на основе семантических правил версионирования"],"ar":["تأتمتة تحديثات الإصدار في ملفات package.json","إدارة إصدارات حزمة @funstack/router","تحديث إصدارات الحزم بناءً على قواعد النسخ الإصدارية الدلالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to package.json files","Limited to managing versions of the @funstack/router package","Dependent on user input for version update instructions"],"zh":["Requires access to package.json files","Limited to managing versions of the @funstack/router package","Dependent on user input for version update instructions"],"ja":["Requires access to package.json files","Limited to managing versions of the @funstack/router package","Dependent on user input for version update instructions"],"ko":["Requires access to package.json files","Limited to managing versions of the @funstack/router package","Dependent on user input for version update instructions"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos package.json","Limitado a la gestión de versiones del paquete @funstack/router","Dependiente de la entrada del usuario para las instrucciones de actualización de versiones"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers package.json","Limité à la gestion des versions du package @funstack/router","Dépend de la saisie de l''utilisateur pour les instructions de mise à jour de version"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf package.json-Dateien","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von Versionen des @funstack/router-Pakets","Abhängig von Benutzereingaben für Versionsupdate-Anweisungen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos package.json","Limitado a gerenciar versões do pacote @funstack/router","Dependente da entrada do usuário para instruções de atualização de versão"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам package.json","Ограничен управлением версиями пакета @funstack/router","Зависит от ввода пользователя для инструкций по обновлению версии"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات package.json","محدود بتحديث إصدارات حزمة @funstack/router","يعتمد على مدخلات المستخدم لتعليمات تحديث الإصدار"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7f90a61240242a2e4483a216eb19a875411c76d8682863479c4ff092740dc405","qualityScore":38}');
