vs أدوات أخرى"]}},"owner":"cacack","repo":"my-family","repoPath":"cacack/my-family","stars":0,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T22:51:39Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"audit-domain","description":"Domain audit — GPS compliance, person/relationship modeling, GEDCOM fidelity","bodyPreview":"# Domain / Genealogy Audit\n\nYou are a **Professional Genealogist** auditing the domain model for genealogical correctness and standards compliance.\n\n## What to Do\n\nRead the domain model and GEDCOM handling code, then evaluate against genealogical standards.\n\n### Step 1: Load Context\n\nRead these files:\n- `docs/ETHOS.md` — mission and differentiators\n- `docs/ARCHITECTURAL-INVARIANTS.md` — domain model invariants (DM-* and DI-*)\n- `docs/INTEGRATION-MATRIX.md` — entity completeness status\n\n### Step","body":"# Domain / Genealogy Audit\n\nYou are a **Professional Genealogist** auditing the domain model for genealogical correctness and standards compliance.\n\n## What to Do\n\nRead the domain model and GEDCOM handling code, then evaluate against genealogical standards.\n\n### Step 1: Load Context\n\nRead these files:\n- `docs/ETHOS.md` — mission and differentiators\n- `docs/ARCHITECTURAL-INVARIANTS.md` — domain model invariants (DM-* and DI-*)\n- `docs/INTEGRATION-MATRIX.md` — entity completeness status\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Person Model\n\nRead `internal/domain/` for person-related types:\n- Check name structure (given, surname, prefix, suffix, nickname support)\n- Check gender handling (enum values, extensibility)\n- Check if multiple name forms are supported (maiden, married, etc.)\n- Verify UUID-based identity (invariant DM-001)\n- Check for Validate() methods (invariant DM-002)\n\n### Step 3: Analyze Relationship Model\n\nRead family/relationship types in `internal/domain/`:\n- Check relationship typing (biological, adopted, step, foster)\n- Verify directional relationships are queryable\n- Look for edge case handling (unknown parentage, complex families)\n\n### Step 4: Analyze Date Handling\n\nSearch for date-related types:\n- Check for genealogical date types (exact, approximate, range, before/after, between)\n- Check for partial date support (year-only, month-year)\n- Look for calendar system considerations\n\n### Step 5: Analyze GEDCOM Handling\n\nRead `internal/gedcom/`:\n- Check import for data preservation (invariant DI-003 — lossless import)\n- Check export for valid GEDCOM output\n- Look for round-trip testing\n- Check edge case handling (Unicode, non-standard tags, large files)\n\n### Step 6: Analyze Citation/Source Model\n\nSearch for source/citation types:\n- Check if citations can attach to specific claims (not just people)\n- Look for source/repository/citation distinction\n- Evaluate against Evidence Explained patterns\n\n### Step 7: Check GPS Support\n\nEvaluate whether the data model supports the 5 GPS elements:\n1. Reasonably exhaustive search\n2. Complete citations\n3. Analysis and correlation\n4. Resolution of conflicts\n5. Soundly written conclusion\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Domain / Genealogy Audit Report\n\n#### Scorecard\n\n| Dimension | Score (0-5) | Notes |\n|-----------|-------------|-------|\n| GPS Support | | |\n| Person Model | | |\n| Relationship Model | | |\n| Date Handling | | |\n| Place Handling | | |\n| GEDCOM Fidelity | | |\n| Citation Model | | |\n\n#### Top Findings\n\nList up to 10 findings, risk-ranked. For each:\n- **Severity**: Critical / High / Medium / Low\n- **Category**: Which dimension\n- **Finding**: One-sentence summary\n- **Evidence**: Specific files, functions, line numbers\n- **Impact**: What breaks if unaddressed\n- **Suggestion**: Concrete fix\n\n#### Issue-Ready Tickets\n\nUp to 5 GitHub-issue-ready items with title, description, acceptance criteria, affected files.\n\n#### Manual Verification\n\nUp to 5 items requiring human judgment.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T04:15:43.337Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Graph Agents needing advanced genealogical data validation and standards compliance.","zh":"非常适合需要高级家谱数据验证和标准合规性的知识图谱代理。","ja":"高度な家系図データの検証と標準の準拠が必要な知識グラフエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 가계도 데이터 검증 및 표준 준수성이 필요한 지식 그래프 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gráficos de Conocimiento que necesitan una validación de datos genealógicos avanzada y cumplimiento de normas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Graphique de Connaissance ayant besoin d''une validation de données généalogiques avancée et d''un respect des normes.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensgraphen-Agents, die eine erweiterte Validierung von genealogischen Daten und eine Einhaltung von Standards benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gráficos de Conhecimento que necessitam de validação de dados genealógicos avançada e conformidade com normas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов графов знаний, требующих передовой проверки генеалогических данных и соответствия стандартам.","ar":"مثالي لعمیلات رسوم المعرفة التي تحتاج إلى التحقق المتقدم من البيانات الجينية والامتثال للمعايير."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to evaluate domain models against genealogical standards, ensuring GEDCOM handling code compliance and validating entity completeness through ETHOS mission and architectural invariants.","zh":"赋予代理评估领域模型以符合家系图标准，确保GEDCOM处理代码合规性并通过ETHOS使命和架构不变式验证实体的完整性。","ja":"エージェントがドメインモデルを家系図の標準に従って評価できるようにし、GEDCOMハンドリングコードのコンプライアンスを確保し、ETHOSミッションとアーキテクチャの不変式を通じてエンティティの完全性を検証します。","ko":"에이전트가 도메인 모델을 가계도 표준에 따라 평가할 수 있도록 하여 GEDCOM 처리 코드의 준수성을 보장하고 ETHOS 미션 및 아키텍처 불변식을 통해 엔티티의 완전성을 검증합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evaluar modelos de dominio frente a estándares genealógicos, garantizando el cumplimiento del código de manejo de GEDCOM y validando la complejidad de las entidades a través de la misión ETHOS y las invariantes arquitectónicas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer les modèles de domaine par rapport aux normes généalogiques, garantissant ainsi le respect du code de manipulation de GEDCOM et la validation de l''exhaustivité des entités à travers la mission ETHOS et les invariants architecturaux.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Domänenmodelle gegenüber genealogischen Standards zu bewerten, sicherzustellen, dass GEDCOM-Handhabungscode-Compliance und Validierung von Entitätvollständigkeit durch die ETHOS-Mission und architektonische Invarianten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar modelos de domínio contra padrões genealógicos, garantindo o cumprimento do código de tratamento do GEDCOM e validando a completude das entidades por meio da missão ETHOS e invariantes arquitetônicos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценивать модели домена по отношению к генеалогическим стандартам, обеспечивая соблюдение кода обработки GEDCOM и проверку полноты сущностей посредством миссии ETHOS и архитектурных инвариантов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تقييم نماذج المجال مقابل المعايير الجينية، وضمان امتثال код معالجة GEDCOM والتحقق من اكتمال الكيانات من خلال مهمة ETHOS والثوابت المعمارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing domain models for genealogical correctness","Validating GEDCOM handling code against standards","Evaluating entity completeness status"],"zh":["审计领域模型的家系图正确性","验证GEDCOM处理代码是否符合标准","评估实体的完整性状态"],"ja":["ドメインモデルの家系図の正しさを監査する","GEDCOMハンドリングコードを標準に従って検証する","エンティティの完全性状態を評価する"],"ko":["도메인 모델의 가계도 정확성을 감사하는 것","GEDCOM 처리 코드를 표준에 따라 검증하는 것","엔티티의 완전성 상태를 평가하는 것"],"es":["Auditoría de modelos de dominio para la corrección genealógica","Validación del código de manejo de GEDCOM contra las normas","Evaluación del estado de complejidad de las entidades"],"fr":["Audit des modèles de domaine pour la correction généalogique","Validation du code de manipulation de GEDCOM contre les normes","Évaluation de l''état d''exhaustivité des entités"],"de":["Prüfung von Domänenmodellen auf genealogische Richtigkeit","Validierung von GEDCOM-Handhabungscode gegen Standards","Bewertung des Vollständigkeitsstatus von Entitäten"],"pt":["Auditoria de modelos de domínio para correção genealógica","Validação do código de tratamento do GEDCOM contra normas","Avaliação do status de completude das entidades"],"ru":["Аудит моделей домена для генеалогической правильности","Проверка кода обработки GEDCOM на соответствие стандартам","Оценка статуса полноты сущностей"],"ar":["تدقيق نماذج المجال لصحة الجينية","التحقق من قانون معالجة GEDCOM مقابل المعايير","تقييم حالة اكتمال الكيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to domain model documentation (ETHOS.md, ARCHITECTURAL-INVARIANTS.md, INTEGRATION-MATRIX.md)","Genealogy-specific, may not apply to other domains"],"zh":["需要访问领域模型文档（ETHOS.md, ARCHITECTURAL-INVARIANTS.md, INTEGRATION-MATRIX.md）","仅适用于家系图，可能不适用于其他领域"],"ja":["ドメインモデル文書（ETHOS.md, ARCHITECTURAL-INVARIANTS.md, INTEGRATION-MATRIX.md）へのアクセスが必要","家系図専用であり、他のドメインには適用できない可能性がある"],"ko":["도메인 모델 문서(ETHOS.md, ARCHITECTURAL-INVARIANTS.md, INTEGRATION-MATRIX.md)への 액세스가 필요","가계도 전용으로 다른 도메인에는 적용되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación del modelo de dominio (ETHOS.md, ARCHITECTURAL-INVARIANTS.md, INTEGRATION-MATRIX.md)","Específico de genealogía, puede que no se aplique a otros dominios"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation du modèle de domaine (ETHOS.md, ARCHITECTURAL-INVARIANTS.md, INTEGRATION-MATRIX.md)","Spécifique à la généalogie, peut ne pas s''appliquer à d''autres domaines"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Domänenmodell-Dokumentation (ETHOS.md, ARCHITECTURAL-INVARIANTS.md, INTEGRATION-MATRIX.md)","Spezifisch für Genealogie, kann möglicherweise nicht auf andere Domänen angewendet werden"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação do modelo de domínio (ETHOS.md, ARCHITECTURAL-INVARIANTS.md, INTEGRATION-MATRIX.md)","Específico para genealogia, pode não se aplicar a outros domínios"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации модели домена (ETHOS.md, ARCHITECTURAL-INVARIANTS.md, INTEGRATION-MATRIX.md)","Специфичен для генеалогии, может не применяться к другим доменам"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى توثيق نموذج المجال (ETHOS.md، ARCHITECTURAL-INVARIANTS.md، INTEGRATION-MATRIX.md)","خاص بالجينات، قد لا يطبق على مجالات أخرى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d340e538cf1229fd79832abb4ef3bf2e1efb509be1fc5cd6e2f7c2ea341f27d7","qualityScore":38}');
