isualizer","руководства по настройке Math-Visualizer","Math-Visualizer для разработчиков","приложения ИИ для математики","инструменты визуализации математики"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Math-Visualizer","ما هو Math-Visualizer","Math-Visualizer بديل","Math-Visualizer مقابل Manim","تثبيت Math-Visualizer","دليل إعداد Math-Visualizer","Math-Visualizer لمطوري البرامج","تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي للرياضيات","أدوات تصور الرياضيات"]}},"owner":"rohitg00","repo":"manim-video-generator","repoPath":"rohitg00/manim-video-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.887Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"math-visualizer","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Math Visualizer Skill\n\nThe Math Visualizer brings mathematical concepts to life through precise, beautiful animations that reveal the structure and relationships within mathematics.\n\n## Mathematical Domains\n\n### Supported Areas\n- **Algebra**: Equations, inequalities, polynomials\n- **Calculus**: Derivatives, integrals, limits, series\n- **Geometry**: Shapes, transformations, proofs\n- **Trigonometry**: Functions, identities, unit circle\n- **Linear Algebra**: Vectors, matrices, transformations\n- *","body":"# Math Visualizer Skill\n\nThe Math Visualizer brings mathematical concepts to life through precise, beautiful animations that reveal the structure and relationships within mathematics.\n\n## Mathematical Domains\n\n### Supported Areas\n- **Algebra**: Equations, inequalities, polynomials\n- **Calculus**: Derivatives, integrals, limits, series\n- **Geometry**: Shapes, transformations, proofs\n- **Trigonometry**: Functions, identities, unit circle\n- **Linear Algebra**: Vectors, matrices, transformations\n- **Complex Analysis**: Complex numbers, transformations\n- **Number Theory**: Primes, sequences, patterns\n\n## Rules\n\n### [rules/equation-presentation.md](rules/equation-presentation.md)\nHow to present equations with proper pacing and emphasis.\n\n### [rules/color-coding-math.md](rules/color-coding-math.md)\nConsistent color schemes for mathematical elements.\n\n### [rules/graphing-best-practices.md](rules/graphing-best-practices.md)\nCreating clear, informative function graphs.\n\n### [rules/proof-visualization.md](rules/proof-visualization.md)\nStep-by-step proof animations that build understanding.\n\n## Color Coding Standard\n\n| Element | Color | Hex |\n|---------|-------|-----|\n| Variables (x, y) | BLUE | #58C4DD |\n| Constants | YELLOW | #FFFF00 |\n| Operators | WHITE | #FFFFFF |\n| Key Terms | GREEN | #83C167 |\n| Equals/Results | GOLD | #FFD700 |\n| Negative/Subtract | RED | #FC6255 |\n\n## Templates\n\n### Equation Derivation\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass EquationDerivation(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Initial equation\n        eq1 = MathTex(r\"x^2 + 2x + 1 = 0\")\n        self.play(Write(eq1))\n        self.wait()\n\n        # Transform step by step\n        eq2 = MathTex(r\"(x + 1)^2 = 0\")\n        eq3 = MathTex(r\"x + 1 = 0\")\n        eq4 = MathTex(r\"x = -1\")\n\n        # Show each transformation\n        for new_eq in [eq2, eq3, eq4]:\n            self.play(TransformMatchingTex(eq1, new_eq))\n            self.wait()\n            eq1 = new_eq\n\n        # Highlight final answer\n        box = SurroundingRectangle(eq4, color=GREEN, buff=0.2)\n        self.play(Create(box))\n```\n\n### Color-Coded Equation\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass ColorCodedEquation(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Equation with color-coded parts\n        equation = MathTex(\n            r\"f(\", r\"x\", r\") = \", r\"a\", r\"x^2\", r\" + \", r\"b\", r\"x\", r\" + \", r\"c\"\n        )\n\n        # Color code\n        equation[1].set_color(BLUE)   # x\n        equation[3].set_color(YELLOW) # a\n        equation[4].set_color(BLUE)   # x^2\n        equation[6].set_color(YELLOW) # b\n        equation[7].set_color(BLUE)   # x\n        equation[9].set_color(YELLOW) # c\n\n        self.play(Write(equation))\n\n        # Explain each part\n        labels = [\n            (equation[3], \"coefficient\"),\n            (equation[1], \"variable\"),\n            (equation[9], \"constant\")\n        ]\n\n        for part, label_text in labels:\n            self.play(Indicate(part))\n            label = Text(label_text, font_size=24).next_to(part, DOWN)\n            self.play(Write(label))\n            self.wait()\n            self.play(FadeOut(label))\n```\n\n### Function Graph with Animation\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass FunctionGraph(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Create axes\n        axes = Axes(\n            x_range=[-4, 4, 1],\n            y_range=[-2, 8, 1],\n            x_length=8,\n            y_length=5,\n            axis_config={\"include_tip\": True}\n        )\n        labels = axes.get_axis_labels(x_label=\"x\", y_label=\"y\")\n\n        self.play(Create(axes), Write(labels))\n\n        # Function\n        func = axes.plot(lambda x: x**2, color=BLUE)\n        func_label = MathTex(r\"f(x) = x^2\", color=BLUE).to_corner(UR)\n\n        self.play(Create(func), Write(func_label))\n\n        # Show derivative\n        deriv = axes.plot(lambda x: 2*x, color=GREEN)\n        deriv_label = MathTex(r\"f''(x) = 2x\", color=GREEN).next_to(func_label, DOWN)\n\n        self.play(Create(deriv), Write(deriv_label))\n\n        # Tangent line demonstration\n        x_tracker = ValueTracker(-2)\n\n        tangent = always_redraw(lambda: axes.get_secant_slope_group(\n            x=x_tracker.get_value(),\n            graph=func,\n            dx=0.01,\n            secant_line_color=YELLOW,\n            secant_line_length=4\n        ))\n\n        dot = always_redraw(lambda: Dot(\n            axes.c2p(x_tracker.get_value(), x_tracker.get_value()**2),\n            color=RED\n        ))\n\n        self.play(Create(tangent), Create(dot))\n        self.play(x_tracker.animate.set_value(2), run_time=4)\n```\n\n### 3D Mathematical Surface\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass Surface3D(ThreeDScene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Set up camera\n        self.set_camera_orientation(phi=75 * DEGREES, theta=-45 * DEGREES)\n\n        # Create axes\n        axes = ThreeDAxes(\n            x_range=[-3, 3, 1],\n            y_range=[-3, 3, 1],\n            z_range=[-2, 2, 1]\n        )\n\n        # Create surface\n        surface = Surface(\n            lambda u, v: axes.c2p(u, v, np.sin(u) * np.cos(v)),\n            u_range=[-PI, PI],\n            v_range=[-PI, PI],\n            resolution=(30, 30),\n            fill_opacity=0.7\n        )\n        surface.set_fill_by_value(\n            axes=axes,\n            colorscale=[(RED, -1), (YELLOW, 0), (GREEN, 1)]\n        )\n\n        # Animate\n        self.play(Create(axes))\n        self.play(Create(surface), run_time=3)\n        self.begin_ambient_camera_rotation(rate=0.2)\n        self.wait(5)\n```\n\n### Geometric Proof\n```python\nfrom manim import *\n\nclass PythagoreanProof(Scene):\n    def construct(self):\n        # Create right triangle\n        triangle = Polygon(\n            ORIGIN, RIGHT * 3, RIGHT * 3 + UP * 4,\n            color=WHITE, fill_opacity=0.3\n        )\n\n        # Labels\n        a_label = MathTex(\"a\").next_to(triangle, DOWN)\n        b_label = MathTex(\"b\").next_to(triangle, RIGHT)\n        c_label = MathTex(\"c\").move_to(\n            (ORIGIN + RIGHT * 3 + UP * 4) / 2 + LEFT * 0.5 + UP * 0.3\n        )\n\n        self.play(Create(triangle))\n        self.play(Write(a_label), Write(b_label), Write(c_label))\n\n        # Show squares on each side\n        sq_a = Square(side_length=3, color=BLUE, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        sq_a.next_to(triangle, DOWN, buff=0)\n\n        sq_b = Square(side_length=4, color=GREEN, fill_opacity=0.5)\n        sq_b.next_to(triangle, RIGHT, buff=0)\n\n        self.play(Create(sq_a), Create(sq_b))\n\n        # Area labels\n        area_a = MathTex(r\"a^2\", color=BLUE).move_to(sq_a)\n        area_b = MathTex(r\"b^2\", color=GREEN).move_to(sq_b)\n\n        self.play(Write(area_a), Write(area_b))\n\n        # Conclusion\n        theorem = MathTex(r\"a^2 + b^2 = c^2\").to_edge(UP)\n        box = SurroundingRectangle(theorem, color=GOLD)\n\n        self.play(Write(theorem), Create(box))\n```\n\n## LaTeX Quick Reference\n\n### Common Expressions\n```latex\n% Fractions\n\\frac{a}{b}\n\n% Square root\n\\sqrt{x}  \\sqrt[n]{x}\n\n% Summation\n\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i\n\n% Integral\n\\int_{a}^{b} f(x) \\, dx\n\n% Limit\n\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} f(x)\n\n% Matrix\n\\begin{pmatrix} a & b \\\\ c & d \\end{pmatrix}\n\n% Partial derivative\n\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}\n```\n\n### Greek Letters\n```latex\n\\alpha \\beta \\gamma \\delta \\epsilon\n\\theta \\lambda \\mu \\pi \\sigma \\omega\n\\Gamma \\Delta \\Theta \\Lambda \\Sigma \\Omega\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Reveal equations gradually** - Build up complex equations piece by piece\n2. **Use consistent notation** - Same symbol = same meaning throughout\n3. **Annotate meaningfully** - Labels should clarify, not clutter\n4. **Show, don''t just state** - Animate the mathematical relationships\n5. **Connect to intuition** - Bridge abstract math to visual understanding\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:09:11.885Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Educational Agents needing advanced mathematical animation capabilities using Manim code and OpenAI''s GPT model.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Manim代码和OpenAI的GPT模型进行高级数学动画功能的教育代理。","ja":"ManimコードとOpenAIのGPTモデルを使用した高度な数学アニメーション機能を必要とする教育エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Manim 코드와 OpenAI의 GPT 모델을 사용하여 고급 수학 애니메이션 기능을 필요한 교육 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes educativos que necesitan capacidades de animación matemática avanzadas utilizando el código Manim y el modelo GPT de OpenAI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents éducatifs qui nécessitent des capacités d''animation mathématique avancées utilisant le code Manim et le modèle GPT d''OpenAI.","de":"Perfekt für Bildungsagenten, die erweiterte mathematische Animationsfunktionen mit Manim-Code und OpenAI-GPT-Modell benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Educacionais que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de animação matemática usando código Manim e o modelo GPT da OpenAI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для образовательных агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности математической анимации с использованием кода Manim и модели GPT от OpenAI.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التعليمية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة للرسوم المتحركة الرياضية باستخدام كود Manim ونموذج GPT من OpenAI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate precise mathematical animations using natural language descriptions, leveraging OpenAI''s GPT model to convert descriptions into Manim code, and supporting various mathematical domains such as Algebra, Calculus, and Geometry through SVG and video file formats.","zh":"赋予代理生成精确的数学动画的能力，利用OpenAI的GPT模型将描述转换为Manim代码，并支持通过SVG和视频文件格式的各种数学领域，如代数、微积分和几何。","ja":"OpenAIのGPTモデルを利用して、自然言語の説明をManimコードに変換し、SVGや動画ファイル形式を通じて代数、微積分、幾何学などの様々な数学分野をサポートすることで、エージェントが正確な数学アニメーションを生成できるようにします。","ko":"OpenAI의 GPT 모델을 활용하여 설명을 Manim 코드로 변환하고, SVG 및 비디오 파일 형식을 통해 대수학, 미적분학, 기하학 등의 다양한 수학 분야를 지원하여 에이전트가 정확한 수학 애니메이션을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar animaciones matemáticas precisas utilizando descripciones de lenguaje natural, aprovechando el modelo GPT de OpenAI para convertir descripciones en código Manim, y admitiendo varios dominios matemáticos como Álgebra, Cálculo y Geometría a través de formatos de archivo SVG y video.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des animations mathématiques précises en utilisant des descriptions de langage naturel, en exploitant le modèle GPT d''OpenAI pour convertir les descriptions en code Manim, et en prenant en charge divers domaines mathématiques tels que l''Algèbre, le Calcul et la Géométrie via des formats de fichiers SVG et vidéo.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, präzise mathematische Animationen unter Verwendung von natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen zu generieren, indem sie das GPT-Modell von OpenAI nutzen, um Beschreibungen in Manim-Code umzuwandeln und verschiedene mathematische Bereiche wie Algebra, Analysis und Geometrie über SVG- und Video-Dateiformate zu unterstützen.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerarem animações matemáticas precisas usando descrições em linguagem natural, aproveitando o modelo GPT da OpenAI para converter descrições em código Manim, e suportando vários domínios matemáticos como Álgebra, Cálculo e Geometria através de formatos de arquivo SVG e vídeo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать точные математические анимации, используя описания на естественном языке, используя модель GPT от OpenAI для преобразования описаний в код Manim, и поддерживая различные математические области, такие как Алгебра, Математический анализ и Геометрия, через форматы файлов SVG и видео.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء رسوم متحركة رياضية دقيقة باستخدام أوصاف اللغة الطبيعية، والاستفادة من نموذج GPT من OpenAI لتحويل الأوصاف إلى كود Manim، ودعم مجالات رياضية متنوعة مثل الجبر، التفاضل والتكامل، والهندسة من خلال صيغ ملفات SVG والفيديو."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating interactive algebra lessons with animated equation solving","Creating calculus visualizations for derivatives and integrals","Illustrating geometric transformations and proofs using animated diagrams"],"zh":["生成带有动画方程求解的交互式代数课程","创建用于导数和积分的微积分可视化","使用动画图表说明几何变换和证明"],"ja":["動画方程式の解決を伴うインタラクティブな代数の授業を生成する","導関数と積分のための微積分の視覚化を作成する","動画ダイアグラムを使用して幾何学的な変換と証明を説明する"],"ko":["애니메이션 방정식 풀이가 포함된 대화형 대수 수업 생성","도함수와 적분을 위한 미적분학 시각화 생성","애니메이션 다이어그램을 사용하여 기하학적 변환과 증명 설명"],"es":["Generar lecciones de álgebra interactivas con resolución de ecuaciones animadas","Crear visualizaciones de cálculo para derivadas e integrales","Ilustrar transformaciones geométricas y pruebas utilizando diagramas animados"],"fr":["Générer des leçons d''algèbre interactives avec résolution d''équations animées","Créer des visualisations de calcul pour les dérivées et les intégrales","Illustrez les transformations géométriques et les preuves en utilisant des diagrammes animés"],"de":["Interaktive Algebra-Lektionen mit animierter Gleichungslösung generieren","Visualisierungen für Ableitungen und Integrale im Bereich des Calculs erstellen","Geometrische Transformationen und Beweise mithilfe animierter Diagramme veranschaulichen"],"pt":["Geração de aulas de álgebra interativas com animação de resolução de equações","Criação de visualizações de cálculo para derivadas e integrais","Ilustração de transformações geométricas e provas usando diagramas animados"],"ru":["Генерация интерактивных уроков алгебры с анимированным решением уравнений","Создание визуализаций математического анализа для производных и интегралов","Иллюстрация геометрических преобразований и доказательств с использованием анимированных диаграмм"],"ar":["إنشاء دروس جبر تفاعلية مع رسوم متحركة لحل المعادلات","إنشاء تصورات للتفاضل والتكامل للمشتقات والتكاملات","توضيح التحويلات الهندسية والبراهين باستخدام مخططات متحركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OpenAI API Key for GPT model access","Limited to mathematical domains currently supported by Manim code","Needs specific natural language description formatting for accurate animation generation"],"zh":["需要OpenAI API密钥来访问GPT模型","仅限于Manim代码当前支持的数学领域","需要特定的自然语言描述格式以生成准确的动画"],"ja":["GPTモデルにアクセスするためにOpenAI APIキーが必要","Manimコードが現在サポートしている数学分野に限定される","正確なアニメーション生成のためには特定の自然言語の説明書式が必要"],"ko":["GPT 모델에 액세스하기 위해 OpenAI API 키가 필요","Manim 코드가 현재 지원하는 수학 분야로 제한됨","정확한 애니메이션 생성을 위해 특정 자연어 설명 형식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere una clave API de OpenAI para acceder al modelo GPT","Limitado a los dominios matemáticos actualmente admitidos por el código Manim","Necesita un formato de descripción de lenguaje natural específico para una generación de animaciones precisa"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé API OpenAI pour accéder au modèle GPT","Limité aux domaines mathématiques actuellement pris en charge par le code Manim","Nécessite un format de description de langage naturel spécifique pour une génération d''animation précise"],"de":["Benötigt einen OpenAI-API-Schlüssel für den Zugriff auf das GPT-Modell","Begrenzt auf die derzeit von dem Manim-Code unterstützten mathematischen Bereiche","Benötigt ein bestimmtes Format für natürliche Sprachbeschreibungen für eine genaue Animationserzeugung"],"pt":["Requer uma Chave de API da OpenAI para acesso ao modelo GPT","Limitado aos domínios matemáticos atualmente suportados pelo código Manim","Necessita de formatação específica de descrição em linguagem natural para uma geração precisa de animação"],"ru":["Требуется API-ключ OpenAI для доступа к модели GPT","Ограничено математическими областями, которые в настоящее время поддерживаются кодом Manim","Требует определенного форматирования описания на естественном языке для точной генерации анимации"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات (API) من OpenAI للوصول إلى نموذج GPT","مقتصر على المجالات الرياضية المدعومة حاليًا بواسطة كود Manim","يحتاج إلى تنسيق محدد لوصف اللغة الطبيعية لتوليد رسوم متحركة دقيقة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"064fc7a01b13bee0ed3780c36fad7d737031908107a1c1d60427177492f95021","qualityScore":38}');
