de Code plugin for mobile app observability: crash reporting, performance monitoring, and instrumentation for iOS, Android, and React Native"},"features":{"zh":["崩溃报告","性能监控","仪表化","支持 iOS、Android 和 React Native","会话回放功能","提高移动应用的可观测性"],"ja":["クラッシュ レポート","パフォーマンス モニタリング","計測化","iOS、Android、React Native のサポート","セッション リプレイ機能","モバイル アプリの可観測性の向上"],"ko":["크래시 리포트","성능 모니터링","계측화","iOS, Android, React Native 지원","세션 리플레이 기능","모바일 앱의 관찰 가능성 향상"],"es":["Informes de errores y excepciones","Monitoreo de rendimiento y velocidad","Instrumentación para iOS, Android y React Native","Análisis de sesiones de usuario","Mejora de la experiencia móvil"],"fr":["Rapports d''erreurs et d''exceptions","Suivi des performances et de la vitesse","Instrumentation pour iOS, Android et React Native","Analyse des sessions d''utilisateur","Amélioration de l''expérience mobile"],"de":["Fehlerberichte und Ausnahmen","Leistungs- und Geschwindigkeitsüberwachung","Instrumentierung für iOS, Android und React Native","Analyse von Benutzersitzungen","Verbesserung der mobilen Erfahrung"],"pt":["Relatórios de crash para identificar problemas","Monitoramento de desempenho para otimizar aplicativos","Instrumentação para iOS, Android e React Native","Análise de desempenho em tempo real","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Отчеты о崩дах для выявления проблем","Мониторинг производительности для оптимизации приложений","Инструменты для iOS, Android и React Native","Анализ производительности в реальном времени","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["تقرير الحوادث لتحديد المشاكل","تحليل الأداء لتحسين التطبيقات","أدوات ل-ios و-android و-react native","تحليل الأداء في الوقت الفعلي","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用会话回放插件","什么是会话回放","Claude Code 会话回放插件","会话回放插件替代品","会话回放插件安装","会话回放插件设置指南","移动应用可观测性","崩溃报告工具","性能监控软件"],"ja":["セッション リプレイ プラグインの使用方法","セッション リプレイとは","クラウドコード セッション リプレイ プラグイン","セッション リプレイ プラグインの代替","セッション リプレイ プラグインのインストール","セッション リプレイ プラグインの設定ガイド","モバイル アプリの可観測性","クラッシュ レポート ツール","パフォーマンス モニタリング ソフトウェア"],"ko":["세션 리플레이 플러그인의 사용 방법","세션이 무엇인가","클라우드 코드 세션 리플레이 플러그인","세션 리플레이 플러그인의 대체","세션 리플레이 플러그인의 설치","세션 리플레이 플러그인의 설정 가이드","모바일 앱의 관찰 가능성","크래시 리포트 도구","성능 모니터링 소프트웨어"],"es":["herramientas de AI para móviles","session replay para iOS","cómo usar session replay","alternativas a session replay","session replay vs crashlytics","instalación de session replay","guía de configuración de session replay"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour mobiles","session replay pour iOS","comment utiliser session replay","alternatives à session replay","session replay vs crashlytics","installation de session replay","guide de configuration de session replay"],"de":["KI-Tools für Mobile","Session-Replay für iOS","wie man Session-Replay verwendet","Alternativen zu Session-Replay","Session-Replay vs Crashlytics","Installation von Session-Replay","Einrichtungsanleitung für Session-Replay"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de IA","o que é observabilidade de aplicativos móveis","Claude Code alternative","Claude Code vs competitors","instalar Claude Code","guia de configuração do Claude Code"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое наблюдаемость мобильных приложений","Плагин Claude Code alternative","Плагин Claude Code vs конкуренты","установить Плагин Claude Code","руководство по настройке Плагин Claude Code"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي مراقبة التطبيقات الموبايل","بديل كلود كود","كلود كود مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت كلود كود","دليل إعداد كلود كود"]}},"owner":"nexus-labs-automation","repo":"mobile-observability","repoPath":"nexus-labs-automation/mobile-observability","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.888Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"session-replay","description":"Set up session replay for visual debugging. Use when implementing screen recording, replay features, or visual debugging tools.","bodyPreview":"# Session Replay\n\nCapture visual recordings of user sessions for debugging.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Reproducing hard-to-debug issues\n- Understanding user confusion\n- QA and support investigations\n\n## Privacy Requirements (Must Do)\n\nMask by default:\n- All text input fields\n- Passwords and sensitive data\n- User-generated content\n- Financial information\n- User photos/documents\n\n## Performance Budget\n\n| Resource | Limit |\n|----------|-------|\n| CPU | <5% additional |\n| Memory | <20MB additional |\n| Netwo","body":"# Session Replay\n\nCapture visual recordings of user sessions for debugging.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Reproducing hard-to-debug issues\n- Understanding user confusion\n- QA and support investigations\n\n## Privacy Requirements (Must Do)\n\nMask by default:\n- All text input fields\n- Passwords and sensitive data\n- User-generated content\n- Financial information\n- User photos/documents\n\n## Performance Budget\n\n| Resource | Limit |\n|----------|-------|\n| CPU | <5% additional |\n| Memory | <20MB additional |\n| Network | Batch on WiFi |\n| Battery | Pause when low |\n\n## Capture Strategies\n\n| Strategy | Fidelity | Overhead |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| Screenshots (1-2 fps) | Lower | Lower |\n| View hierarchy recording | Higher | Moderate |\n| Hybrid (screenshots + events) | Best | Moderate |\n\n## Best Practice\n\nDon''t record everything. Target:\n- Error sessions only (rolling buffer)\n- Key user journeys\n- 1-10% sampling for general insights\n\n## Implementation\n\nSee `references/session-replay.md` for:\n- Platform-specific setup\n- Privacy masking patterns\n- Vendor configurations (Sentry, Datadog)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:09:26.523Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Debugging Agents needing advanced session visualization capabilities for mobile app observability","zh":"适合需要高级会话可视化能力的移动应用程序observability的调试代理","ja":"高度なセッションの視覚化機能が必要なモバイルアプリの観察可能性のデバッグエージェントに適しています","ko":"고급 세션 시각화 기능이 필요한 모바일 앱 관찰 가능性的 디버깅 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de depuración que necesitan ca