alternatives à remotion"],"de":["remotion","ki-tools","entwicklung von tools","we write","best practices für die entwicklung","optimierung der effizienz","anleitung zur installation von remotion","alternativen zu remotion"],"pt":["como usar remotion","o que é remotion","remotion vs outras ferramentas","instalar remotion","guia de configuração do remotion","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","melhores práticas de remotion","remotion para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать remotion","что такое remotion","remotion vs другие инструменты","установить remotion","руководство по настройке remotion","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","лучшие практики remotion","remotion для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام remotion","ما هو remotion","remotion مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت remotion","دليل إعداد remotion","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","أفضل الممارسات ل remotion","remotion للمطورين"]}},"owner":"WeWriteApp","repo":"WeWrite","repoPath":"WeWriteApp/WeWrite","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.910Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:20:59.164Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Media Agents needing advanced video production capabilities with Remotion and React Three Fiber","zh":"适合需要使用 Remotion 和 React Three Fiber 进行高级视频生产的媒体代理","ja":"Remotion と React Three Fiber を使用した高度なビデオ生産機能を必要とするメディア エージェントに最適","ko":"Remotion 및 React Three Fiber를 사용한 고급 비디오 제작 기능이 필요한 미디어 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Medios que necesitan capacidades de producción de video avanzadas con Remotion y React Three Fiber","fr":"Parfait pour les agents médias ayant besoin de capacités de production vidéo avancées avec Remotion et React Three Fiber","de":"Perfekt für Medienagenten, die erweiterte Videoproduktionsfunktionen mit Remotion und React Three Fiber benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Mídia que precisam de capacidades de produção de vídeo avançadas com Remotion e React Three Fiber","ru":"Идеально для Медиа-агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности видеопроизводства с помощью Remotion и React Three Fiber","ar":"مثالي لعميل الإعلام الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إنتاج فيديو متقدمة مع Remotion و React Three Fiber"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create complex animations and 3D content using Three.js, import various media assets, and optimize video rendering with domain-specific knowledge from Remotion best practices, covering topics like 3D modeling, audio integration, and asset management","zh":"赋予代理创建复杂动画和 3D 内容的能力，使用 Three.js，导入各种媒体资产，并优化视频渲染，利用 Remotion 最佳实践中的领域特定知识，涵盖 3D 建模、音频集成和资产管理等主题","ja":"Three.js を使用して複雑なアニメーションと 3D コンテンツを作成し、さまざまなメディア アセットをインポートし、Remotion ベスト プラクティスからのドメイン固有の知識を使用してビデオ レンダリングを最適化するエージェントをEmpowerする、3D モデリング、オーディオ統合、資産管理などのトピックをカバーする","ko":"Three.js를 사용하여 복잡한 애니메이션과 3D 콘텐츠를 생성하고 다양한 미디어 자산을 가져오고 Remotion 최고 실천법의 분야별 지식을 사용하여 비디오 렌더링을 최적화하며 3D 모델링, 오디오 통합 및 자산 관리 등의 주제를 다룸으로써 에이전트가 강화되는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear animaciones complejas y contenido 3D utilizando Three.js, importar varios activos multimedia y optimizar la representación de video con conocimientos específicos del dominio de las mejores prácticas de Remotion, que cubren temas como modelado 3D, integración de audio y administración de activos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des animations complexes et du contenu 3D en utilisant Three.js, d''importer divers actifs multimédias et d''optimiser le rendu vidéo avec des connaissances spécifiques au domaine des meilleures pratiques de Remotion, couvrant des sujets tels que la modélisation 3D, l''intégration audio et la gestion des actifs","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Animationen und 3D-Inhalte mit Three.js zu erstellen, verschiedene Multimedia-Assets zu importieren und die Videorenderung mit domänen-spezifischem Wissen aus Remotion-Best-Practices zu optimieren, die Themen wie 3D-Modellierung, Audio-Integration und Asset-Management abdecken","pt":"Habilita agentes a criar animações complexas e conteúdo 3D usando Three.js, importar vários ativos de mídia e otimizar a renderização de vídeo com conhecimento específico do domínio das melhores práticas de Remotion, abordando tópicos como modelagem 3D, integração de áudio e gerenciamento de ativos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сложные анимации и 3D-контент с помощью Three.js, импортировать различные медиа-активы и оптимизировать видео-рендеринг с помощью знаний из лучших практик Remotion, охватывающих такие темы, как 3D-моделирование, интеграция аудио и управление активами","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء رسوم متحركة معقدة ومحتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد باستخدام Three.js، واستيراد مختلف Assets الإعلامية، وتنفيذ تقديم الفيديو مع معرفة محددة المجال لأفضل الممارسات Remotion، وتغطية مواضيع مثل نمذجة 3D، وتكامل الصوت، وإدارة الأصول"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D animations for explainer videos","Optimizing video assets for web deployment","Debugging Remotion project configurations"],"zh":["为解释视频生成 3D 动画","优化视频资产用于 Web 部署","调试 Remotion 项目配置"],"ja":["解説ビデオ用の 3D アニメーションを生成する","Web 配置用のビデオ アセットを最適化する","Remotion プロジェクト構成をデバッグする"],"ko":["설명 비디오용 3D 애니메이션 생성","웹 배포를 위한 비디오 자산 최적화","Remotion 프로젝트 구성 디버깅"],"es":["Generar animaciones 3D para videos explicativos","Optimizar activos de video para la implementación web","Depurar configuraciones de proyectos de Remotion"],"fr":["Générer des animations 3D pour des vidéos explicatives","Optimiser les actifs vidéo pour le déploiement web","Déboguer les configurations de projets Remotion"],"de":["Erzeugen von 3D-Animationen für Erklärvideos","Optimieren von Video-Assets für die Web-Implementierung","Debuggen von Remotion-Projekt-Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Geração de animações 3D para vídeos explicativos","Otimização de ativos de vídeo para implantação na web","Depuração de configurações de projetos Remotion"],"ru":["Генерация 3D-анимаций для объяснительных видео","Оптимизация видео-активов для веб-развертывания","Отладка конфигураций проектов Remotion"],"ar":["إنشاء رسوم متحركة ثلاثية الأبعاد لفيديوهاتشرح","تحسين أصول الفيديو لنشر الويب","تصحيح أخطاء تكوين مشاريع Remotion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion project setup","Familiarity with React and JavaScript needed","Specific to Remotion and its ecosystem"],"zh":["需要 Remotion 项目设置","需要熟悉 React 和 JavaScript","特定于 Remotion及其生态系统"],"ja":["Remotion プロジェクト設定が必要","React と JavaScript に対する熟練度が必要","Remotion およびそのエコシステムに特有"],"ko":["Remotion 프로젝트 설정이 필요","React 및 JavaScript에 대한 熟练도가 필요","Remotion及其 생태계에 특정"],"es":["Requiere configuración del proyecto de Remotion","Se requiere familiaridad con React y JavaScript","Específico de Remotion y su ecosistema"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Remotion","Nécessite une connaissance de React et de JavaScript","Spécifique à Remotion et à son écosystème"],"de":["Benötigt Remotion-Projekt-Setup","Benötigt Vertrautheit mit React und JavaScript","Spezifisch für Remotion und sein Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer configuração do projeto Remotion","Necessidade de familiaridade com React e JavaScript","Específico para Remotion e seu ecossistema"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Remotion","Необходимость знания React и JavaScript","Конкретно для Remotion и его экосистемы"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Remotion","يحتاج إلى معرفة React و JavaScript","محدد ل Remotion ونظامه البيئي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b03b063f350e484c5b56641a4afd2b71e0ee171e082bd73b494ae217fef3805f","qualityScore":38}');
