ard","installation von requirement-change","anleitung zur konfiguration von requirement-change","beste praxis, um code-inflation zu verhindern","software-entwicklung mit rust","kommandozeilen-tools für rust"],"pt":["SLOC-Guard","AI ferramentas","limite de código","organização de código","performance de código","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","ferramentas de AI"],"ru":["SLOC-Guard","ИИ Агенты","контроль кода","организация кода","производительность кода","инструменты разработки","инструменты ИИ"],"ar":["SLOC-Guard","أدوات إيه إيه","تحكم حجم الكود","تنظيم الكود","أداء الكود","أدوات تطوير","أدوات إيه إيه"]}},"owner":"doraemonkeys","repo":"sloc-guard","repoPath":"doraemonkeys/sloc-guard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.948Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"requirement-change","description":"Add or modify tasks in Implementation Plan. Use when user proposes new requirements, changes priorities, or adjusts existing task scope.","bodyPreview":"# Requirement Change\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen user proposes new requirements or changes:\n\n1. Review `docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md` and `docs/Implementation Plan.md`  to understand current task structure and priority order\n2. Identify appropriate Phase/Task location for the change\n3. Create/modify tasks following these principles:\n\nEach task must:\n\n- Be independently completable and testable\n- Deliver complete functionality that can be verified (avoid partial implementations that are untestable)\n- Focu","body":"# Requirement Change\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen user proposes new requirements or changes:\n\n1. Review `docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md` and `docs/Implementation Plan.md`  to understand current task structure and priority order\n2. Identify appropriate Phase/Task location for the change\n3. Create/modify tasks following these principles:\n\nEach task must:\n\n- Be independently completable and testable\n- Deliver complete functionality that can be verified (avoid partial implementations that are untestable)\n- Focus on functionality and requirements (not code details)\n\n4. Update Priority Order table if priorities change\n5. For large new features, consider creating a new Phase section\n6. Keep documentation concise—avoid redundancy to reduce AI context usage\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:43:05.840Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents needing to enforce SLOC limits and directory structure rules","zh":"适用于需要强制执行SLOC限制和目录结构规则的代码审查代理","ja":"SLOC制限とディレクトリ構造ルールを強制するコードレビューエージェントに適しています","ko":"SLOC 제한 및 디렉토리 구조 규칙을 적용해야 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan hacer cumplir los límites de SLOC y las reglas de estructura de directorios","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Revue de Code ayant besoin de faire respecter les limites de SLOC et les règles de structure de répertoire","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die SLOC-Grenzwerte und Verzeichnisstrukturregeln durchsetzen müssen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam impor limites de SLOC e regras de estrutura de diretório","ru":"Идеально для агентов проверки кода, которым необходимо обеспечивать соблюдение ограничений SLOC и правил структуры директорий","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى فرض حدود SLOC وقواعد هيكل الدليل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to prevent code bloat by enforcing SLOC limits and directory structure rules, utilizing a high-performance Rust CLI, and modifying tasks based on principles outlined in `docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md` and `docs/Implementation Plan.md`","zh":"赋予代理人利用高性能Rust CLI强制执行SLOC限制和目录结构规则的能力，并根据`docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md`和`docs/Implementation Plan.md`中概述的原则修改任务，从而防止代码臃肿","ja":"高パフォーマンスのRust CLIを使用してSLOC制限とディレクトリ構造ルールを強制適用し、`docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md`と`docs/Implementation Plan.md`に概説された原則に基づいてタスクを変更することで、コードの肥大化を防ぐためのエージェントをEmpowerします","ko":"고성능 Rust CLI를 사용하여 SLOC 제한 및 디렉토리 구조 규칙을 강제로 적용하고, `docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md`와 `docs/Implementation Plan.md`에概述된 원칙에 따라 태스크를 수정하여 코드 비대화를 방지할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a prevenir la inflación de código al hacer cumplir los límites de SLOC y las reglas de estructura de directorios, utilizando una CLI de alto rendimiento de Rust y modificando tareas basadas en los principios descritos en `docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md` y `docs/Implementation Plan.md`","fr":"Autorise les agents à prévenir l''inflation de code en faisant respecter les limites de SLOC et les règles de structure de répertoire, en utilisant une CLI de haute performance Rust et en modifiant des tâches basées sur les principes décrits dans `docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md` et `docs/Implementation Plan.md`","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Code-Inflation zu verhindern, indem sie SLOC-Grenzwerte und Verzeichnisstrukturregeln durchsetzen, einen Hochleistungs-Rust-CLI verwenden und Aufgaben basierend auf den in `docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md` und `docs/Implementation Plan.md` beschriebenen Grundsätzen ändern","pt":"Habilita os agentes a prevenir o inchaço de código ao impor limites de SLOC e regras de estrutura de diretório, utilizando uma CLI de alto desempenho em Rust, e modificando tarefas com base nos princípios delineados em `docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md` e `docs/Implementation Plan.md`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью предотвращать разрастание кода, обеспечивая соблюдение ограничений SLOC и правил структуры директорий, используя высокопроизводительную CLI на Rust, и изменяя задачи на основе принципов, изложенных в `docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md` и `docs/Implementation Plan.md`","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من منع انتفاخ الكود من خلال فرض حدود SLOC وقواعد هيكل الدليل، باستخدام CLI أداء عالي في Rust، وتعديل المهام بناءً على المبادئ الموجزة في `docs/PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md` و `docs/Implementation Plan.md`"},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing project structures for compliance","Modifying tasks to adhere to SLOC limits","Enforcing directory structure rules for new requirements"],"zh":["审查项目结构以确保合规性","修改任务以遵守SLOC限制","强制执行新要求的目录结构规则"],"ja":["コンプライアンスの