、統一されたモデルを使用して異なるパーサーにアクセスし、多くのドキュメント形式と解析レベルをサポートしています","ko":"Parxy는 문서 처리 게이트웨이로서,統一された 모델을 사용하여 다양한 파서에 접근하며, 多くの 문서 형식과 解析 레벨을 지원한다","es":"Parxy es una puerta de enlace de procesamiento de documentos que permite acceder a diferentes analizadores mediante un modelo unificado.","fr":"Parxy est une passerelle de traitement de documents qui permet d''accéder à différents analyseurs via un modèle unifié.","de":"Parxy ist ein Dokumentenverarbeitungsgateway, das den Zugriff auf verschiedene Parser über ein einheitliches Modell ermöglicht.","pt":"Parxy é um gateway de processamento de documentos que fornece acesso a diferentes parsers por meio de um modelo unificado.","ru":"Parxy — это шлюз обработки документов, который предоставляет доступ к различным парсерам через унифицированную модель.","ar":"parxy هو بوابة معالجة المستندات التي توفر وصولاً إلى محلل مختلف باستخدام نموذج موحد","en":"Document processing gateway. Access different parsers using a unified model."},"definition":{"en":"Document processing gateway. Access different parsers using a unified model."},"features":{"zh":["统一的文档处理模型","支持多种文档格式","多种解析级别（page、block、span）","支持不同解析器（pymupdf、llamaparse）","从 bytes 或 BytesIO 解析文档"],"ja":["統一されたドキュメント処理モデル","多くのドキュメント形式をサポート","多くの解析レベル（page、block、span）","異なるパーサー（pymupdf、llamaparse）をサポート","bytes または BytesIO からドキュメントを解析"],"ko":["統一された 문서 처리 모델","多くの 문서 형식 지원","多くの 解析 레벨（page、block、span）","다양한 파서（pymupdf、llamaparse） 지원","bytes 또는 BytesIO 에서 문서를 解析"],"es":["Modelo unificado para acceder a diferentes analizadores","Procesamiento de documentos de forma eficiente","Compatibilidad con diferentes drivers y niveles de extracción","Soporte para parsear documentos en formato PDF","Opción para parsear documentos desde bytes o BytesIO"],"fr":["Modèle unifié pour accéder à différents analyseurs","Traitement de documents de manière efficace","Compatibilité avec différents drivers et niveaux d''extraction","Prise en charge du parsing de documents au format PDF","Option pour parser des documents à partir de bytes ou BytesIO"],"de":["Einheitliches Modell für den Zugriff auf verschiedene Parser","Effizientes Dokumentenverarbeitung","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Treibern und Extraktionsstufen","Unterstützung für das Parsen von Dokumenten im PDF-Format","Option zum Parsen von Dokumenten aus Bytes oder BytesIO"],"pt":["Processamento de documentos unificado","Acesso a diferentes parsers","Níveis de extração personalizáveis","Suporte a diferentes formatos de arquivo","Integração fácil com aplicativos existentes"],"ru":["Унифицированная обработка документов","Доступ к различным парсерам","Настраиваемые уровни извлечения","Поддержка различных форматов файлов","Легкая интеграция с существующими приложениями"],"ar":["معالجة المستندات الموحدة","الوصول إلى محلل مختلف","مستويات الاستخراج القابلة للتعديل","دعم صيغ الملفات المختلفة","التكامل السهل مع التطبيقات الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["文档处理","解析器","统一模型","多种格式","解析级别","pymupdf","llamaparse","bytes","BytesIO"],"ja":["ドキュメント処理","パーサー","統一されたモデル","多くの形式","解析レベル","pymupdf","llamaparse","bytes","BytesIO"],"ko":["문서 처리","파서","統一された 모델","多くの 형식","解析 레벨","pymupdf","llamaparse","bytes","BytesIO"],"es":["procesamiento de documentos","análisis de documentos","parseo de documentos","modelo unificado","drivers de parsing","niveles de extracción","PDF parsing","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["traitement de documents","analyse de documents","parsing de documents","modèle unifié","pilotes de parsing","niveaux d''extraction","parsing PDF","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Dokumentenverarbeitung","Dokumentenanalyse","Dokumentenparsing","einheitliches Modell","Parsingtreviber","Extraktionsstufen","PDF-Parsing","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["processamento de documentos","parxy","parsers","nível de extração","formatos de arquivo","integração de aplicativos","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["обработка документов","parxy","парсеры","уровень извлечения","форматы файлов","интеграция приложений","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["معالجة المستندات","parxy","محلل","مستوى الاستخراج","صيغ الملفات","تكامل التطبيقات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"OneOffTech","repo":"parxy","repoPath":"OneOffTech/parxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.877Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"parxy","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Parxy Document Processing\n\n## Parsing Documents\n\n```python\nfrom parxy_core.facade.parxy import Parxy\n\n# Basic parsing (default: pymupdf driver, block level)\ndoc = Parxy.parse(\"document.pdf\")\n\n# With specific driver and level\ndoc = Parxy.parse(\"document.pdf\", driver_name=\"llamaparse\", level=\"span\")\n\n# From bytes or BytesIO\ndoc = Parxy.parse(pdf_bytes)\n```\n\n### Extraction Levels\n\n| Level | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `page` | Page text only |\n| `block` | Text blocks (default) |\n| `li","body":"# Parxy Document Processing\n\n## Parsing Documents\n\n```python\nfrom parxy_core.facade.parxy import Parxy\n\n# Basic parsing (default: pymupdf driver, block level)\ndoc = Parxy.parse(\"document.pdf\")\n\n# With specific driver and level\ndoc = Parxy.parse(\"document.pdf\", driver_name=\"llamaparse\", level=\"span\")\n\n# From bytes or BytesIO\ndoc = Parxy.parse(pdf_bytes)\n```\n\n### Extraction Levels\n\n| Level | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `page` | Page text only |\n| `block` | Text blocks (default) |\n| `line` | Individual lines |\n| `span` | Text spans with styling |\n| `character` | Individual characters |\n\n### Document Structure\n\n```python\ndoc.filename      # Original filename\ndoc.pages         # List of Page objects\ndoc.metadata      # Document metadata\n\npage.number       # Page number (1-indexed)\npage.text         # Full page text\npage.blocks       # List of TextBlock objects\n\nblock.text        # Block text content\nblock.bbox        # Bounding box (x0, y0, x1, y1)\nblock.role        # Semantic role (paragraph, heading, etc.)\n```\n\n## Available Drivers\n\n| Driver | Constant | Type | Best For |\n|--------|----------|------|----------|\n| PyMuPDF | `Parxy.PYMUPDF` | Local | Fast local processing |\n| PdfAct | `Parxy.PDFACT` | Self-hosted | Scientific papers, semantic roles |\n| LlamaParse | `Parxy.LLAMAPARSE` | Cloud | Complex docs with OCR/tables |\n| LLMWhisperer | `Parxy.LLMWHISPERER` | Cloud | Form extraction |\n| Unstructured | `Parxy.UNSTRUCTURED_LIBRARY` | Local | Multi-format (DOCX, HTML) |\n\n```python\n# List all drivers\ndrivers = Parxy.drivers()\n\n# Get specific driver\ndriver = Parxy.driver(Parxy.LLAMAPARSE)\n```\n\n## Batch Processing\n\n```python\nfrom parxy_core.facade.parxy import Parxy\nfrom parxy_core.models import BatchTask\n\n# Simple batch\nresults = Parxy.batch(\n    tasks=[\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\"],\n    drivers=[\"pymupdf\"],\n    workers=4,\n)\n\n# Per-file configuration\nresults = Parxy.batch(tasks=[\n    BatchTask(file=\"simple.pdf\"),\n    BatchTask(file=\"complex.pdf\", drivers=[\"llamaparse\"], level=\"line\"),\n])\n\n# Streaming results\nfor result in Parxy.batch_iter(tasks=[\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\"]):\n    if result.success:\n        print(f\"{result.file}: {len(result.document.pages)} pages\")\n    else:\n        print(f\"{result.file} failed: {result.error}\")\n```\n\n## PDF Manipulation\n\n### Merge PDFs\n\n```python\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom parxy_core.facade.parxy import Parxy\n\n# Merge entire PDFs\nParxy.pdf.merge(\n    inputs=[\n        (Path(\"doc1.pdf\"), None, None),  # All pages\n        (Path(\"doc2.pdf\"), None, None),\n    ],\n    output=Path(\"merged.pdf\"),\n)\n\n# Merge specific page ranges (0-indexed)\nParxy.pdf.merge(\n    inputs=[\n        (Path(\"doc1.pdf\"), 0, 4),   # Pages 1-5\n        (Path(\"doc2.pdf\"), 0, 0),   # Page 1 only\n    ],\n    output=Path(\"selected.pdf\"),\n)\n```\n\n### Split PDF\n\n```python\n# Split into individual pages\npages = Parxy.pdf.split(\n    input_path=Path(\"document.pdf\"),\n    output_dir=Path(\"./pages\"),\n    prefix=\"doc\",\n)\n# Returns: [Path(''pages/doc_page_1.pdf''), Path(''pages/doc_page_2.pdf''), ...]\n```\n\n### Optimize PDF\n\n```python\nresult = Parxy.pdf.optimize(\n    input_path=Path(\"large.pdf\"),\n    output_path=Path(\"small.pdf\"),\n    scrub_metadata=True,      # Remove metadata, thumbnails\n    subset_fonts=True,        # Keep only used glyphs\n    compress_images=True,     # Downsample and compress\n    dpi_target=72,\n    image_quality=60,\n    convert_to_grayscale=False,\n)\nprint(f\"Reduced by {result[''reduction_percent'']:.1f}%\")\n```\n\n## PDF Attachments\n\n```python\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom parxy_core.services.pdf_service import PdfService\n\nwith PdfService(Path(\"document.pdf\")) as pdf:\n    # List attachments\n    names = pdf.list_attachments()\n\n    # Add attachment\n    pdf.add_attachment(Path(\"data.csv\"), name=\"data\", desc=\"Sales data\")\n\n    # Extract attachment\n    content = pdf.extract_attachment(\"data\")\n\n    # Remove attachment\n    pdf.remove_attachment(\"data\")\n\n    # Save changes\n    pdf.save(Path(\"output.pdf\"))\n```\n\n## CLI Commands\n\nAssuming uvx is installed, pipx can be used as well.\n\n```bash\n# Parse document\nuvx parxy parse document.pdf --driver llamaparse --level block --format json\n\n# Convert to markdown\nuvx parxy markdown document.pdf -o output/\nuvx parxy markdown *.pdf --combine -o combined.md\n\n# PDF operations\nuvx parxy pdf split document.pdf --pages 1-5 -o output/\nuvx parxy pdf merge doc1.pdf doc2.pdf -o combined.pdf\n\n# List drivers\nuvx parxy drivers\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:07:17.291Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing unified document parsing capabilities with drivers like pymupdf and llamaparse.","zh":"非常适合需要统一文档解析能力的文档分析代理，支持如pymupdf和llamaparse的驱动程序。","ja":"文書分析エージェントが統一された文書解析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。pymupdfやllamaparseなどのドライバーをサポートしています。","ko":"통일된 문서 파싱 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다. pymupdf와 llamaparse와 같은 드라이버를 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de análisis de documentos unificados con controladores como pymupdf y llamaparse.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents ayant besoin de capacités d''analyse de documents unifiées avec des pilotes tels que pymupdf et llamaparse.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agenten, die einheitliche Dokumentenanalysefunktionen mit Treibern wie pymupdf und llamaparse benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing unified document parsing capabilities with drivers like pymupdf and llamaparse.","ru":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing unified document parsing capabilities with drivers like pymupdf and llamaparse.","ar":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing unified document parsing capabilities with drivers like pymupdf and llamaparse."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to parse documents at various levels, including page, block, and span, using a unified model and supporting multiple drivers, enabling advanced document processing with PDF bytes or BytesIO.","zh":"使得代理能够使用统一模型和多个驱动程序来解析文档，支持高级文档处理，包括使用PDF字节或BytesIO，能够在不同的级别进行解析，包括页面、块和跨度。","ja":"エージェントが統一されたモデルと複数のドライバーを使用して文書を解析できるようにし、PDFバイトまたはBytesIOを使用した高度な文書処理を可能にします。ページ、ブロック、スパンなどのさまざまなレベルで解析できます。","ko":"에이전트가統一된 모델과 여러 드라이버를 사용하여 문서를 파싱할 수 있게 하여 고급 문서 처리를 가능하게 하고 PDF 바이트 또는 BytesIO를 사용하여 페이지, 블록, 스팬과 같은 다양한 수준에서 문서를 파싱할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar documentos en varios niveles, incluyendo página, bloque y span, utilizando un modelo unificado y compatibilidad con varios controladores, lo que permite un procesamiento de documentos avanzado con bytes PDF o BytesIO.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser des documents à différents niveaux, notamment page, bloc et span, en utilisant un modèle unifié et en prenant en charge plusieurs pilotes, ce qui permet un traitement de documents avancé avec des octets PDF ou BytesIO.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Dokumente auf verschiedenen Ebenen, einschließlich Seite, Block und Span, mit einem einheitlichen Modell und Unterstützung für mehrere Treiber zu analysieren, was ein erweitertes Dokumentenverarbeitung mit PDF-Bytes oder BytesIO ermöglicht.","pt":"Empowers agents to parse documents at various levels, including page, block, and span, using a unified model and supporting multiple drivers, enabling advanced document processing with PDF bytes or BytesIO.","ru":"Empowers agents to parse documents at various levels, including page, block, and span, using a unified model and supporting multiple drivers, enabling advanced document processing with PDF bytes or BytesIO.","ar":"Empowers agents to parse documents at various levels, including page, block, and span, using a unified model and supporting multiple drivers, enabling advanced document processing with PDF bytes or BytesIO."},"useCases":{"en":["Parsing documents with specific drivers and levels","Extracting text from PDFs at different granularity levels","Processing documents from bytes or BytesIO"],"zh":["使用特定驱动程序和级别解析文档","从PDF中以不同粒度级别提取文本","从字节或BytesIO处理文档"],"ja":["特定ドライバーとレベルを使用して文書を解析する","PDFからさまざまな粒度レベルでテキストを抽出する","バイトまたはBytesIOから文書を処理する"],"ko":["특정 드라이버와 수준을 사용하여 문서를 파싱하는 것","PDF에서 다양한粒度 수준으로 텍스트를 추출하는 것","바이트 또는 BytesIO에서 문서를 처리하는 것"],"es":["Análisis de documentos con controladores y niveles específicos","Extracción de texto de PDF en diferentes niveles de granularidad","Procesamiento de documentos desde bytes o BytesIO"],"fr":["Analyse de documents avec des pilotes et des niveaux spécifiques","Extraction de texte à partir de PDF à différents niveaux de granularité","Traitement de documents à partir d''octets ou de BytesIO"],"de":["Analyse von Dokumenten mit spezifischen Treibern und Ebenen","Extraktion von Text aus PDF auf verschiedenen Granularitätsebenen","Verarbeitung von Dokumenten aus Bytes oder BytesIO"],"pt":["Parsing documents with specific drivers and levels","Extracting text from PDFs at different granularity levels","Processing documents from bytes or BytesIO"],"ru":["Parsing documents with specific drivers and levels","Extracting text from PDFs at different granularity levels","Processing documents from bytes or BytesIO"],"ar":["Parsing documents with specific drivers and levels","Extracting text from PDFs at different granularity levels","Processing documents from bytes or BytesIO"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific driver support, such as pymupdf or llamaparse","Limited to supported document formats, primarily PDF"],"zh":["需要特定驱动程序的支持，如pymupdf或llamaparse","仅限于支持的文档格式，主要是PDF"],"ja":["pymupdfやllamaparseなどの特定ドライバーのサポートが必要","サポートされている文書形式に限定され、主にPDF"],"ko":["pymupdf 또는 llamaparse와 같은 특정 드라이버의 지원이 필요","지원되는 문서 형식에 제한되며 주로 PDF"],"es":["Requiere soporte de controlador específico, como pymupdf o llamaparse","Limitado a formatos de documento compatibles, principalmente PDF"],"fr":["Nécessite un support de pilote spécifique, comme pymupdf ou llamaparse","Limité aux formats de document pris en charge, principalement PDF"],"de":["Erfordert spezifische Treibersupport, wie zum Beispiel pymupdf oder llamaparse","Begrenzt auf unterstützte Dokumentformate, hauptsächlich PDF"],"pt":["Requires specific driver support, such as pymupdf or llamaparse","Limited to supported document formats, primarily PDF"],"ru":["Requires specific driver support, such as pymupdf or llamaparse","Limited to supported document formats, primarily PDF"],"ar":["Requires specific driver support, such as pymupdf or llamaparse","Limited to supported document formats, primarily PDF"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"67bf568e2de681e308876d915bedcfe28ee4cf73361e2a5763be3f2eb97c21c5","qualityScore":37}');
