servers"},"description":{"zh":"本指南介绍如何创建生产就绪的MCP服务器，包括API集成、OAuth认证和响应优化","ja":"本ガイドでは、API統合、OAuth認証、レスポンス最適化を含む生産向けのMCPサーバーの作成方法について説明します","ko":"본 가이드는 API 통합, OAuth 인증 및 응답 최적화를 포함한 생산 준비가 된 MCP 서버를 생성하는 방법에 대해 설명합니다","es":"Esta habilidad te guía en la creación de servidores MCP de producción con integraciones de API y autenticación OAuth.","fr":"Cette compétence vous guide dans la création de serveurs MCP de production avec des intégrations d''API et une authentification OAuth.","de":"Diese Fähigkeit führt Sie durch die Erstellung von MCP-Servern für die Produktion mit API-Integrationen und OAuth-Authentifizierung.","pt":"O skill create-mcp-servers fornece recursos personalizados para criar servidores MCP de produção com integrações de API e autenticação OAuth.","ru":"Навык create-mcp-servers предоставляет пользовательские ресурсы для создания серверов MCP с интеграцией API и аутентификацией OAuth.","ar":"المهارة create-mcp-servers توفر موارد مخصصة لإنشاء خوادم MCP جاهزة للانتاج مع التكاملات API وتحديد الهوية OAuth.","en":"A collection of my favorite custom Claude Code resources to make life easier."},"definition":{"en":"A collection of my favorite custom Claude Code resources to make life easier."},"features":{"zh":["API集成","OAuth认证","响应优化","生产就绪的MCP服务器","Claude Code和Claude Desktop安装"],"ja":["API統合","OAuth認証","レスポンス最適化","生産向けのMCPサーバー","Claude CodeとClaude Desktopのインストール"],"ko":["API 통합","OAuth 인증","응답 최적화","생산 준비가 된 MCP 서버","Claude Code와 Claude Desktop 설치"],"es":["Creación de servidores MCP personalizados","Integraciones de API para ampliar las capacidades de Claude","Autenticación OAuth para una seguridad avanzada","Optimización de respuestas para un rendimiento mejorado","Instalación en Claude Code y Claude Desktop"],"fr":["Création de serveurs MCP personnalisés","Intégrations d''API pour étendre les capacités de Claude","Authentification OAuth pour une sécurité avancée","Optimisation des réponses pour un rendement amélioré","Installation dans Claude Code et Claude Desktop"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten MCP-Servern","API-Integrationen zur Erweiterung der Funktionen von Claude","OAuth-Authentifizierung für erweiterte Sicherheit","Optimierung von Antworten für verbesserte Leistung","Installation in Claude Code und Claude Desktop"],"pt":["Integração de API","Autenticação OAuth","Otimização de respostas","Instalação no Claude Code e Claude Desktop","Uso de variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["Интеграция API","Аутентификация OAuth","Оптимизация ответов","Установка в Claude Code и Claude Desktop","Использование переменных окружения"],"ar":["التكامل API","تحديد الهوية OAuth","أتمتة الاستجابة","التثبيت في Claude Code و Claude Desktop","استخدام متغيرات البيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MCP服务器","Claude Code","API集成","OAuth认证","响应优化","生产就绪","开发者工具"],"ja":["MCPサーバー","Claude Code","API統合","OAuth認証","レスポンス最適化","生産向け","開発者ツール"],"ko":["MCP 서버","Claude Code","API 통합","OAuth 인증","응답 최적화","생산 준비","개발자 도구"],"es":["servidores MCP","Claude Code","Claude Desktop","API","autenticación OAuth","optimización de respuestas","desarrollo de servidores","creación de servidores MCP","integraciones de API"],"fr":["serveurs MCP","Claude Code","Claude Desktop","API","authentification OAuth","optimisation des réponses","développement de serveurs","création de serveurs MCP","intégrations d''API"],"de":["MCP-Server","Claude Code","Claude Desktop","API","OAuth-Authentifizierung","Optimierung von Antworten","Serverentwicklung","Erstellung von MCP-Servern","API-Integrationen"],"pt":["servidores MCP","integração de API","autenticação OAuth","otimização de respostas","Claude Code","Claude Desktop","desenvolvimento de servidores"],"ru":["серверы MCP","интеграция API","аутентификация OAuth","оптимизация ответов","Claude Code","Claude Desktop","разработка серверов"],"ar":["خوادم MCP","التكامل API","تحديد الهوية OAuth","أتمتة الاستجابة","Claude Code","Claude Desktop","تطوير الخوادم"]}},"owner":"glittercowboy","repo":"taches-cc-resources","repoPath":"glittercowboy/taches-cc-resources","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-mcp-servers","description":"Create Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers that expose tools, resources, and prompts to Claude. Use when building custom integrations, APIs, data sources, or any server that Claude should interact with via the MCP protocol. Supports both TypeScript and Python implementations.","bodyPreview":"<objective>\nMCP servers extend Claude''s capabilities by exposing tools, resources, and prompts. This skill guides creation of production-ready MCP servers with API integrations, OAuth authentication, response optimization, and proper installation in Claude Code and Claude Desktop.\n</objective>\n\n<essential_principles>\n\n<the_5_rules>\nEvery MCP server must follow these:\n\n1. **Never Hardcode Secrets** - Use `${VAR}` expansion in configs, environment variables in code\n2. **Use `cwd` Property** - Isol","body":"<objective>\nMCP servers extend Claude''s capabilities by exposing tools, resources, and prompts. This skill guides creation of production-ready MCP servers with API integrations, OAuth authentication, response optimization, and proper installation in Claude Code and Claude Desktop.\n</objective>\n\n<essential_principles>\n\n<the_5_rules>\nEvery MCP server must follow these:\n\n1. **Never Hardcode Secrets** - Use `${VAR}` expansion in configs, environment variables in code\n2. **Use `cwd` Property** - Isolates dependencies (not `--cwd` in args)\n3. **Always Absolute Paths** - `which uv` to find paths, never relative\n4. **One Server Per Directory** - `~/Developer/mcp/{server-name}/`\n5. **Use `uv` for Python** - Better than pip, handles venvs automatically\n</the_5_rules>\n\n<security_checklist>\n- Never ask user to paste secrets into chat\n- Always use environment variables for credentials\n- Use ${VAR} expansion in configs\n- Provide exact commands for user to run in terminal\n- Verify environment variable existence without showing values\n- Never hardcode API keys in code or configs\n</security_checklist>\n\n<architecture_decision>\nOperation count determines architecture:\n\n- **1-2 operations** → Traditional pattern (flat tools)\n- **3+ operations** → On-demand discovery pattern (meta-tools)\n\nTraditional: Each operation is a separate tool\nOn-demand: 4 meta-tools (discover, get_schema, execute, continue) + operations.json\n</architecture_decision>\n\n<context>\nMCP servers expose:\n- **Tools**: Functions Claude can call (API requests, file operations, calculations)\n- **Resources**: Data Claude can read (files, database records, API responses)\n- **Prompts**: Reusable prompt templates with arguments\n\nStandard location: `~/Developer/mcp/{server-name}/`\n</context>\n\n</essential_principles>\n\n<routing>\nBased on user intent, route to appropriate workflow:\n\n**No context provided** (skill invoked without description):\nUse AskUserQuestion:\n- header: \"Mode\"\n- question: \"What would you like to do?\"\n- options:\n  - \"Create a new MCP server\" → workflows/create-new-server.md\n  - \"Update an existing MCP server\" → workflows/update-existing-server.md\n  - \"Troubleshoot a server\" → workflows/troubleshoot-server.md\n\n**Context provided** (user described what they want):\nRoute directly to workflows/create-new-server.md\n</routing>\n\n<workflows_index>\n| Workflow | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| create-new-server.md | Full 8-step workflow from intake to verification |\n| update-existing-server.md | Modify or extend an existing server |\n| troubleshoot-server.md | Diagnose and fix connection/runtime issues |\n</workflows_index>\n\n<templates_index>\n| Template | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| python-server.py | Traditional pattern starter for Python |\n| typescript-server.ts | Traditional pattern starter for TypeScript |\n| operations.json | On-demand discovery operations definition |\n</templates_index>\n\n<scripts_index>\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| setup-python-project.sh | Initialize Python MCP project with uv |\n| setup-typescript-project.sh | Initialize TypeScript MCP project with npm |\n</scripts_index>\n\n<references_index>\n**Core workflow:**\n- creation-workflow.md - Complete step-by-step with exact commands\n\n**Architecture patterns:**\n- traditional-pattern.md - For 1-2 operations (flat tools)\n- large-api-pattern.md - For 3+ operations (on-demand discovery)\n\n**Language-specific:**\n- python-implementation.md - Async patterns, type hints\n- typescript-implementation.md - Type safety, SDK features\n\n**Advanced topics:**\n- oauth-implementation.md - OAuth with stdio isolation\n- response-optimization.md - Field truncation, pagination\n- tools-and-resources.md - Resources API, prompts, streaming\n- testing-and-deployment.md - Unit tests, packaging, publishing\n- validation-checkpoints.md - All validation checks\n- adaptive-questioning-guide.md - Question templates for intake\n- api-research-template.md - API research document format\n</references_index>\n\n<quick_reference>\n```bash\n# List servers\nclaude mcp list\n\n# Add server (Python)\nclaude mcp add --transport stdio <name> \\\n  --env API_KEY=''${API_KEY}'' \\\n  -- uv --directory ~/Developer/mcp/<name> run python -m src.server\n\n# Add server (TypeScript)\nclaude mcp add --transport stdio <name> \\\n  --env API_KEY=''${API_KEY}'' \\\n  -- node ~/Developer/mcp/<name>/build/index.js\n\n# Remove server\nclaude mcp remove <name>\n\n# Check logs\ntail -f ~/Library/Logs/Claude/mcp-server-<name>.log\n\n# Find paths\nwhich uv && which node && which python\n```\n</quick_reference>\n\n<troubleshooting_quick>\n**Server not appearing:** Check `claude mcp list`, verify config in `~/.claude/settings.json`\n\n**\"command not found\":** Use absolute paths from `which uv` / `which node`\n\n**Environment variable not found:**\n```bash\necho $MY_API_KEY  # Check if set\necho ''export MY_API_KEY=\"value\"'' >> ~/.zshrc && source ~/.zshrc\n```\n\n**Secrets visible in conversation:** STOP. Delete conversation. Rotate credentials. Never paste secrets in chat.\n\nFull troubleshooting: workflows/troubleshoot-server.md\n</troubleshooting_quick>\n\n<success_criteria>\nA production-ready MCP server has:\n- Valid configuration in Claude Code (`claude mcp list` shows ✓ Connected)\n- Valid configuration in Claude Desktop config\n- Environment variables set securely in ~/.zshrc\n- Architecture matches operation count\n- OAuth stdio isolation if applicable\n- Response optimization for list/search operations\n- All validation checkpoints passed\n- No errors in logs\n</success_criteria>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:12.441Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code needing custom MCP server creation with API integrations and OAuth authentication.","zh":"非常适合需要自定义MCP服务器创建、API集成和OAuth认证的高级AI代理，如Claude Code。","ja":"Claude CodeのようなカスタムMCPサーバーの作成、API統合、およびOAuth認証が必要な高度なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Claude Code와 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 사용자 지정 MCP 서버 생성, API 통합 및 OAuth 인증이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA avanzados como Claude Code que necesitan la creación de servidores MCP personalizados con integraciones de API y autenticación OAuth.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de IA avancés comme Claude Code nécessitant la création de serveurs MCP personnalisés avec des intégrations d''API et une authentification OAuth.","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte KI-Agents wie Claude Code, die eine benutzerdefinierte Erstellung von MCP-Servern mit API-Integrationen und OAuth-Authentifizierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados como Claude Code que necessitam de criação de servidor MCP personalizada com integrações de API e autenticação OAuth.","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, требующих создания пользовательского сервера MCP с интеграциями API и аутентификацией OAuth.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين المتقدمين مثل Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء خادم MCP مخصص مع التكاملات API والتحقق من OAuth."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create production-ready MCP servers with optimized responses, utilizing environment variables for secure secret management and the `cwd` property for isolation, all while integrating seamlessly with Claude Code and Claude Desktop via API and OAuth protocols.","zh":"赋予代理创建生产就绪的MCP服务器的能力，具有优化的响应，利用环境变量进行安全的密钥管理，并使用`cwd`属性进行隔离，同时通过API和OAuth协议与Claude Code和Claude Desktop实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントに、環境変数を使用したセキュアなシークレット管理と`cwd`プロパティを使用した分離を実現しながら、Claude CodeおよびClaude DesktopとAPIおよびOAuthプロトコルを介してシームレスに統合する、最適化されたレスポンスを備えた生产就绪のMCPサーバーを作成する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 생산 준비가 된 MCP 서버를 만들 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 응답을 최적화하고 환경 변수를 사용하여 보안 비밀 관리를 수행하며 `cwd` 속성을 사용하여 격리하는 동안 Claude Code 및 Claude Desktop과 API 및 OAuth 프로토콜을 통해无缝으로 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear servidores MCP listos para producción con respuestas optimizadas, utilizando variables de entorno para una gestión segura de secretos y la propiedad `cwd` para aislamiento, todo mientras se integra de manera transparente con Claude Code y Claude Desktop a través de protocolos de API y OAuth.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des serveurs MCP prêts pour la production avec des réponses optimisées, en utilisant des variables d''environnement pour une gestion sécurisée des secrets et la propriété `cwd` pour l''isolement, le tout en s''intégrant de manière transparente avec Claude Code et Claude Desktop via des protocoles d''API et d''OAuth.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, produktionsreife MCP-Server mit optimierten Antworten zu erstellen, indem Umgebungsvariablen für eine sichere Geheimnisverwaltung und die Eigenschaft `cwd` für Isolation verwendet werden, all dies während einer nahtlosen Integration mit Claude Code und Claude Desktop über API- und OAuth-Protokolle.","pt":"Habilita agentes a criar servidores MCP prontos para produção com respostas otimizadas, utilizando variáveis de ambiente para gerenciamento seguro de segredos e a propriedade `cwd` para isolamento, tudo isso integrando-se perfeitamente com Claude Code e Claude Desktop por meio de protocolos API e OAuth.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать серверы MCP, готовые к производству, с оптимизированными ответами, используя переменные среды для безопасного управления секретами и свойство `cwd` для изоляции, все это интегрируется без проблем с Claude Code и Claude Desktop через протоколы API и OAuth.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء خوادم MCP جاهزة للإنتاج مع استجابات محسّنة، مع استخدام متغيرات البيئة لإدارة الأسرار الآمنة وخاصية `cwd` للعزل، كل ذلك يتكامل بسلاسة مع Claude Code و Claude Desktop من خلال بروتوكولات API و OAuth."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom MCP servers with API integrations for enhanced functionality","Implementing OAuth authentication for secure server access","Optimizing MCP server responses for improved performance"],"zh":["创建具有API集成的自定义MCP服务器以实现增强的功能","实现OAuth认证以实现安全的服务器访问","优化MCP服务器响应以提高性能"],"ja":["高度な機能を実現するためにAPI統合を備えたカスタムMCPサーバーの作成","セキュアなサーバーアクセスを実現するためにOAuth認証の実装","パフォーマンスの向上を実現するためにMCPサーバーのレスポンスを最適化"],"ko":["고급 기능을 구현하기 위해 API 통합을 갖춘 사용자 지정 MCP 서버 생성","보안 서버 액세스를 구현하기 위해 OAuth 인증 구현","성능 개선을 위해 MCP 서버 응답 최적화"],"es":["Crear servidores MCP personalizados con integraciones de API para una funcionalidad mejorada","Implementar la autenticación OAuth para un acceso seguro al servidor","Optimizar las respuestas del servidor MCP para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Créer des serveurs MCP personnalisés avec des intégrations d''API pour une fonctionnalité améliorée","Mettre en œuvre l''authentification OAuth pour un accès sécurisé au serveur","Optimiser les réponses du serveur MCP pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte MCP-Server mit API-Integrationen für erweiterte Funktionalität erstellen","OAuth-Authentifizierung für sicheren Serverzugriff implementieren","MCP-Server-Antworten für verbesserte Leistung optimieren"],"pt":["Criar servidores MCP personalizados com integrações de API para funcionalidade aprimorada","Implementar autenticação OAuth para acesso seguro ao servidor","Otimizar respostas do servidor MCP para desempenho melhorado"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских серверов MCP с интеграциями API для расширенной функциональности","Реализация аутентификации OAuth для безопасного доступа к серверу","Оптимизация ответов сервера MCP для улучшения производительности"],"ar":["إنشاء خوادم MCP مخصصة مع التكاملات API للوظيفة المتقدمة","تنفيذ التحقق من OAuth للوصول الآمن إلى الخادم","تحسين استجابات خادم MCP للأداء المحسّن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code or Claude Desktop installation","Must follow the 5 rules, including never hardcoding secrets and using the `cwd` property"],"zh":["需要安装Claude Code或Claude Desktop","必须遵循5条规则，包括永远不要硬编码密钥并使用`cwd`属性"],"ja":["Claude CodeまたはClaude Desktopのインストールが必要","5つのルールに従わなければならない、シークレットをハードコーディングしないことと`cwd`プロパティを使用することなど"],"ko":["Claude Code 또는 Claude Desktop 설치가 필요","5가지 규칙을 따라야 하며, 비밀을 하드 코딩하지 않으며 `cwd` 속성을 사용하는 등"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Claude Code o Claude Desktop","Debe seguir las 5 reglas, incluyendo nunca codificar secretos en duro y usar la propiedad `cwd`"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Claude Code ou de Claude Desktop","Doit suivre les 5 règles, y compris ne jamais durcir les secrets et utiliser la propriété `cwd`"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Claude Code oder Claude Desktop","Muss den 5 Regeln folgen, einschließlich dem Verbot, Geheimnisse hart zu codieren und die Eigenschaft `cwd` zu verwenden"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Claude Code ou Claude Desktop","Deve seguir as 5 regras, incluindo nunca codificar segredos em duro e usar a propriedade `cwd`"],"ru":["Требует установки Claude Code или Claude Desktop","Должно следовать 5 правилам, включая никогда не кодировать секреты вручную и использовать свойство `cwd`"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Claude Code أو Claude Desktop","يجب اتباع 5 قواعد، بما في ذلك أبداً تشفير الأسرار يدوياً واستخدام خاصية `cwd`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c774949f6