Writer是Synnovator重建的AI智能代理，用于提高开发效率","ja":"Spec Writerは、開発効率を向上させるためにSynnovatorから再構築されたAIエージェントです","ko":"Spec Writer는 개발 효율성을 향상시키기 위해 Synnovator에서 재구성 된 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"Spec-writer es una habilidad de AI que permite a los desarrolladores escribir especificaciones de manera eficiente con Synnovator Rebuild from Scratch","fr":"Spec-writer est une compétence d''IA qui permet aux développeurs de rédiger des spécifications de manière efficace avec Synnovator Rebuild from Scratch","de":"Spec-writer ist eine KI-Fähigkeit, die es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Spezifikationen effizient mit Synnovator Rebuild from Scratch zu schreiben","pt":"O spec-writer é uma ferramenta de IA que ajuda a reconstruir projetos do zero com especificações claras e concisas","ru":"ИИ Агент spec-writer помогает перестраивать проекты с нуля с четкими и краткими спецификациями","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي كاتب المواصفات تساعد في إعادة بناء المشاريع من الصفر مع مواصفات واضحة وموجزة","en":"Synnovator Rebuild from Scratch"},"definition":{"en":"Synnovator Rebuild from Scratch"},"features":{"zh":["支持多种编程语言","自动生成技术文档","提高开发效率","易于使用的界面","支持CLI命令"],"ja":["複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","技術文書を自動生成","開発効率を向上","使いやすいインターフェース","CLIコマンドをサポート"],"ko":["다중 프로그래밍 언어 지원","기술 문서 자동 생성","개발 효율성 향상","사용하기 쉬운 인터페이스","CLI 명령어 지원"],"es":["Escribir especificaciones de manera eficiente","Integración con Synnovator Rebuild from Scratch","Soporte para desarrolladores","Herramienta de AI para mejorar la productividad","Compatibilidad con múltiples formatos de especificaciones"],"fr":["Rédiger des spécifications de manière efficace","Intégration avec Synnovator Rebuild from Scratch","Support pour les développeurs","Outil d''IA pour améliorer la productivité","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats de spécifications"],"de":["Spezifikationen effizient schreiben","Integration mit Synnovator Rebuild from Scratch","Support für Entwickler","KI-Tool für verbesserte Produktivität","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Spezifikationsformaten"],"pt":["Reconstrução de projetos do zero","Criação de especificações claras e concisas","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento de software","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de saída","Otimização de processos de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Перестройка проектов с нуля","Создание четких и кратких спецификаций","Интеграция с инструментами разработки программного обеспечения","Поддержка нескольких форматов вывода","Оптимизация процессов разработки"],"ar":["إعادة بناء المشاريع من الصفر","إنشاء مواصفات واضحة وموجزة","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير البرمجيات","دعم العديد من صيغ الإخراج","تحسين عمليات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Spec Writer","什么是AI智能代理","Spec Writer安装","Spec Writer教程","AI智能代理工具","Spec Writer替代品","Spec Writer vs 其他工具"],"ja":["Spec Writerの使い方","AIエージェントとは","Spec Writerのインストール","Spec Writerのチュートリアル","AIエージェントツール","Spec Writerの代替","Spec Writerと他のツールの比較"],"ko":["Spec Writer 사용법","AI 에이전트란","Spec Writer 설치","Spec Writer 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 도구","Spec Writer 대체","Spec Writer와 다른 도구 비교"],"es":["cómo usar spec-writer","qué es spec-writer","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","spec-writer alternativa","instalar spec-writer","guía de configuración de spec-writer","mejores prácticas para escribir especificaciones"],"fr":["comment utiliser spec-writer","qu''est-ce que spec-writer","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","spec-writer alternative","installer spec-writer","guide de configuration de spec-writer","meilleures pratiques pour rédiger des spécifications"],"de":["wie man spec-writer verwendet","was ist spec-writer","KI-Tools für Entwickler","spec-writer Alternative","spec-writer installieren","Anleitung zur Konfiguration von spec-writer","beste Praktiken für das Schreiben von Spezifikationen"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","escrevedor de especificações","reconstruir projetos","desenvolvimento de software","spec-writer alternative","como usar spec-writer","guia de instalação do spec-writer","configuração do spec-writer"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","спецификации перестройки","перестройка проектов","разработка программного обеспечения","альтернативы spec-writer","как использовать spec-writer","руководство по установке spec-writer","настройка spec-writer"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كاتب المواصفات","إعادة بناء المشاريع","تنمية البرمجيات","بديل كاتب المواصفات","كيفية استخدام كاتب المواصفات","دليل تثبيت كاتب المواصفات","إعداد كاتب المواصفات"]}},"owner":"H2OSLabs","repo":"SynnovatorZero","repoPath":"H2OSLabs/SynnovatorZero","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.911Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"spec-writer","description":"Guide structured specification writing for AI coding agents using a 4-stage gated workflow (Specify, Plan, Tasks, Implement) and a 6-domain framework (Commands, Testing, Project Structure, Code Style, Git Workflow, Boundaries). Produces a SPEC.md file that serves as a living reference for the project. Use when user mentions writing a spec, creating a SPEC.md, setting up project guidelines, onboarding an AI agent to a codebase, or asks for structured project specification. Trigger phrases include write a spec, create a SPEC.md, set up project guidelines, spec out this project, define project standards.","bodyPreview":"# Spec Writer\n\n## Overview\n\nGuide users through writing a structured SPEC.md for AI coding agents using a 4-stage gated workflow. The spec covers six core domains drawn from analysis of effective agent configurations: Commands, Testing, Project Structure, Code Style, Git Workflow, and Boundaries.\n\n**Core rule:** Mirror the user''s language. If they write in Chinese, respond in Chinese. If in English, respond in English. Never hardcode a language.\n\n**Key principle:** Concrete over abstract. A real","body":"# Spec Writer\n\n## Overview\n\nGuide users through writing a structured SPEC.md for AI coding agents using a 4-stage gated workflow. The spec covers six core domains drawn from analysis of effective agent configurations: Commands, Testing, Project Structure, Code Style, Git Workflow, and Boundaries.\n\n**Core rule:** Mirror the user''s language. If they write in Chinese, respond in Chinese. If in English, respond in English. Never hardcode a language.\n\n**Key principle:** Concrete over abstract. A real code snippet beats a paragraph of description. A runnable command beats a tool name. A specific file path beats \"see the docs.\"\n\n## When to Offer\n\nOffer this workflow when:\n- User says \"write a spec\", \"create a SPEC.md\", \"spec out this project\"\n- User wants to set up project guidelines or standards for an AI agent\n- User asks how to onboard an AI coding agent to their codebase\n- User mentions spec-driven development or structured project documentation\n- User wants to define boundaries/rules for an AI coding agent\n\n**Initial offer:** Explain the 4-stage workflow and ask if they want to proceed or work freeform. If they decline, work freeform. If they accept, proceed to Stage 1.\n\n## Stage 1: Specify (Vision Gathering)\n\n**Goal:** Understand what is being built, for whom, and why. No technical details yet.\n\n### Branching: Greenfield vs Existing\n\nDetermine which path applies:\n\n**Greenfield project (building from scratch):**\n1. Ask: What are you building? Who is it for? What problem does it solve?\n2. Ask: What does success look like? How will you know the project works?\n3. Ask: Any constraints or non-negotiables? (timeline, technology mandates, etc.)\n4. Draft a 2-3 sentence Vision statement and Success Criteria checklist\n5. Present for approval\n\n**Existing project (adding a spec to existing code):**\n1. Ask: What is this project? Point me to the codebase.\n2. Explore the codebase: read `package.json`/`pyproject.toml`/`Cargo.toml`, scan directory structure, read README if present\n3. Draft a Vision statement based on what exists\n4. Ask: Is this accurate? What''s missing or wrong?\n5. Present for approval\n\n### Stage 1 Gate\n\nPresent the Vision and Success Criteria. User must approve before advancing.\n\nIf user wants changes, iterate. Only proceed to Stage 2 when user explicitly approves.\n\n**Output so far:** Vision section + Success Criteria checklist.\n\n## Stage 2: Plan (Six Domain Framework)\n\n**Goal:** Systematically collect information for all six domains.\n\nRead [references/six-domains-checklist.md](references/six-domains-checklist.md) for the detailed checklist of what to collect, output formats, mistakes to avoid, and questions to ask for each domain.\n\n### Workflow\n\n1. **For each domain** (Commands, Testing, Project Structure, Code Style, Git Workflow, Boundaries), follow this loop:\n   - Ask the domain-specific questions from the checklist\n   - For existing projects: also probe the codebase (read configs, scan files, check for linters/formatters)\n   - Draft the domain section in the checklist''s output format\n   - Present for user review\n\n2. **Boundaries get special treatment:**\n   - Read [references/boundary-patterns.md](references/boundary-patterns.md) for project-type-specific examples\n   - Always produce all three tiers: Always, Ask First, Never\n   - The \"Never commit secrets\" rule is mandatory in every spec\n   - Adapt patterns to the specific project rather than copying generic lists\n\n3. **Tech Stack:** Also collect the full tech stack during this stage (language, framework, database, testing framework, package manager, versions).\n\n### Stage 2 Gate\n\nPresent a summary of all six domains plus the tech stack. User must approve before advancing.\n\nIf any domain is incomplete or wrong, iterate on that domain. Only proceed to Stage 3 when all six domains are approved.\n\n**Output so far:** Vision + Success Criteria + Tech Stack + all six domains in draft form.\n\n## Stage 3: Tasks (Decomposition and Scaffolding)\n\n**Goal:** Assemble the approved content into a SPEC.md file using the template scaffold.\n\nRead [references/spec-template.md](references/spec-template.md) for the output template.\n\n### Workflow\n\n1. Create a new file `SPEC.md` (or the user''s preferred filename/location) using the template scaffold\n2. Fill in each template section with the content approved in Stages 1-2\n3. For any optional sections (Architecture Notes, Version History), ask if the user wants them included\n4. Set Version History to `1.0 | [today''s date] | Initial specification`\n\n### Stage 3 Gate\n\nPresent the complete SPEC.md draft. User must approve the assembled document.\n\nKey review points to highlight:\n- Does the assembled document flow well as a whole?\n- Are there contradictions between sections?\n- Is anything missing that became obvious when seeing everything together?\n\nIterate until user approves.\n\n## Stage 4: Implement (Validation and Finalization)\n\n**Goal:** Validate completeness, finalize the spec, and establish it as the project''s living reference.\n\n### Workflow\n\n1. **Self-check:** Re-read the complete SPEC.md and verify:\n   - All six domains have substantive content (not placeholders)\n   - Boundaries has all three tiers\n   - Commands section has actual runnable commands with flags\n   - Code Style section has at least one real code snippet\n   - Success Criteria are measurable\n\n2. **Script validation:** Run the validation script:\n   ```bash\n   uv run python [skill-path]/scripts/validate_spec.py [spec-path]\n   ```\n   Replace `[skill-path]` with the path to this skill''s directory and `[spec-path]` with the SPEC.md file path.\n\n3. **Fix any failures:** If validation finds gaps, go back to the relevant section and fix it. Re-run until all checks pass.\n\n4. **Final presentation:** Show the user the validation results and the complete SPEC.md. Ask for final approval.\n\n### Stage 4 Gate\n\nUser gives final approval. The spec is done.\n\n## Post-Completion\n\nAfter the spec is approved:\n\n1. **Living document guidance:** Remind the user that SPEC.md is a living document:\n   - Update it when requirements change\n   - Update it when technical decisions are made\n   - Track changes in Version History\n   - Commit it to version control alongside code\n\n2. **Integration suggestions:**\n   - Place SPEC.md at the project root or in a `specs/` directory\n   - Reference it from CLAUDE.md or agents.md if applicable\n   - Consider adding the validation script to CI\n\n3. **Next steps:** Ask if the user wants to:\n   - Start implementing based on the spec\n   - Create task breakdowns from the spec\n   - Review an existing spec against this framework\n\n## Handling Deviations\n\n**User wants to skip stages:** Allow it, but warn that skipping Stage 2 (Plan) risks an incomplete spec. If they skip, note which domains weren''t covered.\n\n**User wants a partial spec:** Support single-domain mode — e.g., \"just help me define boundaries.\" Follow the Stage 2 workflow for that domain only, then validate just that section.\n\n**User has an existing SPEC.md to audit:** Run `validate_spec.py` on it first, then walk through any FAIL items using the six-domains checklist.\n\n**User is updating, not creating:** Read the existing SPEC.md, identify what changed, update the relevant sections, bump the version in Version History.\n\n## Quality Principles\n\n1. **Concrete over abstract:** A runnable command beats a tool name. A code snippet beats a style description. A file path beats \"see the docs.\"\n\n2. **Boundaries are non-negotiable:** Every spec must have all three tiers. \"Never commit secrets\" is always included. Generic boundaries (\"don''t break things\") are rejected — push for specifics.\n\n3. **Six domains are mandatory:** No spec is complete without all six. If the user insists on skipping one, note the gap explicitly in the spec.\n\n4. **The spec is for an AI agent, not a human:** Write for parsability. Use headers, lists, and code blocks. Avoid prose paragraphs where structured formats work better.\n\n5. **Medium freedom template:** The six domains are fixed scaffolding. Content within each domain is flexible and adapts to the project. Don''t force patterns that don''t fit.\n\n6. **Validate deterministically:** Always run the validation script. Human judgment catches semantic issues; the script catches structural ones. Both matter.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:21:38.373Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Coding Agents requiring structured specification development using a 4-stage gated workflow.","zh":"适用于需要使用4阶段有门槛工作流程开发结构化规格的AI编码代理。","ja":"4段階のゲートドワークフローを使用して構造化された仕様を開発する必要があるAIコーディングエージェントに適しています。","ko":"구조화된 사양을 개발하기 위해 4단계 게이트德 워크플로를 사용해야 하는 AI 코딩 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación de IA que requieren el desarrollo de especificaciones estructuradas utilizando un flujo de trabajo con 4 etapas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codage IA nécessitant un développement de spécifications structurées à l''aide d''un flux de travail à 4 étapes","de":"Ideal für AI-Coding-Agents, die eine strukturierte Spezifikationsentwicklung unter Verwendung eines 4-Stufen-Workflows erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificação de IA que exigem desenvolvimento de especificações estruturadas usando um fluxo de trabalho com portas em 4 etapas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодирования ИИ, требующих разработки структурированных спецификаций с использованием 4-этапного потока работы с шлюзами.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء القائمين على البرمجة الاصطناعية الذين يتطلبون تطوير مواصفات متتالية باستخدام تدفق عمل ذي بوابة بأربع مراحل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive SPEC.md files covering core domains like Commands, Testing, and Git Workflow, utilizing a concrete and language-mirroring approach, and supporting file formats like Markdown.","zh":"赋予代理生成全面SPEC.md文件的能力，涵盖命令、测试和Git工作流等核心域，使用具体的语言映射方法，并支持Markdown等文件格式。","ja":"エージェントがコマンド、テスト、Gitワークフローなどのコアドメインを網羅した包括的なSPEC.mdファイルを生成する能力を提供します。具体的で言語ミラーリングアプローチを使用し、Markdownなどのファイル形式をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 명령, 테스트 및 Git 워크플로우와 같은 코어 도메인을 포함한 포괄적인 SPEC.md 파일을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 구체적이고 언어 미러링 접근 방식을 사용하며 Markdown와 같은 파일 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para generar archivos SPEC.md completos que cubren dominios básicos como Comandos, Pruebas y Flujo de trabajo de Git, utilizando un enfoque concreto y de reflejo del lenguaje, y admitiendo formatos de archivo como Markdown","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des fichiers SPEC.md complets couvrant des domaines de base tels que les Commandes, les Tests et le Flux de travail Git, en utilisant une approche concrète et miroir du langage, et en prenant en charge des formats de fichiers tels que Markdown","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende SPEC.md-Dateien zu generieren, die Kernbereiche wie Befehle, Tests und Git-Workflow abdecken, unter Verwendung eines konkreten und sprachspiegelnden Ansatzes und Unterstützung von Dateiformaten wie Markdown","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar arquivos SPEC.md abrangentes que cobrem domínios principais como Comandos, Testes e Fluxo de Trabalho do Git, utilizando uma abordagem concreta e espelhamento de linguagem, e suportando formatos de arquivo como Markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать полные файлы SPEC.md, охватывающие основные области, такие как Команды, Тестирование и Поток работы Git, с использованием конкретного и зеркального языка подхода, а также поддержкой форматов файлов, таких как Markdown.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توليد ملفات SPEC.md شاملة تغطي المجالات الأساسية مثل الأوامر و الاختبار و تدفق عمل Git، باستخدام نهج ملموس ومرآة اللغة، ودعم تنسيقات الملفات مثل Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Guiding users through creating structured specifications for AI projects","Automating the generation of SPEC.md files for consistent project documentation","Debugging agent configurations using the six core domains outlined in the spec"],"zh":["指导用户为AI项目创建结构化的规格","自动为一致的项目文档生成SPEC.md文件","使用规格中概述的六个核心域调试代理配置"],"ja":["AIプロジェクトの構造化された仕様の作成をユーザーに導く","一貫したプロジェクトドキュメントのためにSPEC.mdファイルを自動生成する","仕様に概説されている6つのコアドメインを使用してエージェントの構成をデバッグする"],"ko":["AI 프로젝트를 위한 구조화된 사양을 생성하기 위한 사용자 안내","일관된 프로젝트 문서화를 위한 SPEC.md 파일 자동 생성","사양에概説된 6개의 코어 도메인을 사용하여 에이전트 구성 디버깅"],"es":["Guiar a los usuarios a través de la creación de especificaciones estructuradas para proyectos de IA","Automatizar la generación de archivos SPEC.md para una documentación de proyecto coherente","Depurar configuraciones de agentes utilizando los seis dominios básicos descritos en la especificación"],"fr":["Guider les utilisateurs à travers la création de spécifications structurées pour les projets IA","Automatiser la génération de fichiers SPEC.md pour une documentation de projet cohérente","Déboguer les configurations d''agents en utilisant les six domaines de base décrits dans la spécification"],"de":["Benutzer durch die Erstellung von strukturierten Spezifikationen für AI-Projekte führen","Automatisierung der Erstellung von SPEC.md-Dateien für eine konsistente Projektdokumentation","Fehlerbehebung bei Agentenkonfigurationen unter Verwendung der sechs Kernbereiche, die in der Spezifikation beschrieben sind"],"pt":["Orientar os usuários na criação de especificações estruturadas para projetos de IA","Automatizar a geração de arquivos SPEC.md para documentação de projeto consistente","Depurar configurações de agente usando os seis domínios principais delineados na especificação"],"ru":["Руководство пользователями при создании структурированных спецификаций для проектов ИИ","Автоматизация генерации файлов SPEC.md для последовательной документации проекта","Отладка конфигураций агентов с использованием шести основных областей, изложенных в спецификации"],"ar":["توجيه المستخدمين في إنشاء مواصفات متتالية لمشاريع الذكاء الاصطناعي","تأهيل توليد ملفات SPEC.md بشكل تلقائي สำหร توثيق مشروع متسق","تصحيح أخطاء تكوين الوكيل باستخدام المجالات الأساسية الستة المحددة في المواصفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user input to mirror their language","Limited to generating SPEC.md files in Markdown format","Needs a 4-stage gated workflow for effective specification development"],"zh":["需要用户输入来映射他们的语言","仅限于生成Markdown格式的SPEC.md文件","需要4阶段有门槛工作流程来有效地开发规格"],"ja":["エージェントの言語をミラーするためにユーザー入力が必要","SPEC.mdファイルはMarkdown形式でのみ生成可能","有効な仕様開発のために4段階のゲートドワークフローが必要"],"ko":["에이전트의 언어를 미러하기 위해 사용자 입력이 필요","SPEC.md 파일은 Markdown 형식으로만 생성 가능","유효한 사양 개발을 위해 4단계 게이트德 워크플로가 필요"],"es":["Requiere la entrada del usuario para reflejar su lenguaje","Limitado a la generación de archivos SPEC.md en formato Markdown","Necesita un flujo de trabajo de 4 etapas para un desarrollo de especificaciones efectivo"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour refléter leur langage","Limité à la génération de fichiers SPEC.md au format Markdown","Nécessite un flux de travail à 4 étapes pour un développement de spécifications efficace"],"de":["Benutzereingabe erforderlich, um ihre Sprache widerzuspiegeln","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von SPEC.md-Dateien im Markdown-Format","Benötigt einen 4-Stufen-Workflow für eine effektive Spezifikationsentwicklung"],"pt":["Exige entrada do usuário para espelhar sua linguagem","Limitado a gerar arquivos SPEC.md no formato Markdown","Precisa de um fluxo de trabalho com portas em 4 etapas para desenvolvimento eficaz de especificações"],"ru":["Требует ввода пользователя для зеркального отражения его языка","Ограничен генерацией файлов SPEC.md только в формате Markdown","Требует 4-этапного потока работы с шлюзами для эффективного развития спецификаций"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لمرآة لغته","محدود بتوليد ملفات SPEC.md بتنسيق Markdown فقط","يحتاج إلى تدفق عمل ببوابة بأربع مراحل لتطوير مواصفات فعال"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"774f32769541936c11ea1fadf892f114464fbf82d6505a6d6c56b97e2ce2735a","qualityScore":37}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('jesus-bazan-entel/apolo-lms-admin/mobile-design', 'community', 'jesus-bazan-entel', 'apolo-lms-admin', 'jesus-bazan-entel/apolo-lms-admin', 'mobile-design', 0, 0, 37, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.916Z', '2026-03-02T02:25:18.040Z', 'ec74cda5e1954572e4282c3aaa9c1c32ec743cef83c53f8aef622c00dc8f0682', '{"id":"jesus-bazan-entel/apolo-lms-admin/mobile-design","name":"mobile-design","description":{"zh":"Apolo LMS Admin是一种AI智能手机设计工具，帮助开发者提高开发效率","ja":"Apolo LMS AdminはAIエージェントのモバイルデザインツールで、開発者の開発効率を向上させる","ko":"Apolo LMS Admin은 AI 에이전트 모바일 디자인 툴로 개발자의 개발 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Apolo LMS Admin es una herramienta para diseñar experiencias móviles con tecnologías de agente de inteligencia artificial","fr":"Apolo LMS Admin est un outil pour concevoir des expériences mobiles avec des technologies d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","de":"Apolo LMS Admin ist ein Tool für die Erstellung mobiler Erfahrungen mit KI-Agent-Technologien","pt":"O Apolo LMS Admin oferece ferramentas de design móvel para melhorar a experiência do usuário. Aprenda como utilizar essas ferramentas para criar interfaces móveis eficazes.","ru":"Apolo LMS Admin предлагает ИИ Агенты для мобильного дизайна, чтобы улучшить пользовательский опыт. Узнайте, как использовать эти инструменты для создания эффективных мобильных интерфейсов.","ar":"يتمتع Apolo LMS Admin بأدوات تصميم الهاتف المحمول لتحسين تجربة المستخدم. تعرف على كيفية استخدام هذه الأدوات لإنشاء واجهات الهاتف المحمول الفعالة.","en":"Apolo LMS Admin"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能手机设计工具","ja":"AIエージェントのモバイルデザイン","ko":"AI 에이전트 모바일 디자인","es":"Diseño Móvil con Herramientas de Agente de Inteligencia A...","fr":"Conception Mobile avec Outils d''Agent d''Intelligence Arti...","de":"Mobile Design mit KI-Agent-Tools","pt":"Ferramentas de Design Móvel para Apolo LMS Admin","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Мобильного Дизайна в Apolo LMS Admin","ar":"أدوات تصميم الهاتف المحمول لـ Apolo LMS Admin","en":"mobile-design"},"description":{"zh":"Apolo LMS Admin是一种AI智能手机设计工具，帮助开发者提高开发效率","ja":"Apolo LMS AdminはAIエージェントのモバイルデザインツールで、開発者の開発効率を向上させる","ko":"Apolo LMS Admin은 AI 에이전트 모바일 디자인 툴로 개발자의 개발 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Apolo LMS Admin es una herramienta para diseñar experiencias móviles con tecnologías de agente de inteligencia artificial","fr":"Apolo LMS Admin est un outil pour concevoir des expériences mobiles avec des technologies d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","de":"Apolo LMS Admin ist ein Tool für die Erstellung mobiler Erfahrungen mit KI-Agent-Technologien","pt":"O Apolo LMS Admin oferece ferramentas de design móvel para melhorar a experiência do usuário. Aprenda como utilizar essas ferramentas para criar interfaces m...","ru":"Apolo LMS Admin предлагает ИИ Агенты для мобильного дизайна, чтобы улучшить пользовательский опыт. Узнайте, как использовать эти инструменты для создания эфф...","ar":"يتمتع Apolo LMS Admin بأدوات تصميم الهاتف المحمول لتحسين تجربة المستخدم. تعرف على كيفية استخدام هذه الأدوات لإنشاء واجهات الهاتف المحمول الفعالة.","en":"Apolo LMS Admin"},"definition":{"en":"Apolo LMS Admin"},"features":{"zh":["支持React和Node.js","提供CLI工具","实现自动化设计","提高开发效率","支持多种设计模式"],"ja":["ReactとNode.jsをサポート","CLIツールを提供","自動化設計を実現","開発効率を向上","多種のデザインパターンをサポート"],"ko":["React와 Node.js를 지원","CLI 툴을 제공","자동화 디자인을 구현","개발 효율성을 향상","다양한 디자인 패턴을 지원"],"es":["Diseño de interfaces de usuario móviles","Desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles con React","Integración con herramientas de agente de inteligencia artificial","Creación de experiencias de usuario personalizadas","Optimización para dispositivos móviles"],"fr":["Conception d''interfaces utilisateur mobiles","Développement d''applications mobiles avec React","Intégration avec des outils d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","Création d''expériences utilisateur personnalisées","Optimisation pour les appareils mobiles"],"de":["Erstellung von Benutzeroberflächen fü