 de contrats intelligents","Intégration avec les outils de développement d''Ethereum","Prise en charge de plusieurs réseaux Ethereum"],"de":["Generierung von TypeScript-Code für Ethereum","Anwendungsprogrammierschnittstelle (API) für Ethereum","Kompatibilität mit der Entwicklung von Smart Contracts","Integration mit Ethereum-Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Ethereum-Netzwerke"],"pt":["Interface em TypeScript para Ethereum","Desenvolvimento de soluções mais eficientes","Interação simples com a blockchain","Melhoria da produtividade dos desenvolvedores","Suporte a desenvolvedores de blockchain"],"ru":["Интерфейс на TypeScript для Ethereum","Разработка более эффективных решений","Простой способ взаимодействия с блокчейном","Повышение производительности разработчиков","Поддержка разработчиков блокчейна"],"ar":["واجهة برمجة في TypeScript لإثيريوم","تطوير حلول أكثر كفاءة","وسيلة بسيطة للتفاعل مع البلوكشين","تحسين إنتاجية المطورين","دعم مطوري البلوكشين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tempo-Codegen","以太坊开发","TypeScript接口","AI智能工具","如何使用Tempo-Codegen","Tempo-Codegen安装","Tempo-Codegen设置指南","以太坊TypeScript教程"],"ja":["Tempo-Codegen","イーサリアム開発","TypeScriptインターフェース","AIエージェント","Tempo-Codegenの使用方法","Tempo-Codegenのインストール","Tempo-Codegenの設定ガイド","イーサリアムTypeScriptチュートリアル"],"ko":["Tempo-Codegen","이더리움 개발","TypeScript 인터페이스","AI 에이전트","Tempo-Codegen 사용 방법","Tempo-Codegen 설치","Tempo-Codegen 설정 가이드","이더리움 TypeScript 튜토리얼"],"es":["cómo usar tempo-codegen","qué es tempo-codegen","tempo-codegen alternativa","tempo-codegen vs web3.js","instalación de tempo-codegen","guía de configuración de tempo-codegen","desarrollo de contratos inteligentes con tempo-codegen"],"fr":["comment utiliser tempo-codegen","qu''est-ce que tempo-codegen","alternative à tempo-codegen","tempo-codegen vs web3.js","installation de tempo-codegen","guide de configuration de tempo-codegen","développement de contrats intelligents avec tempo-codegen"],"de":["wie man tempo-codegen verwendet","was ist tempo-codegen","tempo-codegen Alternative","tempo-codegen vs web3.js","Installation von tempo-codegen","Einrichtungsanleitung für tempo-codegen","Entwicklung von Smart Contracts mit tempo-codegen"],"pt":["tempo-codegen","ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento em ethereum","typescript para ethereum","como usar tempo-codegen","tempo-codegen vs outras ferramentas","guia de instalação do tempo-codegen","configuração do tempo-codegen","exemplos de uso do tempo-codegen"],"ru":["tempo-codegen","ии агенты","разработка на ethereum","typescript для ethereum","как использовать tempo-codegen","tempo-codegen vs другие инструменты","руководство по установке tempo-codegen","настройка tempo-codegen","примеры использования tempo-codegen"],"ar":["tempo-codegen","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير على إثيريوم","typescript ليتيرمين","كيفية استخدام tempo-codegen","tempo-codegen مقابل أدوات أخرى","دليل تثبيت tempo-codegen","إعداد tempo-codegen","أمثلة على استخدام tempo-codegen"]}},"owner":"wevm","repo":"viem","repoPath":"wevm/viem","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.922Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tempo-codegen","description":"Skill for generating Tempo code.","bodyPreview":"# Tempo Code Generation\n\nWhen generating actions (in `src/tempo/actions/`), follow these guidelines.\n\nAn example of a generated action set can be found in `src/tempo/actions/token.ts`.\n\n## Source of Truth\n\n- **All actions must be based on precompile contract specifications** in `test/tempo/docs/specs/`.\n- It could be likely that some interfaces may be inconsistent between the specs (`test/tempo/docs/specs`) and the precompiles (`test/tempo/crates/contracts/src/precompiles`). Always prefer the pr","body":"# Tempo Code Generation\n\nWhen generating actions (in `src/tempo/actions/`), follow these guidelines.\n\nAn example of a generated action set can be found in `src/tempo/actions/token.ts`.\n\n## Source of Truth\n\n- **All actions must be based on precompile contract specifications** in `test/tempo/docs/specs/`.\n- It could be likely that some interfaces may be inconsistent between the specs (`test/tempo/docs/specs`) and the precompiles (`test/tempo/crates/contracts/src/precompiles`). Always prefer the precompile interfaces over the specs.\n- If the specification is unclear or missing details, **prompt the developer** for guidance rather than making assumptions\n\n## Documentation Requirements\n\nAll actions **must include comprehensive JSDoc** with:\n\n1. **Function description** - What the action does\n2. **`@example` block** - Complete working example showing:\n   - Required imports (`createClient`, `http`, action imports)\n   - Client setup with chain and transport\n   - Action usage with realistic parameters\n   - Expected return value handling (if applicable)\n3. **`@param` tags** - For each parameter (client, parameters)\n4. **`@returns` tag** - Description of the return value\n\nExample:\n```typescript\n/**\n * Gets the pool ID for a token pair.\n *\n * @example\n * ```ts\n * import { createClient, http } from ''viem''\n * import { tempo } from ''tempo.ts/chains''\n * import { Actions } from ''tempo.ts/viem''\n *\n * const client = createClient({\n *   chain: tempo({ feeToken: ''0x20c0000000000000000000000000000000000001'' })\n *   transport: http(),\n * })\n *\n * const poolId = await Actions.amm.getPoolId(client, {\n *   userToken: ''0x...'',\n *   validatorToken: ''0x...'',\n * })\n * ```\n *\n * @param client - Client.\n * @param parameters - Parameters.\n * @returns The pool ID.\n */\n```\n\n## Action Types\n\n### Read-Only Actions\n\nFor view/pure functions that only read state:\n\n- Use `readContract` from `viem/actions`\n- Return type should use `ReadContractReturnType`\n- Parameters extend `ReadParameters`\n\n### Mutate-Based Actions\n\nFor state-changing functions, **both variants must be implemented**:\n\n**1. Standard Async Variant**\n\n- Uses `writeContract` from `viem/actions`\n- Returns transaction hash\n- Async operation that doesn''t wait for confirmation\n\n```typescript\nexport async function myAction<\n  chain extends Chain | undefined,\n  account extends Account | undefined,\n>(\n  client: Client<Transport, chain, account>,\n  parameters: myAction.Parameters<chain, account>,\n): Promise<myAction.ReturnValue> {\n  return myAction.inner(writeContract, client, parameters)\n}\n```\n\n**2. Sync Variant (`*Sync`)**\n\n- Named with `Sync` suffix (e.g., `mintSync`, `burnSync`, `rebalanceSwapSync`)\n- Uses `writeContractSync` from `viem/actions`\n- **Waits for transaction confirmation**\n- Returns both the receipt and extracted event data\n- **Must use `extractEvent` to get return values** (not `simulateContract`)\n\n```typescript\nexport async function myActionSync<\n  chain extends Chain | undefined,\n  account extends Account | undefined,\n>(\n  client: Client<Transport, chain, account>,\n  parameters: myActionSync.Parameters<chain, account>,\n): Promise<myActionSync.ReturnValue> {\n  const { throwOnReceiptRevert = true, ...rest } = parameters\n  const receipt = await myAction.inner(writeContractSync, client, {\n    ...rest,\n    throwOnReceiptRevert,\n  } as never)\n  const { args } = myAction.extractEvent(receipt.logs)\n  return {\n    ...args,\n    receipt,\n  } as never\n}\n```\n\n## Namespace Properties\n\nAll actions **must include** the following components within their namespace:\n\n### 1. `Parameters` Type\n\n```typescript\n// Read actions\nexport type Parameters = ReadParameters & Args \n\n// Write actions\nexport type Parameters<\n  chain extends Chain | undefined = Chain | undefined,\n  account extends Account | undefined = Account | undefined,\n> = WriteParameters<chain, account> & Args \n```\n\n### 2. `Args` Type\n\nArguments must be documented with JSDoc.\n\n```typescript\nexport type Args = {\n  /** JSDoc for each argument */\n  argName: Type\n}\n```\n\n### 3. `ReturnValue` Type\n\n```typescript\n// Read actions\nexport type ReturnValue = ReadContractReturnType<typeof Abis.myAbi, ''functionName'', never>\n\n// Write actions\nexport type ReturnValue = WriteContractReturnType\n```\n\n### 4. `ErrorType` Type (for write actions)\n\nWrite actions must include an `ErrorType` export. Use `BaseErrorType` from `viem` as a placeholder with a TODO comment for future exhaustive error typing:\n\n```typescript\n// TODO: exhaustive error type\nexport type ErrorType = BaseErrorType\n```\n\n### 5. `call` Function\n\n**Required for all actions** - enables composition with other viem actions:\n\n```typescript\n/**\n * Defines a call to the `functionName` function.\n *\n * Can be passed as a parameter to:\n * - [`estimateContractGas`](https://viem.sh/docs/contract/estimateContractGas): estimate the gas cost of the call\n * - [`simulateContract`](https://viem.sh/docs/contract/simulateContract): simulate the call\n * - [`sendCalls`](https://viem.sh/docs/actions/wallet/sendCalls): send multiple calls\n *\n * @example\n * ```ts\n * import { createClient, http, walletActions } from ''viem''\n * import { tempo } from ''tempo.ts/chains''\n * import { Actions } from ''tempo.ts/viem''\n *\n * const client = createClient({\n *   chain: tempo({ feeToken: ''0x20c0000000000000000000000000000000000001'' })\n *   transport: http(),\n * }).extend(walletActions)\n *\n * const hash = await client.sendTransaction({\n *   calls: [actions.amm.myAction.call({ arg1, arg2 })],\n * })\n * ```\n *\n * @param args - Arguments.\n * @returns The call.\n */\nexport function call(args: Args) {\n  return defineCall({\n    address: Addresses.contractName,\n    abi: Abis.contractName,\n    args: [/* transformed args */],\n    functionName: ''functionName'',\n  })\n}\n```\n\nThe `call` function enables these use cases:\n- `sendCalls` - Batch multiple calls in one transaction\n- `sendTransaction` with `calls` - Send transaction with multiple operations\n- `multicall` - Execute multiple calls in parallel\n- `estimateContractGas` - Estimate gas costs\n- `simulateContract` - Simulate execution\n\n### 6. `extractEvent` Function (for mutate-based actions)\n\n**Required for all actions that emit events**:\n\n```typescript\n/**\n * Extracts the `EventName` event from logs.\n *\n * @param logs - The logs.\n * @returns The `EventName` event.\n */\nexport function extractEvent(logs: Log[]) {\n  const [log] = parseEventLogs({\n    abi: Abis.contractName,\n    logs,\n    eventName: ''EventName'',\n    strict: true,\n  })\n  if (!log) throw new Error(''`EventName` event not found.'')\n  return log\n}\n```\n\n### 7. `inner` Function (for write actions)\n\n```typescript\n/** @internal */\nexport async function inner<\n  action extends typeof writeContract | typeof writeContractSync,\n  chain extends Chain | undefined,\n  account extends Account | undefined,\n>(\n  action: action,\n  client: Client<Transport, chain, account>,\n  parameters: Parameters<chain, account>,\n): Promise<ReturnType<action>> {\n  const { arg1, arg2, ...rest } = parameters\n  const call = myAction.call({ arg1, arg2 })\n  return (await action(client, {\n    ...rest,\n    ...call,\n  } as never)) as never\n}\n```\n\n## Namespace Structure\n\nOrganize actions using namespace pattern:\n\n```typescript\nexport async function myAction(...) { ... }\n\nexport namespace myAction {\n  export type Parameters = ...\n  export type Args = ...\n  export type ReturnValue = ...\n  \n  export async function inner(...) { ... }  // for write actions\n  export function call(args: Args) { ... }\n  export function extractEvent(logs: Log[]) { ... }  // for mutate actions\n}\n```\n\n## Decision-Making\n\nWhen encountering situations that require judgment:\n\n- **Specification ambiguities**: Prompt developer for clarification\n- **Missing contract details**: Request ABI or specification update\n- **Event structure uncertainty**: Ask for event definition\n- **Parameter transformations**: Confirm expected input/output formats\n- **Edge cases**: Discuss handling strategy with developer\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n- Action names should match contract function names (in camelCase)\n- Sync variants use `Sync` suffix (e.g., `myActionSync`)\n- Event names in `extractEvent` should match contract event names exactly\n- Namespace components should be exported within the action''s namespace\n\n## Testing\n\nTests should be co-located with actions in `*action-name*.test.ts` files. Reference contract tests in `test/tempo/crates/precompiles/` for expected behavior. \n\nSee `src/tempo/actions/token.test.ts` for a comprehensive example of test patterns and structure.\n\n### Test Structure\n\nOrganize tests by action name with a default test case and behavior-specific tests:\n\n```typescript\ndescribe(''actionName'', () => {\n  test(''default'', async () => {\n    // Test the primary/happy path scenario\n    const { receipt, ...result } = await Actions.namespace.actionSync(client, {\n      param1: value1,\n      param2: value2,\n    })\n    \n    expect(receipt).toBeDefined()\n    expect(result).toMatchInlineSnapshot(`...`)\n  })\n\n  test(''behavior: specific edge case'', async () => {\n    // Test specific behaviors, edge cases, or variations\n  })\n\n  test(''behavior: error conditions'', async () => {\n    // Test error handling\n    await expect(\n      actions.namespace.actionSync(client, { ... })\n    ).rejects.toThrow()\n  })\n})\n\ndescribe.todo(''unimplementedAction'')\n```"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:23.832Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Ethereum-focused AI Agents requiring automated action generation based on precompile contract specifications","zh":"适合以太坊为重点的AI代理，需要根据预编译合约规格生成自动化操作","ja":"Ethereumに焦点を当てたAIエージェントに適しており、事前コンパイル契約仕様に基づいて自動操作を生成する必要がある","ko":"이더리움에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 사전 컴파일 계약 명세에 따라 자동화된 동작을 생성해야 함","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA con enfoque en Ethereum que requieren generación de acciones automatizadas basadas en especificaciones de contrato precompilado","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur Ethereum nécessitant une génération d''actions automatisée basée sur des spécifications de contrat précompilé","de":"Ideal für Ethereum-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine automatisierte Aktionserzeugung basierend auf vorcompilierten Vertragspezifikationen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em Ethereum que requerem geração automática de ações com base em especificações de contrato pré-compilado","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Ethereum, требующих автоматизированного генерирования действий на основе спецификаций предварительно скомпилированных контрактов","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على Ethereum و الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد إجراءات آلي dựa على مواصفات العقد المجمعة مسبقًا"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate TypeScript interfaces for Ethereum using precompile contract specs, ensuring consistency with the source of truth in specs and precompiles, and leveraging file formats like TypeScript","zh":"赋予代理根据预编译合约规格生成以太坊的TypeScript接口的能力，确保规格和预编译之间的一致性，并利用TypeScript等文件格式","ja":"事前コンパイル契約仕様に基づいてEthereumのTypeScriptインターフェイスを生成するエージェントの能力を提供し、仕様と事前コンパイルの一貫性を確保し、TypeScriptなどのファイル形式を利用する","ko":"사전 컴파일 계약 명세를 기반으로 이더리움의 TypeScript 인터페이스를 생성하는 에이전트의 기능을 제공하며, 명세와 사전 컴파일 간의 일관성을 보장하고, TypeScript와 같은 파일 형식을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar interfaces de TypeScript para Ethereum utilizando especificaciones de contrato precompilado, garantizando la consistencia con la fuente de verdad en las especificaciones y los precompilados, y aprovechando formatos de archivo como TypeScript","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des interfaces TypeScript pour Ethereum en utilisant des spécifications de contrat précompilé, en garantissant la cohérence avec la source de vérité dans les spécifications et les précompilés, et en exploitant des formats de fichier tels que TypeScript","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, TypeScript-Schnittstellen für Ethereum zu generieren, indem sie vorcompilierte Vertragspezifikationen verwenden, um die Konsistenz mit der Quelle der Wahrheit in den Spezifikationen und Vorcompilaten sicherzustellen und Dateiformate wie TypeScript zu nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerarem interfaces TypeScript para Ethereum usando especificações de contrato pré-compilado, garantindo a consistência com a fonte de verdade nas especificações e pré-compilados, e aproveitando formatos de arquivo como TypeScript","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать интерфейсы TypeScript для Ethereum с использованием спецификаций предварительно скомпилированных контрактов, обеспечивая согласованность с источником истины в спецификациях и предварительных компиляциях, и использует форматы файлов, такие как TypeScript","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توليد واجهات برمجة TypeScript ل Ethereum باستخدام مواصفات العقد المجمعة مسبقًا، وتضمن الاتساق مع مصدر الحقيقة في المواصفات والمجمعات، واستخدام صيغ الملفات مثل TypeScript"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating actions based on precompile contract specifications","Validating interface consistency between specs and precompiles","Automating TypeScript interface creation for Ethereum applications"],"zh":["根据预编译合约规格生成操作","验证规格和预编译之间的接口一致性","自动为以太坊应用程序生成TypeScript接口"],"ja":["事前コンパイル契約仕様に基づいて操作を生成する","仕様と事前コンパイルの間のインターフェイスの一貫性を検証する","Ethereumアプリケーション用のTypeScriptインターフェイスを自動生成する"],"ko":["사전 컴파일 계약 명세를 기반으로 동작을 생성","명세와 사전 컴파일 간의 인터페이스 일관성을 검증","이더리움 애플리케이션을 위한 TypeScript 인터페이스를 자동 생성"],"es":["Generación de acciones basadas en especificaciones de contrato precompilado","Validación de la consistencia de la interfaz entre especificaciones y precompilados","Automatización de la creación de interfaces de TypeScript para aplicaciones de Ethereum"],"fr":["Génération d''actions basées sur des spécifications de contrat précompilé","Validation de la cohérence de l''interface entre les spécifications et les précompilés","Automatisation de la création d''interfaces TypeScript pour les applications Ethereum"],"de":["Generierung von Aktionen basierend auf vorcompilierten Vertragspezifikationen","Validierung der Konsistenz der Schnittstelle zwischen Spezifikationen und Vorcompilaten","Automatisierung der Erstellung von TypeScript-Schnittstellen für Ethereum-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Geração de ações com base em especificações de contrato pré-compilado","Validação da consistência da interface entre especificações e pré-compilados","Criação automática de interfaces TypeScript para aplicações Ethereum"],"ru":["Генерирование действий на основе спецификаций предварительно скомпилированных контрактов","Проверка согласованности интерфейса между спецификациями и предварительными компиляциями","Автоматизированное создание интерфейсов TypeScript для приложений Ethereum"],"ar":["توليد الإجراءات المستندة إلى مواصفات العقد المجمعة مسبقًا","التحقق من الاتساق في الواجهة بين المواصفات والمجمعات","إنشاء آلي لواجهات برمجة TypeScript لتطبيقات Ethereum"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to precompile contract specifications","Dependent on consistency between specs and precompiles","TypeScript interface generation only"],"zh":["需要访问预编译合约规格","依赖于规格和预编译之间的一致性","仅支持TypeScript接口生成"],"ja":["事前コンパイル契約仕様へのアクセスが必要","仕様と事前コンパイルの一貫性に依存する","TypeScriptインターフェイス生成のみをサポート"],"ko":["사전 컴파일 계약 명세에 대한 액세스가 필요","명세와 사전 컴파일 간의 일관성에 의존","TypeScript 인터페이스 생성만 지원"],"es":["Requiere acceso a especificaciones de contrato precompilado","Dependiente de la consistencia entre especificaciones y precompilados","Generación de interfaces de TypeScript solo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux spécifications de contrat précompilé","Dépend de la cohérence entre les spécifications et les précompilés","Génération d''interfaces TypeScript uniquement"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf vorcompilierte Vertragspezifikationen","Abhängig von der Konsistenz zwischen Spezifikationen und Vorcompilaten","Nur Generierung von TypeScript-Schnittstellen"],"pt":["Requer acesso às especificações de contrato pré-compilado","Dependente da consistência entre especificações e pré-compilados","Geração de interface TypeScript apenas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к спецификациям предварительно скомпилированных контрактов","Зависит от согласованности между спецификациями и предварительными компиляциями","Генерирование только интерфейсов TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مواصفات العقد المجمعة مسبقًا","يعتمد على الاتساق بين المواصفات والمجمعات","توليد واجهة برمجة TypeScript فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2bdad55fe4ed7d38350e90cb781370032f54d16db05ad642de2329b3983d898b","qualityScore":37}');
