amentas de segurança","instalar Analisador de Segurança","guia de configuração do Analisador de Segurança","ferramentas de IA para segurança","Analisador de Segurança para desenvolvedores","segurança de código com Claude Code"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент Security Analyzer","что такое ИИ Агент Security Analyzer","ИИ Агент Security Analyzer vs средства безопасности","установить ИИ Агент Security Analyzer","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента Security Analyzer","инструменты ИИ для безопасности","ИИ Агент Security Analyzer для разработчиков","безопасность кода с Claude Code"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام محلل الأمان","ما هو محلل الأمان","محلل الأمان مقابل أدوات الأمان","تثبيت محلل الأمان","دليل إعداد محلل الأمان","أدوات ذكية للأمان","محلل الأمان للمطورين","أمان الكود مع Claude Code"]}},"owner":"Cornjebus","repo":"security-analyzer","repoPath":"Cornjebus/security-analyzer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.943Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security-analyzer","description":"Comprehensive security vulnerability analysis for codebases and infrastructure. Scans dependencies (npm, pip, gem, go, cargo), containers (Docker, Kubernetes), cloud IaC (Terraform, CloudFormation), and detects secrets exposure. Fetches live CVE data from OSV.dev, calculates risk scores, and generates phased remediation plans with TDD validation tests. Use when users mention security scan, vulnerability, CVE, exploit, security audit, penetration test, OWASP, hardening, dependency audit, container security, or want to improve security posture.","bodyPreview":"# Security Analyzer\n\nAnalyze environments for vulnerabilities, fetch current CVE/exploit data, and generate phased remediation plans with TDD validation.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen the user requests a security scan:\n\n1. Run environment discovery: `python .claude/skills/security-analyzer/scripts/discover_env.py .`\n2. Save output to `inventory.json`\n3. Run vulnerability scan: `python .claude/skills/security-analyzer/scripts/fetch_vulns.py inventory.json`\n4. Save output to `scan_results.json`\n5. Generat","body":"# Security Analyzer\n\nAnalyze environments for vulnerabilities, fetch current CVE/exploit data, and generate phased remediation plans with TDD validation.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nWhen the user requests a security scan:\n\n1. Run environment discovery: `python .claude/skills/security-analyzer/scripts/discover_env.py .`\n2. Save output to `inventory.json`\n3. Run vulnerability scan: `python .claude/skills/security-analyzer/scripts/fetch_vulns.py inventory.json`\n4. Save output to `scan_results.json`\n5. Generate reports: `python .claude/skills/security-analyzer/scripts/generate_report.py scan_results.json inventory.json`\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Environment Discovery\n\nScan working directory for:\n- **Dependencies**: `package.json`, `requirements.txt`, `Gemfile`, `go.mod`, `Cargo.toml`, `pom.xml`\n- **Containers**: `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml`, `kubernetes/*.yaml`\n- **Cloud IaC**: `terraform/*.tf`, `cloudformation/*.yaml`, `*.bicep`\n- **Secrets**: `.env*` files (flag exposure risk, never log values)\n\nRun the discovery script:\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/security-analyzer/scripts/discover_env.py /path/to/project > inventory.json\n```\n\n### Phase 2: Vulnerability Intelligence\n\nFetch current threat data using the vulnerability scanner:\n\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/security-analyzer/scripts/fetch_vulns.py inventory.json > scan_results.json\n```\n\n| Source | Priority | Use For |\n|--------|----------|---------|\n| CISA KEV | 1 | Actively exploited vulns (use WebSearch) |\n| NVD | 2 | CVE details + CVSS scores (use WebSearch) |\n| GitHub Advisories | 3 | Package-specific vulns (use WebSearch) |\n| OSV.dev | 4 | Open source vulns (API in script) |\n\nFor CISA KEV and additional context, supplement with:\n```\nWebSearch: \"CVE-XXXX-YYYY CISA KEV exploit\"\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Risk Scoring\n\nThe scanner calculates risk scores using:\n\n```\nRisk = (CVSS * 0.3) + (Exploitability * 0.3) + (Criticality * 0.2) + (Exposure * 0.2)\n\nExploitability: 10=CISA KEV, 7=public exploit, 3=theoretical\nCriticality: 10=auth/payment, 5=core business, 2=logging\nExposure: 10=internet-facing, 5=internal, 2=air-gapped\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Phased Remediation\n\nGenerate reports with fix commands and validation tests:\n\n```bash\npython .claude/skills/security-analyzer/scripts/generate_report.py scan_results.json inventory.json\n```\n\nEach finding includes:\n1. Vulnerability details + risk score\n2. Actual fix code/patch (not just recommendations)\n3. Pre-fix test (proves vuln exists)\n4. Remediation unit tests (tests the fix code)\n5. Post-fix validation (proves vuln resolved)\n\n### Phase 5: Reports\n\nOutput two reports:\n- `security-report-technical.md` — Full details for engineers\n- `security-report-executive.md` — Summary for leadership\n\nSee `references/report-templates.md` for output structure.\n\n## TDD Pattern\n\nFor each vulnerability, generate three test types:\n\n```python\ndef test_vuln_exists():\n    \"\"\"PASS before fix, FAIL after\"\"\"\n    assert is_vulnerable(\"component\") == True\n\ndef test_fix_works():\n    \"\"\"Unit test for remediation code\"\"\"\n    result = apply_fix(vulnerable_config)\n    assert result.is_secure()\n\ndef test_vuln_resolved():\n    \"\"\"FAIL before fix, PASS after\"\"\"\n    assert is_vulnerable(\"component\") == False\n```\n\n## Fix Types by Finding\n\n| Finding | Output |\n|---------|--------|\n| Dependency CVE | Version bump command + lockfile update |\n| Container issue | Dockerfile patch |\n| IaC misconfiguration | Terraform/K8s fix |\n| Code vulnerability | Source patch + test |\n| Secret exposure | Rotation commands + `.gitignore` update |\n\n## Example Interaction\n\n**User:** \"Run a security scan on this project\"\n\n**Claude:**\n1. Discovers 47 npm dependencies, 3 Dockerfiles, 2 Terraform configs\n2. Fetches current CVE data from OSV.dev\n3. Identifies 12 vulnerabilities (2 critical, 4 high, 6 medium)\n4. Generates phased remediation plan with:\n   - Actual fix commands (`npm install lodash@4.17.21`)\n   - Code patches for IaC misconfigurations\n   - TDD tests proving each fix works\n5. Outputs technical and executive reports\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:40:18.328Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cybersecurity Agents needing advanced vulnerability analysis and remediation planning capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级漏洞分析和补救规划能力的网络安全代理。","ja":"サイバーセキュリティエージェントが高度な脆弱性分析と修復計画機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 취약점 분석 및 복구 계획 기능이 필요한 사이버 보안 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Ciberseguridad que necesitan capacidades de análisis y planificación de remediación de vulnerabilidades avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Cybersécurité ayant besoin d''une analyse de vulnérabilités avancée et de capacités de planification de remédiation.","de":"Perfekt für Cyber-Sicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Analyse und Planung der Behebung von Schwachstellen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Cibersegurança que necessitam de análise de vulnerabilidade avançada e capacidades de planejamento de remediação.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кибербезопасности, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа уязвимостей и планирования исправления.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الأمن السيبراني الذين يحتاجون إلى分析 متقدم للضعف ومخططات التصحيح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze environments for vulnerabilities, fetch current CVE and exploit data, and generate phased remediation plans with TDD validation using Python scripts and JSON outputs.","zh":"赋予代理分析环境中的漏洞、获取当前CVE和漏洞利用数据，并使用Python脚本和JSON输出生成分阶段的修复计划，使用TDD验证。","ja":"エージェントが環境を脆弱性分析し、現在のCVEおよびエクスプロイトデータを取得し、PythonスクリプトとJSON出力を使用して段階的な修復計画をTDD検証で生成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 환경을 취약점 분석하고 현재 CVE 및 악용 데이터를 가져오고 Python 스크립트 및 JSON 출력을 사용하여 단계별 복구 계획을 TDD 검증으로 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar entornos en busca de vulnerabilidades, obtener datos actuales de CVE y explotación, y generar planes de remediación por fases con validación TDD utilizando scripts de Python y salidas JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les environnements pour les vulnérabilités, de récupérer les données actuelles de CVE et d''exploitation, et de générer des plans de remédiation par phases avec une validation TDD en utilisant des scripts Python et des sorties JSON.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Umgebungen auf Schwachstellen zu analysieren, aktuelle CVE- und Exploit-Daten abzurufen und phasenweise Behebungspläne mit TDD-Validierung unter Verwendung von Python-Skripten und JSON-Ausgaben zu generieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar ambientes para vulnerabilidades, buscar dados de CVE e exploração atuais e gerar planos de remediação faseados com validação TDD usando scripts Python e saídas JSON.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать среды для уязвимостей, получать текущие данные CVE и эксплуатации, а также генерировать планы исправления поэтапно с проверкой TDD с помощью скриптов Python и выходных данных JSON.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل البيئات للضعف ، واسترجاع بيانات CVE والاستغلال الحالية ، وتوليد خطط التصحيح المرحلية مع التحقق TDD باستخدام سكريبتات Python ومخرجات JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating environment discovery and vulnerability scanning","Generating remediation plans with TDD validation","Fetching current CVE and exploit data for security audits"],"zh":["自动执行环境发现和漏洞扫描","生成带有TDD验证的修复计划","为安全审计获取当前CVE和漏洞利用数据"],"ja":["環境の検出と脆弱性スキャンの自動化","TDD検証付きの修復計画の生成","セキュリティ監査のための現在のCVEおよびエクスプロイトデータの取得"],"ko":["환경 검색 및 취약점 스캔 자동화","TDD 검증을 사용한 복구 계획 생성","보안 감사를 위한 현재 CVE 및 악용 데이터 가져오기"],"es":["Automatización del descubrimiento y análisis de vulnerabilidades del entorno","Generación de planes de remediación con validación TDD","Obtención de datos actuales de CVE y explotación para auditorías de seguridad"],"fr":["Automatisation de la découverte et de l''analyse des vulnérabilités de l''environnement","Gé