act ecosystem","что такое act ecosystem","act ecosystem альтернатива","act ecosystem vs другие инструменты","установить act ecosystem","руководство по настройке act ecosystem"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام نظام بيئي act","ما هو نظام بيئي act","بديل نظام بيئي act","نظام بيئي act مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت نظام بيئي act","دليل إعداد نظام بيئي act"]}},"owner":"Acurioustractor","repo":"act-global-infrastructure","repoPath":"Acurioustractor/act-global-infrastructure","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.983Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dev","description":"Start local development environment — dev servers, tunnels for webhook testing, health checks, and log tailing. Use when user says start dev, local dev, spin up, test locally, tunnel, or wants to test webhooks.","bodyPreview":"# Local Dev Skill\n\nStart the full local development stack with optional tunnel for webhook testing.\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n| Command | What it does |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `/dev` or `/dev start` | Start dev servers (dashboard + API) |\n| `/dev all` | Start everything (servers + cron scripts) |\n| `/dev tunnel` | Start servers + cloudflared tunnel for webhook testing |\n| `/dev status` | Check what''s running |\n| `/dev stop` | Stop everything |\n| `/dev logs` | Tail recent logs |\n\n## Workflow: Star","body":"# Local Dev Skill\n\nStart the full local development stack with optional tunnel for webhook testing.\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n| Command | What it does |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `/dev` or `/dev start` | Start dev servers (dashboard + API) |\n| `/dev all` | Start everything (servers + cron scripts) |\n| `/dev tunnel` | Start servers + cloudflared tunnel for webhook testing |\n| `/dev status` | Check what''s running |\n| `/dev stop` | Stop everything |\n| `/dev logs` | Tail recent logs |\n\n## Workflow: Start Dev\n\n### Step 1: Check Prerequisites\n\n```bash\n# Check node, pnpm, pm2\nnode --version && pnpm --version && pm2 --version 2>/dev/null || echo \"MISSING: install pm2 globally\"\n```\n\nIf pm2 is missing: `npm install -g pm2`\n\n### Step 2: Start Dev Servers\n\n```bash\ncd /Users/benknight/Code/act-global-infrastructure\n./dev start\n```\n\nThis starts via PM2:\n- **act-frontend**: Next.js on `http://localhost:3002`\n- **act-api**: API server on `http://localhost:3456`\n\n### Step 3: Verify\n\n```bash\n# Wait for servers to be ready\nsleep 5\n\n# Check frontend\ncurl -s -o /dev/null -w \"Dashboard: %{http_code}\\n\" http://localhost:3002/\n\n# Check API\ncurl -s -o /dev/null -w \"API: %{http_code}\\n\" http://localhost:3456/api/health 2>/dev/null || echo \"API: standalone API not needed (Next.js API routes handle it)\"\n\n# PM2 status\npm2 status\n```\n\n### Step 4: Report\n\n```\nLocal dev environment ready:\n- Dashboard: http://localhost:3002\n- API routes: http://localhost:3002/api/...\n```\n\n## Workflow: Tunnel (for webhook testing)\n\nUse this when testing Telegram bot, GHL webhooks, or Xero webhooks locally.\n\n### Step 1: Start Dev Servers (same as above)\n\n### Step 2: Start Cloudflared Tunnel\n\nIMPORTANT: Use `--config /dev/null` to avoid the catch-all 404 from existing config.yml.\n\n```bash\ncloudflared tunnel --config /dev/null --url http://localhost:3002 2>&1 &\n```\n\nWait a few seconds, then grab the tunnel URL from the output (looks like `https://something-random.trycloudflare.com`).\n\n### Step 3: Set Telegram Webhook (if testing bot)\n\n```bash\nTUNNEL_URL=\"<the cloudflared URL>\"\nTELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=\"<from .env.local>\"\n\ncurl -s \"https://api.telegram.org/bot${TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN}/setWebhook\" \\\n  -d \"url=${TUNNEL_URL}/api/telegram/webhook\" \\\n  -d \"secret_token=<TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET from .env.local>\"\n```\n\nVerify:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"https://api.telegram.org/bot${TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN}/getWebhookInfo\" | python3 -m json.tool\n```\n\n### Step 4: Report\n\n```\nTunnel active:\n- Public URL: <tunnel URL>\n- Telegram webhook: set to <tunnel URL>/api/telegram/webhook\n- Test by sending a message to the bot\n```\n\n### Step 5: Cleanup (when done)\n\nIMPORTANT: Reset webhook to production URL when done testing locally.\n\n```bash\ncurl -s \"https://api.telegram.org/bot${TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN}/setWebhook\" \\\n  -d \"url=https://command.act.place/api/telegram/webhook\" \\\n  -d \"secret_token=<TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET>\"\n```\n\nKill the tunnel:\n```bash\npkill -f cloudflared 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n## Workflow: Start Cron Scripts\n\n```bash\ncd /Users/benknight/Code/act-global-infrastructure\n./dev cron\n```\n\nThis starts PM2 cron jobs:\n- `notion-sync` — every 5 min\n- `imessage-sync` — every 15 min\n- `daily-briefing` — 7am AEST\n- `knowledge-pipeline` — 8am AEST\n- `data-freshness` — every 6h\n- Plus: storyteller sync/link, embed-imessages, detect-episodes, agent-learning, meeting-sync\n\n## Workflow: Status & Logs\n\n```bash\n# Status of all PM2 processes\npm2 status\n\n# Tail all logs\npm2 logs --lines 50\n\n# Tail specific service\npm2 logs act-frontend --lines 30\n\n# Check for errors\npm2 logs --err --lines 20\n```\n\n## Workflow: Stop\n\n```bash\n# Stop dev servers only\n./dev stop\n\n# Stop cron scripts only\n./dev stop-cron\n\n# Stop everything\npm2 stop all\n```\n\n## Ports & URLs\n\n| Service | Local URL | Production URL |\n|---------|-----------|---------------|\n| Dashboard | `http://localhost:3002` | `https://command.act.place` |\n| API routes | `http://localhost:3002/api/*` | `https://command.act.place/api/*` |\n| Legacy API | `http://localhost:3456` | (deprecated) |\n| Telegram webhook | `/api/telegram/webhook` | same path |\n| GHL webhook | `/api/webhooks/ghl` | same path |\n| Xero webhook | `/api/webhooks/xero` | same path |\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| Port 3001 already in use | `lsof -i :3001` then `kill <PID>` |\n| PM2 not found | `npm install -g pm2` |\n| Cloudflared tunnel 404 | Use `--config /dev/null` flag |\n| Telegram webhook not receiving | Check `getWebhookInfo`, verify secret matches |\n| Env vars not loaded | Check `.env.local` exists in project root |\n| Next.js build errors | Run `npx tsc --noEmit` in `apps/command-center/` first |\n\n## Environment Checklist\n\nThese env vars must be in `.env.local` for full local dev:\n\n**Required:**\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`\n- `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`\n- `OPENAI_API_KEY`\n\n**For Telegram bot testing:**\n- `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`\n- `TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET`\n- `TELEGRAM_AUTHORIZED_USERS`\n\n**For email/calendar:**\n- `GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY`\n- `GOOGLE_DELEGATED_USERS`\n- `GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ID`\n\n**For finance:**\n- `XERO_CLIENT_ID`, `XERO_CLIENT_SECRET`, `XERO_TENANT_ID`, `XERO_REFRESH_TOKEN`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:58:25.474Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing comprehensive local development environment setup and management.","zh":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing comprehensive local development environment setup and management.","ja":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing comprehensive local development environment setup and management.","ko":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing comprehensive local development environment setup and management.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full-Stack que necesitan una configuración y administración de entorno de desarrollo local integral.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant une configuration et une gestion complètes de l''environnement de développement local.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine umfassende Einrichtung und Verwaltung der lokalen Entwicklungsumgebung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full-Stack que precisam de uma configuração e gerenciamento de ambiente de desenvolvimento local abrangente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full-Stack, которым требуется комплексная настройка и управление локальной средой разработки.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الكاملون الذين يحتاجون إلى إعداد و إدارة بيئة تطوير محلية شاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage a mono-repo for Command Center, scripts, and infrastructure, leveraging cloudflared tunnel for secure webhook testing and cron script execution, all through a simplified command-line interface.","zh":"Empowers agents to manage a mono-repo for Command Center, scripts, and infrastructure, leveraging cloudflared tunnel for secure webhook testing and cron script execution, all through a simplified command-line interface.","ja":"Empowers agents to manage a mono-repo for Command Center, scripts, and infrastructure, leveraging cloudflared tunnel for secure webhook testing and cron script execution, all through a simplified command-line interface.","ko":"Empowers agents to manage a mono-repo for Command Center, scripts, and infrastructure, leveraging cloudflared tunnel for secure webhook testing and cron script execution, all through a simplified command-line interface.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar un mono-repo para Command Center, scripts e infraestructura, aprovechando el túnel cloudflared para pruebas de webhook seguras y ejecución de scripts cron, todo a través de una interfaz de línea de comandos simplificada.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour gérer un mono-repo pour Command Center, scripts et infrastructure, en exploitant le tunnel cloudflared pour des tests de webhook sécurisés et l''exécution de scripts cron, le tout via une interface de ligne de commande simplifiée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ein Mono-Repo für Command Center, Skripte und Infrastruktur zu verwalten, indem es den cloudflared-Tunnel für sichere Webhook-Tests und Cron-Skriptausführung nutzt, alles über eine vereinfachte Kommandozeilenoberfläche.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar um mono-repo para Command Center, scripts e infraestrutura, aproveitando o túnel cloudflared para testes de webhook seguros e execução de scripts cron, tudo por meio de uma interface de linha de comando simplificada.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять mono-repo для Command Center, скриптов и инфраструктуры, используя туннель cloudflared для безопасных тестов вебхуков и выполнения скриптов cron, все через упрощенный интерфейс командной строки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة مخزن مونو لمركز الأوامر و السكريبتات و البنية التحتية، مستفيداً من نفق cloudflared لتجارب الويب هوك الآمنة و تنفيذ سكريبتات كرون، كل ذلك من خلال واجهة سطر أوامر مبسطة."},"useCases":{"en":["Starting and stopping full local development stacks","Configuring and testing webhooks with cloudflared tunnel","Debugging and monitoring application logs and status"],"zh":["Starting and stopping full local development stacks","Configuring and testing webhooks with cloudflared tunnel","Debugging and monitoring application logs and status"],"ja":["Starting and stopping full local development stacks","Configuring and testing webhooks with cloudflared tunnel","Debugging and monitoring application logs and status"],"ko":["Starting and stopping full local development stacks","Configuring and testing webhooks with cloudflared tunnel","Debugging and monitoring application logs and status"],"es":["Inicio y detención de pilas de desarrollo locales completas","Configuración y prueba de webhooks con túnel cloudflared","Depuración y supervisión de registros y estado de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Démarrage et arrêt de piles de développement local complet","Configuration et test de webhooks avec tunnel cloudflared","Débogage et surveillance des journaux et du statut des applications"],"de":["Starten und Stoppen von vollständigen lokalen Entwicklungsstapel","Konfiguration und Testen von Webhooks mit cloudflared-Tunnel","Debuggen und Überwachen von Anwendungsprotokollen und -status"],"pt":["Iniciar e parar pilhas de desenvolvimento local completas","Configurar e testar webhooks com túnel cloudflared","Depurar e monitorar logs e status da aplicação"],"ru":["Запуск и остановка полных локальных стеков разработки","Настройка и тестирование вебхуков с помощью туннеля cloudflared","Отладка и мониторинг журналов и статуса приложения"],"ar":["تشغيل و إيقاف كومة التطوير المحلية الكاملة","تكوين و تجريب الويب هوك باستخدام نفق cloudflared","تصحيح الأخطاء و مراقبة سجلات و حالة التطبيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires local development environment setup","Limited to specific command-line interface commands"],"zh":["Requires local development environment setup","Limited to specific command-line interface commands"],"ja":["Requires local development environment setup","Limited to specific command-line interface commands"],"ko":["Requires local development environment setup","Limited to specific command-line interface commands"],"es":["Requiere configuración del entorno de desarrollo local","Limitado a comandos específicos de la interfaz de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de l''environnement de développement local","Limité à des commandes spécifiques de l''interface de ligne de commande"],"de":["Benötigt Einrichtung der lokalen Entwicklungsumgebung","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Kommandozeilenoberflächenbefehle"],"pt":["Requer configuração de ambiente de desenvolvimento local","Limitado a comandos específicos de interface de linha de comando"],"ru":["Требует настройки локальной среды разработки","Ограничен конкретными командами интерфейса командной строки"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد بيئة تطوير محلية","محدود بأوامر واجهة سطر الأوامر المحددة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5c0d92b65460df26b34e24c1f2cf4744c106fe1c0d580d2dd6353cf028adf3df","qualityScore":37}');
