t KI-Entwicklungsumgebungen","Einfachheit bei der Verwendung und Konfiguration","Unterstützung für mehrere Geräte"],"pt":["Controle de dispositivos iOS e Android","Integração perfeita com Ferramentas de IA","CLI fácil de usar","Suporte a comandos personalizados","Segurança e estabilidade garantidas"],"ru":["Управление устройствами iOS и Android","Идеальная интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Легко используемый CLI","Поддержка пользовательских команд","Гарантия безопасности и стабильности"],"ar":["تحكم في أجهزة iOS و Android","التكامل المثالي مع آلات الذكاء الاصطناعي","واجهة سطر الأوامر سهلة الاستخدام","دعم أوامر مخصصة","ضمان الأمان والاستقرار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI代理设备控制","iOS和Android设备管理","CLI命令行工具","AI工具","如何使用agent-device","agent-device安装","agent-device设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント用デバイス制御","iOSとAndroidのデバイス管理","CLIコマンドラインツール","AIエージェント","AIエージェントの使い方","agent-deviceのインストール","agent-deviceの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 디바이스 제어","iOS 및 Android 디바이스 관리","CLI 명령줄 도구","AI 에이전트","AI 에이전트의 사용법","agent-device 설치","agent-device 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar agent-device","qué es un agente de IA","alternativas a agent-device","agent-device vs otros herramientas","instalación de agent-device","guía de configuración de agent-device","desarrollo de IA con agent-device"],"fr":["comment utiliser agent-device","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","alternatives à agent-device","agent-device vs autres outils","installation d''agent-device","guide de configuration d''agent-device","développement de l''IA avec agent-device"],"de":["wie man agent-device verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agents","alternativen zu agent-device","agent-device vs andere tools","installation von agent-device","konfigurationsanleitung für agent-device","entwicklung von KI mit agent-device"],"pt":["como usar agent-device","o que é agent-device","ferramentas de ia","alternativa ao agent-device","agent-device vs outras ferramentas","instalar agent-device","guia de configuração do agent-device"],"ru":["как использовать agent-device","что такое agent-device","ии агенты","альтернатива agent-device","agent-device vs другие инструменты","установить agent-device","руководство по настройке agent-device"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام agent-device","ما هو agent-device","آلات الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل لبرنامج agent-device","agent-device مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت agent-device","دليل إعداد برنامج agent-device"]}},"owner":"callstackincubator","repo":"agent-device","repoPath":"callstackincubator/agent-device","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.004Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-device","description":"Automates interactions for iOS simulators/devices and Android emulators/devices. Use when navigating apps, taking snapshots/screenshots, tapping, typing, scrolling, or extracting UI info on mobile targets.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Automation with agent-device\n\nFor exploration, use snapshot refs. For deterministic replay, use selectors.\nFor structured exploratory QA bug hunts and reporting, use [../dogfood/SKILL.md](../dogfood/SKILL.md).\n\n## Start Here (Read This First)\n\nUse this skill as a router, not a full manual.\n\n1. Pick one mode:\n   - Normal interaction flow\n   - Debug/crash flow\n   - Replay maintenance flow\n2. Run one canonical flow below.\n3. Open references only if blocked.\n\n## Decision Map\n\n- No target co","body":"# Mobile Automation with agent-device\n\nFor exploration, use snapshot refs. For deterministic replay, use selectors.\nFor structured exploratory QA bug hunts and reporting, use [../dogfood/SKILL.md](../dogfood/SKILL.md).\n\n## Start Here (Read This First)\n\nUse this skill as a router, not a full manual.\n\n1. Pick one mode:\n   - Normal interaction flow\n   - Debug/crash flow\n   - Replay maintenance flow\n2. Run one canonical flow below.\n3. Open references only if blocked.\n\n## Decision Map\n\n- No target context yet: `devices` -> pick target -> `open`.\n- Normal UI task: `open` -> `snapshot -i` -> `press/fill` -> `diff snapshot -i` -> `close`\n- Debug/crash: `open <app>` -> `logs clear --restart` -> reproduce -> `network dump` -> `logs path` -> targeted `grep`\n- Replay drift: `replay -u <path>` -> verify updated selectors\n- Remote multi-tenant run: allocate lease -> run commands with tenant isolation flags -> heartbeat/release lease\n- Device-scope isolation run: set iOS simulator set / Android allowlist -> run selectors within scope only\n\n## Canonical Flows\n\n### 1) Normal Interaction Flow\n\n```bash\nagent-device open Settings --platform ios\nagent-device snapshot -i\nagent-device press @e3\nagent-device diff snapshot -i\nagent-device fill @e5 \"test\"\nagent-device close\n```\n\n### 2) Debug/Crash Flow\n\n```bash\nagent-device open MyApp --platform ios\nagent-device logs clear --restart\nagent-device network dump 25\nagent-device logs path\n```\n\nLogging is off by default. Enable only for debugging windows.\n`logs clear --restart` requires an active app session (`open <app>` first).\n\n### 3) Replay Maintenance Flow\n\n```bash\nagent-device replay -u ./session.ad\n```\n\n### 4) Remote Tenant Lease Flow (HTTP JSON-RPC)\n\n```bash\n# Allocate lease\ncurl -sS http://127.0.0.1:${AGENT_DEVICE_DAEMON_HTTP_PORT}/rpc \\\n  -H \"content-type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer <token>\" \\\n  -d ''{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":\"alloc-1\",\"method\":\"agent_device.lease.allocate\",\"params\":{\"runId\":\"run-123\",\"tenantId\":\"acme\",\"ttlMs\":60000}}''\n\n# Use lease in tenant-isolated command execution\nagent-device --daemon-transport http \\\n  --tenant acme \\\n  --session-isolation tenant \\\n  --run-id run-123 \\\n  --lease-id <lease-id> \\\n  session list --json\n\n# Heartbeat and release\ncurl -sS http://127.0.0.1:${AGENT_DEVICE_DAEMON_HTTP_PORT}/rpc \\\n  -H \"content-type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer <token>\" \\\n  -d ''{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":\"hb-1\",\"method\":\"agent_device.lease.heartbeat\",\"params\":{\"leaseId\":\"<lease-id>\",\"ttlMs\":60000}}''\ncurl -sS http://127.0.0.1:${AGENT_DEVICE_DAEMON_HTTP_PORT}/rpc \\\n  -H \"content-type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer <token>\" \\\n  -d ''{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":\"rel-1\",\"method\":\"agent_device.lease.release\",\"params\":{\"leaseId\":\"<lease-id>\"}}''\n```\n\n## Command Skeleton (Minimal)\n\n### Session and navigation\n\n```bash\nagent-device devices\nagent-device devices --platform ios --ios-simulator-device-set /tmp/tenant-a/simulators\nagent-device devices --platform android --android-device-allowlist emulator-5554,device-1234\nagent-device open [app|url] [url]\nagent-device open [app] --relaunch\nagent-device close [app]\nagent-device session list\n```\n\nUse `boot` only as fallback when `open` cannot find/connect to a ready target.\nFor Android emulators by AVD name, use `boot --platform android --device <avd-name>`.\nFor Android emulators without GUI, add `--headless`.\nUse `--target mobile|tv` with `--platform` (required) to pick phone/tablet vs TV targets (AndroidTV/tvOS).\n\nIsolation scoping quick reference:\n- `--ios-simulator-device-set <path>` scopes iOS simulator discovery + command execution to one simulator set.\n- `--android-device-allowlist <serials>` scopes Android discovery/selection to comma/space separated serials.\n- Scope is applied before selectors (`--device`, `--udid`, `--serial`); out-of-scope selectors fail with `DEVICE_NOT_FOUND`.\n- With iOS simulator-set scope enabled, iOS physical devices are not enumerated.\n\nTV quick reference:\n- AndroidTV: `open`/`apps` use TV launcher discovery automatically.\n- TV target selection works on emulators/simulators and connected physical devices (AndroidTV + AppleTV).\n- tvOS: runner-driven interactions and snapshots are supported (`snapshot`, `wait`, `press`, `fill`, `get`, `scroll`, `back`, `home`, `app-switcher`, `record` and related selector flows).\n- tvOS `back`/`home`/`app-switcher` map to Siri Remote actions (`menu`, `home`, double-home) in the runner.\n- tvOS follows iOS simulator-only command semantics for helpers like `pinch`, `settings`, and `push`.\n\n### Snapshot and targeting\n\n```bash\nagent-device snapshot -i\nagent-device diff snapshot -i\nagent-device find \"Sign In\" click\nagent-device press @e1\nagent-device fill @e2 \"text\"\nagent-device is visible ''id=\"anchor\"''\n```\n\n`press` is canonical tap command; `click` is an alias.\n\n### Utilities\n\n```bash\nagent-device appstate\nagent-device clipboard read\nagent-device clipboard write \"token\"\nagent-device keyboard status\nagent-device keyboard dismiss\nagent-device perf --json\nagent-device network dump [limit] [summary|headers|body|all]\nagent-device push <bundle|package> <payload.json|inline-json>\nagent-device trigger-app-event screenshot_taken ''{\"source\":\"qa\"}''\nagent-device get text @e1\nagent-device screenshot out.png\nagent-device settings permission grant notifications\nagent-device settings permission reset camera\nagent-device trace start\nagent-device trace stop ./trace.log\n```\n\n### Batch (when sequence is already known)\n\n```bash\nagent-device batch --steps-file /tmp/batch-steps.json --json\n```\n\n### Performance Check\n\n- Use `agent-device perf --json` (or `metrics --json`) after `open`.\n- For detailed metric semantics, caveats, and interpretation guidance, see [references/perf-metrics.md](references/perf-metrics.md).\n\n## Guardrails (High Value Only)\n\n- Re-snapshot after UI mutations (navigation/modal/list changes).\n- Prefer `snapshot -i`; scope/depth only when needed.\n- Use refs for discovery, selectors for replay/assertions.\n- Use `fill` for clear-then-type semantics; use `type` for focused append typing.\n- iOS `appstate` is session-scoped; Android `appstate` is live foreground state.\n- Clipboard helpers: `clipboard read` / `clipboard write <text>` are supported on Android and iOS simulators; iOS physical devices are not supported yet.\n- Android keyboard helpers: `keyboard status|get|dismiss` report keyboard visibility/type and dismiss via keyevent when visible.\n- `network dump` is best-effort and parses HTTP(s) entries from the session app log file.\n- Biometric settings: iOS simulator supports `settings faceid|touchid <match|nonmatch|enroll|unenroll>`; Android supports `settings fingerprint <match|nonmatch>` where runtime tooling is available.\n- For AndroidTV/tvOS selection, always pair `--target` with `--platform` (`ios`, `android`, or `apple` alias); target-only selection is invalid.\n- `push` simulates notification delivery:\n  - iOS simulator uses APNs-style payload JSON.\n  - Android uses broadcast action + typed extras (string/boolean/number).\n- `trigger-app-event` requires app-defined deep-link hooks and URL template configuration (`AGENT_DEVICE_APP_EVENT_URL_TEMPLATE` or platform-specific variants).\n- `trigger-app-event` requires an active session or explicit selectors (`--platform`, `--device`, `--udid`, `--serial`); on iOS physical devices, custom-scheme triggers require active app context.\n- Canonical trigger behavior and caveats are documented in [`website/docs/docs/commands.md`](../../website/docs/docs/commands.md) under **App event triggers**.\n- Permission settings are app-scoped and require an active session app:\n  `settings permission <grant|deny|reset> <camera|microphone|photos|contacts|notifications> [full|limited]`\n- `full|limited` mode applies only to iOS `photos`; other targets reject mode.\n- On Android, non-ASCII `fill/type` may require an ADB keyboard IME on some system images; only install IME APKs from trusted sources and verify checksum/signature.\n- If using `--save-script`, prefer explicit path syntax (`--save-script=flow.ad` or `./flow.ad`).\n- For tenant-isolated remote runs, always pass `--tenant`, `--session-isolation tenant`, `--run-id`, and `--lease-id` together.\n- Use short lease TTLs and heartbeat only while work is active; release leases immediately after run completion/failure.\n- Env equivalents for scoped runs: `AGENT_DEVICE_IOS_SIMULATOR_DEVICE_SET` (compat `IOS_SIMULATOR_DEVICE_SET`) and\n  `AGENT_DEVICE_ANDROID_DEVICE_ALLOWLIST` (compat `ANDROID_DEVICE_ALLOWLIST`).\n\n## Security and Trust Notes\n\n- Prefer a preinstalled `agent-device` binary over on-demand package execution.\n- If install is required, pin an exact version (for example: `npx --yes agent-device@<exact-version> --help`).\n- Signing/provisioning environment variables are optional, sensitive, and only for iOS physical-device setup.\n- Logs/artifacts are written under `~/.agent-device`; replay scripts write to explicit paths you provide.\n- For remote daemon mode, prefer `AGENT_DEVICE_DAEMON_SERVER_MODE=http|dual` with `AGENT_DEVICE_HTTP_AUTH_HOOK` and tenant-scoped lease admission.\n- Keep logging off unless debugging and use least-privilege/isolated environments for autonomous runs.\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n- Mixing debug flow into normal runs (keep logs off unless debugging).\n- Continuing to use stale refs after screen transitions.\n- Using URL opens with Android `--activity` (unsupported combination).\n- Treating `boot` as default first step instead of fallback.\n\n## References\n\n- [references/snapshot-refs.md](references/snapshot-refs.md)\n- [references/logs-and-debug.md](references/logs-and-debug.md)\n- [references/session-management.md](references/session-management.md)\n- [references/permissions.md](references/permissions.md)\n- [references/video-recording.md](references/video-recording.md)\n- [references/coordinate-system.md](references/coordinate-system.md)\n- [references/batching.md](references/batching.md)\n- [references/perf-metrics.md](references/perf-metrics.md)\n- [references/remote-tenancy.md](references/remote-tenancy.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:06:27.503Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Automation Agents needing CLI control over iOS and Android devices.","zh":"非常适合需要通过CLI控制iOS和Android设备的移动自动化代理。","ja":"iOSおよびAndroidデバイスのCLIコントロールが必要なモバイル自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"iOS 및 Android 디바이스의 CLI 제어가 필요한 모바일 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización móvil que necesitan control de CLI sobre dispositivos iOS y Android.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation mobile nécessitant un contrôle CLI sur les appareils iOS et Android.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Automation Agents, die CLI-Kontrolle über iOS- und Android-Geräte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação Móvel que precisam de controle CLI sobre dispositivos iOS e Android.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильной автоматизации, которым требуется управление CLI над устройствами iOS и Android.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التutomatiون المتنقلة الذين يحتاجون إلى التحكم CLI على أجهزة iOS و Android."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate mobile interactions using snapshot refs for exploration, selectors for deterministic replay, and structured exploratory QA bug hunts via CLI protocols.","zh":"赋予代理使用快照引用进行探索、选择器进行确定性重放以及通过CLI协议进行结构化探索性QA bug狩猎来自动化移动交互。","ja":"エージェントにスナップショット参照を使用して探索を行い、セレクターを使用して決定的なリプレイを行い、CLIプロトコルを使用して構造化された探索型QAバグハントを行うことで、モバイルの相互作用を自動化する力を与えます。","ko":"에이전트가 스냅샷 참조를 사용하여 탐색을 수행하고, 선택기를 사용하여 결정적인 재생을 수행하며, CLI 프로토콜을 사용하여 구조화된 탐색형 QA 버그狩猎을 수행함으로써 모바일 상호 작용을 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las interacciones móviles utilizando referencias de instantánea para la exploración, selectores para la reproducción determinista y cacerías de errores de QA exploratorias estructuradas a través de protocolos CLI.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions mobiles en utilisant des références d''instantané pour l''exploration, des sélecteurs pour la lecture déterministe et des chasses aux bogues de QA exploratoires structurées via des protocoles CLI.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mobile Interaktionen zu automatisieren, indem sie Snapshot-Referenzen für die Erforschung, Selektoren für die deterministische Wiedergabe und strukturierte exploratorische QA-Fehlerjagden über CLI-Protokolle verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações móveis usando referências de instantâneo para exploração, seletoras para reprodução determinística e caças de bugs de QA exploratórias estruturadas via protocolos CLI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать мобильные взаимодействия с помощью ссылок на снимки для изучения, селекторов для детерминированного воспроизведения и структурированных исследовательских поисков багов QA через протоколы CLI.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية أتمتة التفاعلات المتنقلة باستخدام مراجع لصور الفوتوغرافية للاستكشاف، وحدات اختيار للتشغيل التكراري المحدد، وعمليات بحث عن أخطاء QA المنظمة من خلال بروتوكولات CLI."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating mobile app testing on iOS and Android","Debugging mobile-specific issues with crash flow analysis","Replaying maintenance flows for deterministic QA"],"zh":["在iOS和Android上自动化移动应用程序测试","使用崩溃流分析调试移动特定问题","通过CLI协议重放维护流以实现确定性QA"],"ja":["iOSおよびAndroidでのモバイルアプリケーションテストの自動化","クラッシュフロー分析を使用してモバイル固有の問題をデバッグする","CLIプロトコルを使用してメンテナンスフローをリプレイして決定的なQAを実現する"],"ko":["iOS 및 Android에서 모바일 애플리케이션 테스트 자동화","크래시 흐름 분석을 사용하여 모바일 특정 문제를 디버깅","CLI 프로토콜을 사용하여 유지 보수 흐름을 재생하여 결정적 QA를 구현"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de aplicaciones móviles en iOS y Android","Depuración de problemas específicos de móviles con análisis de flujo de errores","Reproducción de flujos de mantenimiento para QA determinista"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests d''applications mobiles sur iOS et Android","Débogage des problèmes spécifiques aux mobiles avec analyse de flux d''erreurs","Relecture de flux de maintenance pour une QA déterministe"],"de":["Automatisierung von Mobile-App-Tests auf iOS und Android","Fehlerbehebung mobilspezifischer Probleme mit Crash-Flow-Analyse","Wiedergabe von Wartungsflüssen für deterministische QA"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de aplicativos móveis em iOS e Android","Depurar problemas específicos de dispositivos móveis com análise de fluxo de erro","Repetir fluxos de manutenção para QA determinístico"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование мобильных приложений на iOS и Android","Отлаживать проблемы, специфичные для мобильных устройств, с помощью анализа потока ошибок","Повторять потоки обслуживания для детерминированного QA"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار التطبيقات المتنقلة على أجهزة iOS و Android","تصحيح أخطاء محددة للأجهزة المتنقلة مع تحليل تدفق الخطأ","إعادة تشغيل تدفقات الصيانة لـ QA محدد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CLI access","Limited to iOS and Android devices","Needs snapshot refs or selectors for operation"],"zh":["需要CLI访问","仅限iOS和Android设备","需要快照引用或选择器才能操作"],"ja":["CLIアクセスが必要","iOSおよびAndroidデバイスのみ","操作するにはスナップショット参照またはセレクターが必要"],"ko":["CLI 액세스가 필요","iOS 및 Android 디바이스만","작업을 수행하려면 스냅샷 참조 또는 선택기가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso CLI","Limitado a dispositivos iOS y Android","Necesita referencias de instantánea o selectores para operar"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès CLI","Limité aux appareils iOS et Android","Nécessite des références d''instantané ou des sélecteurs pour fonctionner"],"de":["Benötigt CLI-Zugriff","Begrenzt auf iOS- und Android-Geräte","Benötigt Snapshot-Referenzen oder Selektoren für den Betrieb"],"pt":["Exige acesso CLI","Limitado a dispositivos iOS e Android","Necessita de referências de instantâneo ou seletoras para operação"],"ru":["Требует доступа CLI","Ограничен устройствами iOS и Android","Требует ссылок на снимки или селекторов для работы"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى CLI","محدود بأجهزة iOS و Android","يتطلب مراجع لصور الفوتوغرافية أو وحدات اختيار للتشغيل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5d8bda1147b40eac626056d4dee985e4a409b0b617e0546eef7b4095c99e0f4f","qualityScore":37}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('MhL5/mhl5.vercel.app/tiptap', 'community', 'MhL5', 'mhl5.vercel.app', 'MhL5/mhl5.vercel.app', 'tiptap', 0, 0, 37, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.008Z', '2026-03-02T03:07:56.435Z', '2b4cf822e3067af2a21d142edd31a3fed6bac667136f0f7895733b3dbdcf1a34', '{"id":"MhL5/mhl5.vercel.app/tiptap","name":"tiptap","description":{"zh":"tiptap是Next js 16 Portfolio的AI智能工具，提供自定义shadcn注册功能","ja":"tiptapはNext js 16 PortfolioのAIエージェントで、カスタムshadcnレジストリ機能を提供","ko":"tiptap는 Next js 16 Portfolio의 AI 에이전트로, 맞춤 shadcn 레지스트리 기능을 제공","es":"Tiptap es una herramienta de TI que permite crear portafolios personalizados con Next.js 16 y un registro de shadcn personalizado","fr":"Tiptap est un outil TI qui permet de créer des portfolios personnalisés avec Next.js 16 et un registre shadcn personnalisé","de":"Tiptap ist ein KI-Tool, das die Erstellung von individuellen Portfolios mit Next.js 16 und einem benutzerdefinierten shadcn-Registrierungsprozess ermöglicht","pt":"O Tiptap é uma ferramenta de AI para desenvolvedores que oferece uma integração personalizada com o Next.js 16 e o registry do Shadcn.","ru":"Tiptap - это ИИ Агент для разработчиков, который предоставляет кастомную интеграцию с Next.js 16 и реестром Shadcn.","ar":"تيبتاب هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين التي توفر تكاملًا مخصصًا مع Next.js 16 وسجل Shadcn.","en":"Next js 16 Portfolio with custom shadcn registry"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具tiptap：Next js 16 Portfolio解决方案","ja":"AIエージェントtiptap：Next js 16 Portfolioカスタムshadcnレジストリ","ko":"AI 에이전트tiptap: Next js 16 Portfolio 맞춤 shadcn 레지스트리","es":"Herramientas de TI con Tiptap y Next.js 16","fr":"Outils TI avec Tiptap et Next.js 16","de":"KI-Tools mit Tiptap und Next.js 16","pt":"Tiptap: Ferramenta de AI para Desenvolvedores com Next.js","ru":"Tiptap: ИИ Агент для Разработчиков с Next.js 16","ar":"تيبتاب: أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لل مطورين مع Next.js","en":"tiptap"},"description":{"zh":"tiptap是Next js 16 Portfolio的AI智能工具，提供自定义shadcn注册功能","ja":"tiptapはNext js 16 PortfolioのAIエージェントで、カスタムshadcnレジストリ機能を提供","ko":"tiptap는 Next js 16 Portfolio의 AI 에이전트로, 맞춤 shadcn 레지스트리 기능을 제공","es":"Tiptap es una herramienta de TI que permite crear portafolios personalizados con Next.js 16 y un registro de shadcn personalizado","fr":"Tiptap est un outil TI qui permet de créer des portfolios personnalisés avec Next.js 16 et un registre shadcn personnalisé","de":"Tiptap ist ein KI-Tool, das die Erstellung von individuellen Portfolios mit Next.js 16 und einem benutzerdefinierten shadcn-Registrierungsprozess ermöglicht","pt":"O Tiptap é uma ferramenta de AI para desenvolvedores que oferece uma integração personalizada com o Next.js 16 e o registry do Shadcn.","ru":"Tiptap - это ИИ Агент для разработчиков, который предоставляет кастомную интеграцию с Next.js 16 и реестром Shadcn.","ar":"تيبتاب هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين التي توفر تكاملًا مخصصًا مع Next.js 16 وسجل Shadcn.","en":"Next js 16 Portfolio with custom shadcn registry"},"definition":{"en":"Next js 16 Portfolio with custom shadcn registry"},"features":{"zh":["Next js 16 Portfolio支持","自定义shadcn注册","AI智能工具","高性能开发","易于使用"],"ja":["Next js 16 Portfolio対応","カスタムshadcnレジストリ","AIエージェント","ハイスペック開発","使いやすい"],"ko":["Next js 16 Portfolio 지원","맞춤 shadcn 레지스트리","AI 에이전트","고성능 개발","사용하기 쉬움"],"es":["Creación de portafolios personalizados con Next.js 16","Registro de shadcn personalizado","Integración con herramientas de TI","Flexibilidad y personalización","Compatibilidad con diferentes tecnologías"],"fr":["Création de portfolios personnalisés avec Next.js 16","Registre shadcn personnalisé","Intégration avec des outils TI","Flexibilité et personnalisation","Compatibilité avec différentes technologies"],"de":["Erstellung von individuellen Portfolios mit Next.js 16","Benutzerdefinierter shadcn-Registrierungsprozess","Integration mit KI-Tools","Flexibilität und Anpassungsfähigkeit","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Technologien"],"pt":["Integração com Next.js 16","Registry personalizado do Shadcn","Criação de portfólios personalizados","Suporte a desenvolvedores","Ferramenta de AI para desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Интеграция с Next.js 16","Кастомный реестр Shadcn","Создание кастомных портфолио","Поддержка разработчиков","ИИ Агент для веб-разработки"],"ar":["التكامل مع Next.js 16","سجل مخصص من Shadcn","إنشاء محفظة عمل مخصصة","دعم المطورين","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للتنمية الويب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用tiptap","什么是Next js 16 Portfolio","tiptap替代品","tiptap vs 其他工具","tiptap安装","tiptap设置指南","AI智能工具开发","Next js 16 Portfolio开发"],"ja":["tiptapの使い方","Next js 16 Portfolioとは","tiptapの代替","tiptap vs 他のツール","tiptapのインストール","tiptapの設定ガイド","AIエージェント開発","Next js 16 Portfolio開発"],"ko":["tiptap 사용법","Next js 16 Portfolio란","tiptap 대체품","tiptap vs 다른 도구","tiptap 설치","tiptap 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 개발","Next js 16 Portfolio 개발"],"es":["herramientas de TI","Tiptap","Next.js 16","registro de shadcn","portafolio personalizado","cómo usar Tiptap","alternativas a Tiptap","Tiptap vs otras herramientas"],"fr":["outils TI","Tiptap","Next.js 16","registre shadcn","portfolio personnalisé","comment utiliser Tiptap","alternatives à Tiptap","Tiptap vs autres outils"],"de":["KI-Tools","Tiptap","Next.js 16","shadcn-Registrierungsprozess","individuelles Portfolio","wie man Tiptap verwendet","Alternativen zu Tiptap","Tiptap vs andere KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar Tiptap","o que é Tiptap","Tiptap alternativa","Tiptap vs Next.js","instalar Tiptap","guia de configuração do Tiptap","desenvolvimento web com Tiptap","ferramentas de AI para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать Tiptap","что такое Tiptap","Tiptap альтернатива","Tiptap vs Next.js","установить Tiptap","руководство по настройке Tiptap","веб-разработка с Tiptap","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام تيبتاب","ما هو تيبتاب","تيبتاب بديل","تيبتاب مقابل Next.js","تثبيت تيبتاب","دليل إعداد تيبتاب","التنمية الويب مع تيبتاب","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"MhL5","repo":"mhl5.vercel.app","repoPath":"MhL5/mhl5.vercel.app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.008Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tiptap","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Tiptap Rich Text Editor\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: React 19+, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui (recommended)\n**Latest Versions**: @tiptap/react@3.16.0, @tiptap/starter-kit@3.16.0, @tiptap/pm@3.16.0 (verified 2026-01-21)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/pm @tiptap/extension-image @tiptap/extension-color @tiptap/extension-text-style @tiptap/extension-typography\n```","body":"# Tiptap Rich Text Editor\n\n**Status**: Production Ready\n**Last Updated**: 2026-01-21\n**Dependencies**: React 19+, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui (recommended)\n**Latest Versions**: @tiptap/react@3.16.0, @tiptap/starter-kit@3.16.0, @tiptap/pm@3.16.0 (verified 2026-01-21)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start (5 Minutes)\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/pm @tiptap/extension-image @tiptap/extension-color @tiptap/extension-text-style @tiptap/extension-typography\n```\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- `@tiptap/pm` is required peer dependency (ProseMirror engine)\n- StarterKit bundles 20+ essential extensions (headings, lists, bold, italic, etc.)\n- Image/color/typography are common additions not in StarterKit\n\n**Important**: If using Tiptap v3.14.0+, drag handle functionality requires minimum v3.14.0 (regression fixed in that release). For Pro extensions with drag handles, React 18 is recommended due to tippyjs-react dependency.\n\n### 2. Create SSR-Safe Editor\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor, EditorContent } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\n\nexport function Editor() {\n  const editor = useEditor({\n    extensions: [StarterKit],\n    content: ''<p>Hello World!</p>'',\n    immediatelyRender: false, // ⚠️ CRITICAL for SSR/Next.js\n    editorProps: {\n      attributes: {\n        class: ''prose prose-sm focus:outline-none min-h-[200px] p-4'',\n      },\n    },\n  })\n\n  return <EditorContent editor={editor} />\n}\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n- **Always set `immediatelyRender: false`** for Next.js/SSR apps (prevents hydration mismatch)\n- Without this, you''ll see: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n- This is the #1 error reported by Tiptap users\n\n### 3. Add Tailwind Typography (Optional but Recommended)\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tailwindcss/typography\n```\n\nUpdate your `tailwind.config.ts`:\n```typescript\nimport typography from ''@tailwindcss/typography''\n\nexport default {\n  plugins: [typography],\n}\n```\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Provides default prose styling for headings, lists, links, etc.\n- Without it, formatted content looks unstyled\n- Alternative: Use custom Tailwind classes with `.tiptap` selector\n\n---\n\n## The 3-Step Setup Process\n\n### Step 1: Choose Your Integration Method\n\n**Option A: shadcn Minimal Tiptap Component (Recommended)**\n\nInstall the pre-built shadcn component:\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aslam97/shadcn-minimal-tiptap/main/registry/block-registry.json\n```\n\nThis installs:\n- Fully-featured editor component with toolbar\n- Image upload support\n- Code block with syntax highlighting\n- Typography extension configured\n- Dark mode support\n\n**Option B: Build Custom Editor (Full Control)**\n\nUse templates from this skill:\n- `templates/base-editor.tsx` - Minimal editor setup\n- `templates/common-extensions.ts` - Extension bundle\n- `templates/tiptap-prose.css` - Tailwind styling\n\n**Key Points:**\n- Option A: Faster setup, opinionated UI\n- Option B: Complete customization, headless approach\n- Both work with React + Tailwind v4\n\n### Step 2: Configure Extensions\n\nExtensions add functionality to your editor:\n\n```typescript\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\nimport Image from ''@tiptap/extension-image''\nimport Link from ''@tiptap/extension-link''\nimport Typography from ''@tiptap/extension-typography''\n\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [\n    StarterKit.configure({\n      // Customize built-in extensions\n      heading: {\n        levels: [1, 2, 3],\n      },\n      bulletList: {\n        keepMarks: true,\n      },\n    }),\n    Image.configure({\n      inline: true,\n      allowBase64: false, // ⚠️ Prevent base64 bloat\n      resize: {\n        enabled: true,\n        directions: [''top-right'', ''bottom-right'', ''bottom-left'', ''top-left''],\n        minWidth: 100,\n        minHeight: 100,\n        alwaysPreserveAspectRatio: true,\n      },\n    }),\n    Link.configure({\n      openOnClick: false,\n      HTMLAttributes: {\n        class: ''text-primary underline'',\n      },\n    }),\n    Typography, // Smart quotes, dashes, etc.\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n- Set `allowBase64: false` to prevent huge JSON payloads\n- Use upload handler pattern (see templates/image-upload-r2.tsx)\n- Extension order matters - dependencies must load first\n\n### Step 3: Handle Image Uploads (If Needed)\n\n**Pattern**: Base64 preview → background upload → replace with URL\n\nSee `templates/image-upload-r2.tsx` for full implementation:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Editor } from ''@tiptap/core''\n\nasync function uploadImageToR2(file: File, env: Env): Promise<string> {\n  // 1. Create base64 preview for immediate display\n  const reader = new FileReader()\n  const base64 = await new Promise<string>((resolve) => {\n    reader.onload = () => resolve(reader.result as string)\n    reader.readAsDataURL(file)\n  })\n\n  // 2. Insert preview into editor\n  editor.chain().focus().setImage({ src: base64 }).run()\n\n  // 3. Upload to R2 in background\n  const formData = new FormData()\n  formData.append(''file'', file)\n\n  const response = await fetch(''/api/upload'', {\n    method: ''POST'',\n    body: formData,\n  })\n\n  const { url } = await response.json()\n\n  // 4. Replace base64 with permanent URL\n  editor.chain()\n    .focus()\n    .updateAttributes(''image'', { src: url })\n    .run()\n\n  return url\n}\n```\n\n**Why this pattern:**\n- Immediate user feedback (preview)\n- No database bloat from base64\n- Works with Cloudflare R2\n- Graceful error handling\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Always Do\n\n✅ Set `immediatelyRender: false` in `useEditor()` for SSR apps\n✅ Install `@tailwindcss/typography` for prose styling\n✅ Use upload handler for images (not base64)\n✅ Memoize editor configuration to prevent re-renders\n✅ Include `@tiptap/pm` peer dependency\n\n### Never Do\n\n❌ Use `immediatelyRender: true` (default) with Next.js/SSR\n❌ Store images as base64 in database (use URL after upload)\n❌ Forget to add `prose` classes to editor container\n❌ Load more than 100 widgets in collaborative mode\n❌ Use Create React App (v3 incompatible - use Vite)\n\n---\n\n## Known Issues Prevention\n\nThis skill prevents **7** documented issues:\n\n### Issue #1: SSR Hydration Mismatch\n**Error**: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #5856](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5856), [#5602](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5602)\n**Why It Happens**: Default `immediatelyRender: true` breaks Next.js hydration\n**Prevention**: Template includes `immediatelyRender: false` by default\n\n### Issue #2: Editor Re-renders on Every Keystroke\n**Error**: Laggy typing, poor performance in large documents\n**Source**: [Tiptap Performance Docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/api/editor#immediatelyrender)\n**Why It Happens**: `useEditor()` hook re-renders component on every change\n**Prevention**: Use `useEditorState()` hook or memoization patterns (see templates)\n\n### Issue #3: Tailwind Typography Not Working\n**Error**: Headings/lists render unstyled, no formatting visible\n**Source**: [shadcn Tiptap Discussion](https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/discussions/1729)\n**Why It Happens**: Missing `@tailwindcss/typography` plugin\n**Prevention**: Skill includes typography plugin installation in checklist\n\n### Issue #4: Image Upload Base64 Bloat\n**Error**: JSON payloads become megabytes, slow saves, database bloat\n**Source**: [Tiptap Image Docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/extensions/nodes/image#usage)\n**Why It Happens**: Default allows base64, no upload handler configured\n**Prevention**: R2 upload template with URL replacement pattern\n\n### Issue #5: Build Errors in Create React App\n**Error**: \"jsx-runtime\" module resolution errors after upgrading to v3\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #6812](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/6812)\n**Why It Happens**: CRA incompatibility with v3 module structure\n**Prevention**: Skill documents Vite as preferred bundler + provides working config\n\n### Issue #6: ProseMirror Multiple Versions Conflict\n**Error**: `Error: Looks like multiple versions of prosemirror-model were loaded`\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #577](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/577) (131 comments), [Issue #6171](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/6171)\n**Why It Happens**: Installing additional Tiptap extensions can pull different versions of prosemirror-model or prosemirror-view, creating duplicate dependencies in node_modules. The unique-id extension is particularly problematic in testing environments.\n**Prevention**: Use package resolutions to force a single ProseMirror version\n\n```json\n// package.json\n{\n  \"resolutions\": {\n    \"prosemirror-model\": \"~1.21.0\",\n    \"prosemirror-view\": \"~1.33.0\",\n    \"prosemirror-state\": \"~1.4.3\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOr reinstall dependencies:\n```bash\nrm -rf node_modules package-lock.json\nnpm install\n```\n\n**Note**: The @tiptap/pm package is designed to prevent this issue, but extensions may still introduce conflicts.\n\n### Issue #7: EditorProvider vs useEditor Confusion (Community-sourced)\n**Error**: `SSR has been detected, please set ''immediatelyRender'' explicitly to ''false''` (when both used together)\n**Source**: [GitHub Issue #5856 Comment](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5856#issuecomment-2493124171)\n**Why It Happens**: Users commonly use EditorProvider and useEditor together, but EditorProvider is a wrapper around useEditor for React Context setup - they should not be used simultaneously.\n**Prevention**: Choose one pattern only\n\n**Incorrect Pattern**:\n```typescript\n// Don''t use both together\n<EditorProvider>\n  <MyComponent />\n</EditorProvider>\n\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  const editor = useEditor({ ... }) // ❌ Wrong - EditorProvider already created editor\n}\n```\n\n**Correct Patterns**:\n```typescript\n// Option 1: Use EditorProvider only\n<EditorProvider immediatelyRender={false} extensions={[StarterKit]}>\n  <EditorContent />\n</EditorProvider>\n\n// Option 2: Use useEditor only\nfunction Editor() {\n  const editor = useEditor({\n    extensions: [StarterKit],\n    immediatelyRender: false,\n  })\n  return <EditorContent editor={editor} />\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Configuration Files Reference\n\n### Tailwind Prose Styling (tiptap-prose.css)\n\n```css\n/* Apply to editor container */\n.tiptap {\n  /* Tailwind Typography */\n  @apply prose prose-sm sm:prose-base lg:prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none;\n\n  /* Custom overrides */\n  h1 {\n    @apply text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4;\n  }\n\n  h2 {\n    @apply text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-3;\n  }\n\n  p {\n    @apply my-4 text-base leading-7;\n  }\n\n  ul, ol {\n    @apply my-4 ml-6;\n  }\n\n  code {\n    @apply bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono;\n  }\n\n  pre {\n    @apply bg-muted p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto;\n  }\n\n  blockquote {\n    @apply border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 italic my-4;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Why these settings:**\n- `prose` classes provide consistent formatting\n- `dark:prose-invert` handles dark mode automatically\n- Custom overrides use semantic Tailwind v4 colors\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Collaborative Editing with Y.js\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport Collaboration from ''@tiptap/extension-collaboration''\nimport * as Y from ''yjs''\n\nconst ydoc = new Y.Doc()\n\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [\n    StarterKit.configure({\n      history: false, // Disable history for collaboration\n    }),\n    Collaboration.configure({\n      document: ydoc,\n    }),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n**When to use**: Real-time multi-user editing (Notion-like)\n**See**: `templates/collaborative-setup.tsx` for full example\n\n### Pattern 2: Markdown Support\n\n```typescript\nimport { useEditor } from ''@tiptap/react''\nimport StarterKit from ''@tiptap/starter-kit''\nimport { Markdown } from ''@tiptap/markdown''\n\n// Load editor with markdown content\nconst editor = useEditor({\n  extensions: [StarterKit, Markdown],\n  content: ''# Hello World\\n\\nThis is **Markdown**!'',\n  contentType: ''markdown'',  // ⚠️ CRITICAL: Must specify or content parsed as HTML\n  immediatelyRender: false,\n})\n\n// Get markdown from editor\nconst markdownOutput = editor.getMarkdown()\n\n// Insert markdown content\neditor.commands.setContent(''## New heading'', { contentType: ''markdown'' })\neditor.commands.insertContent(''**Bold** text'', { contentType: ''markdown'' })\n```\n\n**When to use**: Storing content as markdown, displaying/editing rich text\n**Install**: `npm install @tiptap/markdown@3.16.0`\n**Status**: Beta (released Oct 2025, API stable but may change)\n**CRITICAL**: Always specify `contentType: ''markdown''` when setting markdown content\n\n**Recent Fixes** (v3.15.0-v3.16.0):\n- Fixed incorrect Markdown output when underline is mixed with bold/italic and ranges don''t fully overlap\n- Improved serialization for overlapping formatting marks\n- Source: [v3.16.0 Release](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/releases/tag/v3.16.0)\n\n### Pattern 3: Form Integration with react-hook-form\n\n```typescript\nimport { useForm, Controller } from ''react-hook-form''\n\nfunction BlogForm() {\n  const { control, handleSubmit } = useForm()\n\n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)}>\n      <Controller\n        name=\"content\"\n        control={control}\n        render={({ field }) => (\n          <Editor\n            content={field.value}\n            onUpdate={({ editor }) => {\n              field.onChange(editor.getHTML())\n            }}\n          />\n        )}\n      />\n    </form>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**When to use**: Blog posts, comments, any form-based content\n\n---\n\n## Using Bundled Resources\n\n### Scripts (scripts/)\n\nNo executable scripts for this skill.\n\n### Templates (templates/)\n\n**Required for all projects:**\n- `templates/base-editor.tsx` - Minimal React editor component\n- `templates/package.json` - Required dependencies\n\n**Optional based on needs:**\n- `templates/minimal-tiptap-setup.sh` - shadcn component installation\n- `templates/image-upload-r2.tsx` - R2 upload handler\n- `templates/tiptap-prose.css` - Tailwind styling\n- `templates/collaborative-setup.tsx` - Y.js collaboration\n- `templates/common-extensions.ts` - Extension bundle\n\n**When to load these**: Claude should reference templates when user asks to:\n- Set up tiptap editor\n- Add image uploads\n- Configure collaborative editing\n- Style with Tailwind prose\n\n### References (references/)\n\n- `references/tiptap-docs.md` - Key documentation links\n- `references/common-errors.md` - Error troubleshooting guide\n- `references/extension-catalog.md` - Popular extensions list\n\n**When Claude should load these**: Troubleshooting errors, exploring extensions, understanding API\n\n---\n\n## Advanced Topics\n\n### Custom Extensions\n\nCreate your own Tiptap extensions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Node } from ''@tiptap/core''\n\nconst CustomNode = Node.create({\n  name: ''customNode'',\n\n  group: ''block'',\n\n  content: ''inline*'',\n\n  parseHTML() {\n    return [{ tag: ''div[data-custom]'' }]\n  },\n\n  renderHTML({ HTMLAttributes }) {\n    return [''div'', { ''data-custom'': '''', ...HTMLAttributes }, 0]\n  },\n\n  addCommands() {\n    return {\n      insertCustomNode: () => ({ commands }) => {\n        return commands.insertContent({ type: this.name })\n      },\n    }\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Use cases**: Custom widgets, embeds, interactive elements\n\n### Slash Commands\n\nAdd Notion-like `/` commands:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Extension } from ''@tiptap/core''\nimport Suggestion from ''@tiptap/suggestion''\n\nconst SlashCommands = Extension.create({\n  name: ''slashCommands'',\n\n  addOptions() {\n    return {\n      suggestion: {\n        char: ''/'',\n        items: ({ query }) => {\n          return [\n            { title: ''Heading 1'', command: ({ editor, range }) => {\n              editor.chain().focus().deleteRange(range).setHeading({ level: 1 }).run()\n            }},\n            { title: ''Bullet List'', command: ({ editor, range }) => {\n              editor.chain().focus().deleteRange(range).toggleBulletList().run()\n            }},\n          ]\n        },\n      },\n    }\n  },\n\n  addProseMirrorPlugins() {\n    return [Suggestion({ editor: this.editor, ...this.options.suggestion })]\n  },\n})\n```\n\n**Use cases**: Productivity shortcuts, quick formatting\n\n---\n\n## Dependencies\n\n**Required**:\n- `@tiptap/react@^3.16.0` - React integration (React 19 supported)\n- `@tiptap/starter-kit@^3.16.0` - Essential extensions bundle\n- `@tiptap/pm@^3.16.0` - ProseMirror peer dependency\n- `react@^19.0.0` - React framework\n\n**React Version Compatibility**:\n- **Core Tiptap**: Supports React 19 as of v2.10.0\n- **UI Components**: Work best with React 18 (Next.js 15 recommended per [official docs](https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/getting-started/install/nextjs))\n- **Pro Extensions**: May require React 18 - drag-handle extension depends on archived tippyjs-react without React 19 support ([Issue #5876](https://github.com/ueberdosis/tiptap/issues/5876))\n\n**Optional**:\n- `@tiptap/extension-audio@^3.16.0` - Audio support (NEW in v3.16.0)\n- `@tiptap/extension-image@^3.16.0` - Image support\n- `@tiptap/extension-link@^3.16.0` - Link support (NEW in v3, included in StarterKit)\n- `@tiptap/extension-color@^3.16.0` - Text color\n- `@tiptap/extension-typography@^3.16.0` - Smart typography\n- `@tiptap/extension-collaboration@^3.16.0` - Real-time collaboration\n- `@tiptap/extension-markdown@^3.16.0` - Markdown support (Beta)\n- `@tailwindcss/typography@^0.5.19` - Prose styling\n- `yjs@^13.6.0` - Collaborative editing backend\n- `react-medium-image-zoom@^5.2.0` - Image zoom functionality\n\n---\n\n## Official Documentation\n\n- **Tiptap**: https://tiptap.dev\n- **Installation Guide**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/installation/react\n- **Extensions**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/extensions\n- **API Reference**: https://tiptap.dev/docs/editor/api/editor\n- **shadcn minimal-tiptap**: https://github.com/Aslam97/shadcn-minimal-tiptap\n- **Context7 Library ID**: tiptap/tiptap\n\n---\n\n## Package Versions (Verified 2026-01-21)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@tiptap/react\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/starter-kit\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/pm\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-audio\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-image\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-color\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-text-style\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-typography\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-link\": \"^3.16.0\",\n    \"@tiptap/extension-markdown\": \"^3.16.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@tailwindcss/typography\": \"^0.5.19\",\n    \"react\": \"^19.2.3\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"^19.2.3\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Example\n\nThis skill is based on real-world implementations:\n- **GitLab**: Uses Tiptap for issue/MR descriptions\n- **Statamic CMS**: Tiptap as default rich text editor\n- **shadcn minimal-tiptap**: 3.14M downloads/week\n\n**Token Savings**: ~71% (14k → 4k tokens)\n**Errors Prevented**: 7/7 documented errors (5 critical setup + 2 community patterns)\n**Validation**: ✅ SSR compatibility, ✅ Image uploads, ✅ Tailwind v4, ✅ Performance, ✅ React 19 compatibility\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Problem: \"SSR has been detected, please set `immediatelyRender` explicitly to `false`\"\n**Solution**: Add `immediatelyRender: false` to your `useEditor()` config\n\n### Problem: Headings/lists look unstyled\n**Solution**: Install `@tailwindcss/typography` and add `prose` classes to editor container\n\n### Problem: Editor lags when typing\n**Solution**: Use `useEditorState()` hook instead of `useEditor()` for read-only rendering, or memoize editor configuration\n\n### Problem: Images make JSON huge\n**Solution**: Set `allowBase64: false` in Image extension config and use upload handler (see templates/image-upload-r2.tsx)\n\n### Problem: Build fails in Create React App\n**Solution**: Switch to Vite - CRA incompatible with Tiptap v3. See cloudflare-worker-base skill for Vite setup.\n\n---\n\n## Complete Setup Checklist\n\nUse this checklist to verify your setup:\n\n- [ ] Installed `@tiptap/react`, `@tiptap/starter-kit`, `@tiptap/pm`\n- [ ] Set `immediatelyRender: false` in `useEditor()` config\n- [ ] Installed `@tailwindcss/typography` plugin\n- [ ] Added `prose` classes to editor container\n- [ ] Configured image upload handler (if using images)\n- [ ] Set `allowBase64: false` in Image extension\n- [ ] Editor renders without hydration errors\n- [ ] Formatted text displays correctly (headings, lists, etc.)\n- [ ] Dev server runs without TypeScript errors\n- [ ] Production build succeeds\n\n---\n\n**Questions? Issues?**\n\n1. Check `references/common-errors.md` for troubleshooting\n2. Verify `immediatelyRender: false` is set\n3. Check official docs: https://tiptap.dev\n4. Ensure `@tiptap/pm` peer dependency is installed\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:07:56.435Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced rich text editing capabilities with React and Tailwind integration.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 React 和 Tailwind 集成的高级富文本编辑功能的前端代理。","ja":"React と Tailwind の統合による高度なリッチテキスト編集機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適。","ko":"React와 Tailwind 통합을 통해 고급 富文本 편집 기능을 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de edición de texto rico avanzadas con integración de React y Tailwind.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend nécessitant des fonctionnalités de modification de texte riche avancées avec une intégration de React et Tailwind.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte reiche Textbearbeitungsfunktionen mit React- und Tailwind-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades avançadas de edição de texto rico com integração do React e Tailwind.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности редактирования богатого текста с интеграцией React и Tailwind.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تحرير نص غني متقدم مع دمج React و Tailwind."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create customizable rich text editors using @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, and @tiptap/pm, with support for image, color, text style, and typography extensions, all while leveraging Tailwind v4 for styling.","zh":"赋予代理创建可自定义的富文本编辑器的能力，使用 @tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit 和 @tiptap/pm，并支持图像、颜色、文本样式和排版扩展，同时利用 Tailwind v4 进行样式设计。","ja":"@tiptap/react、@tiptap/starter-kit、@tiptap/pm を使用して、画像、色、テキストスタイル、タイポグラフィの拡張をサポートするカスタマイズ可能なリッチテキストエディターを作成するエージェントの能力を付与し、Tailwind v4 を使用してスタイリングします。","ko":"@tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit, @tiptap/pm을 사용하여 이미지, 색상, 텍스트 스타일, 타이포그래피 확장을 지원하는 사용자 지정 가능한 富文本 편집기를 만들 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, Tailwind v4를 사용하여 스타일을 지정합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear editores de texto rico personalizables utilizando @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit y @tiptap/pm, con soporte para extensiones de imagen, color, estilo de texto y tipografía, todo mientras aprovecha Tailwind v4 para el estilo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des éditeurs de texte riche personnalisables en utilisant @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit et @tiptap/pm, avec un support pour les extensions d''image, de couleur, de style de texte et de typographie, le tout en exploitant Tailwind v4 pour le style.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, benutzerdefinierte Rich-Text-Editor mit @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit und @tiptap/pm zu erstellen, mit Unterstützung für Bild-, Farb-, Textstil- und Typographie-Erweiterungen, während Tailwind v4 für die Stilgestaltung genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita agentes a criar editores de texto rico personalizáveis usando @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit e @tiptap/pm, com suporte para extensões de imagem, cor, estilo de texto e tipografia, tudo isso aproveitando o Tailwind v4 para estilização.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать настраиваемые редакторы богатого текста, используя @tiptap/react, @tiptap/starter-kit и @tiptap/pm, с поддержкой расширений для изображений, цвета, стиля текста и типографики, все это при помощи Tailwind v4 для стилизации.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء محررات نص غني قابلة للتعديل باستخدام @tiptap/react و @tiptap/starter-kit و @tiptap/pm، مع دعم لمكتبات الصور والألوان وأسلوب النص والطباعة، كل ذلك بالاستفادة من Tailwind v4 للأسلوب."},"useCases":{"en":["Customizing rich text editors for web applications","Generating editable content with image and color support","Building responsive text editors with Tailwind v4"],"zh":["为 Web 应用程序自定义富文本编辑器","生成支持图像和颜色的可编辑内容","使用 Tailwind v4 构建响应式文本编辑器"],"ja":["Web アプリケーションのリッチテキストエディターをカスタマイズする","画像と色をサポートする編集可能なコンテンツを生成する","Tailwind v4 を使用してレスポンシブテキストエディターを構築する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 富文本 편집기 사용자 지정","이미지 및 색상 지원 편집 가능한 콘텐츠 생성","Tailwind v4를 사용하여 반응형 텍스트 편집기 구축"],"es":["Personalizar editores de texto rico para aplicaciones web","Generar contenido editable con soporte de imagen y color","Crear editores de texto responsivos con Tailwind v4"],"fr":["Personnaliser les éditeurs de texte riche pour les applications Web","Générer du contenu editable avec un support d''image et de couleur","Créer des éditeurs de texte responsifs avec Tailwind v4"],"de":["Rich-Text-Editor für Webanwendungen anpassen","Bearbeitbaren Inhalt mit Bild- und Farbunterstützung generieren","Responsives Text-Editor mit Tailwind v4 erstellen"],"pt":["Personalizar editores de texto rico para aplicações web","Gerar conteúdo editável com suporte a imagem e cor","Construir editores de texto responsivos com Tailwind v4"],"ru":["Настройка редакторов богатого текста для веб-приложений","Генерация редактируемого контента с поддержкой изображений и цвета","Создание отзывчивых редакторов текста с помощью Tailwind v4"],"ar":["تخصيص محررات نص غني للتطبيقات الويب","إنشاء محتوى قابل للتعديل مع دعم الصور والألوان","بناء محررات نص قابلة للتعديل مع Tailwind v4"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React 19+","Dependent on Tailwind v4","Specific versions of @tiptap packages required (e.g., @tiptap/react@3.16.0)"],"zh":["需要 React 19+","依赖于 Tailwind v4","需要 @tiptap 包的特定版本（例如 @tiptap/react@3.16.0）"],"ja":["React 19+ が必要","Tailwind v4 依存","@tiptap パッケージの特定のバージョンが必要（例：@tiptap/react@3.16.0）"],"ko":["React 19+ 필요","Tailwind v4 의존","@tiptap 패키지의 특정 버전이 필요함（예：@tiptap/react@3.16.0）"],"es":["Requiere React 19+","Dependiente de Tailwind v4","Se requieren versiones específicas de los paquetes @tiptap (por ejemplo, @tiptap/react@3.16.0)"],"fr":["Nécessite React 19+","Dépendant de Tailwind v4","Des versions spécifiques des packages @tiptap sont requises (par exemple, @tiptap/react@3.16.0)"],"de":["Benötigt React 19+","Abhängig von Tailwind v4","Spezifische Versionen der @tiptap-Pakete sind erforderlich (z.B. @tiptap/react@3.16.0)"],"pt":["Requer React 19+","Dependente do Tailwind v4","Versões específicas dos pacotes @tiptap necessárias (por exemplo, @tiptap/react@3.16.0)"],"ru":["Требуется React 19+","Зависит от Tailwind v4","Требуются конкретные версии пакетов @tiptap (например, @tiptap/react@3.16.0)"],"ar":["يتطلب React 19+","يعتمد على Tailwind v4","تطلب إصدارات محددة من حزم @tiptap (على سبيل المثال @tiptap/react@3.16.0)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2b4cf822e3067af2a21d142edd31a3fed6bac667136f0f7895733b3dbdcf1a34","qualityScore":37}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('specture-system/specture/specture', 'community', 'specture-system', 'specture', 'specture-system/specture', 'specture', 0, 0, 37, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.015Z', '2026-03-02T03:10:01.355Z', '6666671a8a4c3f709e755338eb87877811718e5b3e2c762d8c71189dbbfb25a2', '{"id":"specture-system/specture/specture","name":"specture","description":{"zh":"Spec-driven软件架构系统是一种基于Spec的软件开发方法，用于构建高效的AI智能代理","ja":"Spec駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステムは、Specに基づいたソフトウェア開発方法で、高効率のAIエージェントを構築する","ko":"Spec 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템은 Spec 기반의 소프트웨어 개발 방법으로, 효율적인 AI 에이전트를 구축합니다","es":"Specture es un sistema de arquitectura de software impulsado por especificaciones, diseñado para desarrolladores","fr":"Specture est un système d''architecture logicielle piloté par des spécifications, conçu pour les développeurs","de":"Specture ist ein spezifikationsgetriebenes Software-Architektur-System, entwickelt für Entwickler","pt":"O Specture é um sistema de arquitetura de software baseado em especificações, projetado para melhorar a qualidade e a eficiência do código. Com ele, os desenvolvedores podem criar soluções mais robustas e escaláveis","ru":"Specture - это система архитектуры программного обеспечения на основе спецификаций, предназначенная для улучшения качества и эффективности кода. С ее помощью разработчики могут создавать более прочные и масштабируемые решения с ИИ Агентами","ar":"Specture هو نظام هندسة برمجيات مدفوع بالمواصفات، مصمم لتحسين جودة وكفاءة الكود. معه، يمكن للمطورين خلق حلول أكثر متانة وقابلية للتوسع للعملاء الإلكترونيين","en":"Spec-driven software architecture system"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Spec-driven软件架构系统 - AI智能代理","ja":"Spec駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステム - AIエージェント","ko":"Spec 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de IA: Specture, arquitectura de software","fr":"Agents IA: Specture, système d''architecture logicielle","de":"KI-Tools: Specture, spezifikationsgetriebenes Software-Ar...","pt":"Specture: Ferramentas de Arquitetura de Software Baseadas...","ru":"Specture: Система архитектуры программного обеспечения на...","ar":"Specture: نظام هندسة برمجيات مدفوع بالمواصفات للعملاء الإ...","en":"specture"},"description":{"zh":"Spec-driven软件架构系统是一种基于Spec的软件开发方法，用于构建高效的AI智能代理","ja":"Spec駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステムは、Specに基づいたソフトウェア開発方法で、高効率のAIエージェントを構築する","ko":"Spec 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템은 Spec 기반의 소프트웨어 개발 방법으로, 효율적인 AI 에이전트를 구축합니다","es":"Specture es un sistema de arquitectura de software impulsado por especificaciones, diseñado para desarrolladores","fr":"Specture est un système d''architecture logicielle piloté par des spécifications, conçu pour les développeurs","de":"Specture ist ein spezifikationsgetriebenes Software-Architektur-System, entwickelt für Entwickler","pt":"O Specture é um sistema de arquitetura de software baseado em especificações, projetado para melhorar a qualidade e a eficiência do código. Com ele, os desen...","ru":"Specture - это система архитектуры программного обеспечения на основе спецификаций, предназначенная для улучшения качества и эффективности кода. С ее помощью...","ar":"Specture هو نظام هندسة برمجيات مدفوع بالمواصفات، مصمم لتحسين جودة وكفاءة الكود. معه، يمكن للمطورين خلق حلول أكثر متانة وقابلية للتوسع للعملاء الإلكترونيين","en":"Spec-driven software architecture system"},"definition":{"en":"Spec-driven software architecture system"},"features":{"zh":["基于Spec的软件开发","高效的AI智能代理构建","灵活的软件架构设计","支持多种编程语言","易于集成和扩展"],"ja":["Specに基づいたソフトウェア開発","高効率のAIエージェント構築","柔軟なソフトウェアアーキテクチャ設計","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","容易な統合と拡張"],"ko":["Spec 기반의 소프트웨어 개발","효율적인 AI 에이전트 구축","유연한 소프트웨어 아키텍처 설계","다중 프로그래밍 언어 지원","쉽게 통합하고 확장할 수 있음"],"es":["Arquitectura de software impulsada por especificaciones","Diseño y implementación guiados por especificaciones","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación","Flexibilidad y escalabilidad en el diseño de software"],"fr":["Architecture logicielle pilotée par des spécifications","Conception et mise en œuvre guidées par des spécifications","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation","Flexibilité et évolutivité dans la conception de logiciels"],"de":["Spezifikationsgetriebene Software-Architektur","Entwurf und Implementierung unter Anleitung von Spezifikationen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Flexibilität und Skalierbarkeit im Software-Design"],"pt":["Arquitetura de software baseada em especificações","Melhoria da qualidade e eficiência do código","Desenvolvimento de soluções mais robustas e escaláveis","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento existentes","Suporte a múltiplos linguagens de programação"],"ru":["Система архитектуры программного обеспечения на основе спецификаций","Улучшение качества и эффективности кода с ИИ Агентами","Разработка более прочных и масштабируемых решений","Интеграция с существующими инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования"],"ar":["نظام هندسة برمجيات مدفوع بالمواصفات","تحسين جودة وكفاءة الكود للعملاء الإلكترونيين","تطوير حلول أكثر متانة وقابلية للتوسع","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الحالية","دعم لغات برمجة متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Spec-driven软件架构系统","什么是Spec驱动的软件开发","Spec-driven软件架构系统替代品","Spec-driven vs 其他软件开发方法","Spec-driven软件架构系统安装","Spec-driven软件架构系统设置指南"],"ja":["Spec駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステムの使用方法","Spec駆動のソフトウェア開発とは","Spec駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステムの代替品","Spec駆動 vs その他のソフトウェア開発方法","Spec駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステムのインストール","Spec駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステムの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Spec 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템 사용법","Spec 주도 소프트웨어 개발이란","Spec 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템 대체품","Spec 주도 vs 다른 소프트웨어 개발 방법","Spec 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템 설치","Spec 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Specture","qué es la arquitectura de software","Specture alternativa","Specture vs otras herramientas","instalación de Specture","guía de configuración de Specture","desarrollo de software con Specture"],"fr":["comment utiliser Specture","quoi est l''architecture logicielle","alternative à Specture","Specture vs autres outils","installation de Specture","guide de configuration de Specture","développement de logiciels avec Specture"],"de":["wie man Specture verwendet","was ist Software-Architektur","Specture-Alternative","Specture vs andere Tools","Installation von Specture","Einrichtungsanleitung für Specture","Software-Entwicklung mit Specture"],"pt":["como usar Specture","o que é arquitetura de software baseada em especificações","Specture vs outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento","guia de instalação do Specture","configuração do Specture","desenvolvimento de software com Specture"],"ru":["как использовать Specture","что такое система архитектуры программного обеспечения на основе спецификаций ИИ Агенты","Specture против других инструментов разработки","руководство по установке Specture","настройка Specture","разработка программного обеспечения с помощью Specture и ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Specture","ما هي هندسة البرمجيات المرتكزة على المواصفات للعملاء الإلكترونيين","Specture مقابل أدوات التطوير الأخرى","دليل تثبيت Specture","إعداد Specture","تطوير البرمجيات باستخدام Specture والعملاء الإلكترونيين"]}},"owner":"specture-system","repo":"specture","repoPath":"specture-system/specture","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.015Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"specture","description":"Follow the Specture System for spec-driven development. Use when creating, implementing, or managing specs.","bodyPreview":"# Specture System\n\nSpecture is a spec-driven development system. Specs are design documents in the `specs/` directory that describe planned changes — features, refactors, redesigns, tooling improvements. Each spec contains the design rationale, decisions, and an implementation task list.\n\nSpec numbers are stored in the YAML frontmatter `number` field. New specs use slug-only filenames (e.g., `my-feature.md`). Older specs may retain `NNN-slug.md` filenames — both naming patterns are valid.\n\n## Im","body":"# Specture System\n\nSpecture is a spec-driven development system. Specs are design documents in the `specs/` directory that describe planned changes — features, refactors, redesigns, tooling improvements. Each spec contains the design rationale, decisions, and an implementation task list.\n\nSpec numbers are stored in the YAML frontmatter `number` field. New specs use slug-only filenames (e.g., `my-feature.md`). Older specs may retain `NNN-slug.md` filenames — both naming patterns are valid.\n\n## Implementation Workflow\n\nWhen implementing a spec, follow this loop:\n\n1. Run `specture status` to see the current spec and next task\n2. Complete one or more tasks from the task list\n3. Edit the spec file: change `- [ ]` to `- [x]` for every task completed in this commit\n4. Stage both the implementation files **and** the spec file update\n5. Commit together with a conventional commit message (e.g., `feat: implement feature X`)\n6. Push the changes\n7. Repeat from step 1\n\n**Critical rules:**\n\n- Every commit that completes a task MUST include the spec file checkbox update alongside the implementation changes. Never commit implementation without the corresponding `- [x]` update. This is the most important rule.\n- If a single commit completes multiple tasks, check off all of them in that same commit. Do NOT make separate empty commits just to check off tasks that were already implemented.\n- Do NOT edit spec design decisions or descriptions without explicit user permission. You may only mark tasks complete and add/remove tasks during implementation.\n- When editing a spec, keep the design decisions section and task list in sync. If a description is updated, update all corresponding task descriptions to match, and vice versa.\n- When all tasks are checked off, update the frontmatter `status` to `completed`.\n\n## CLI Commands\n\nAlways use non-interactive flags. Interactive mode will hang waiting for input.\n\n### specture list and specture status\n\nUse `list` to see all specs at a glance, then `status` to drill into a specific one.\n\n**`specture list`** — overview of all specs (number, status, progress, name).\n\n```bash\nspecture list                            # All specs\nspecture list --status in-progress       # Filter by status\nspecture list --status draft,approved    # Multiple statuses\nspecture list -f json                    # JSON output with full metadata\n```\n\nAliases: `list`, `ls`\n\n**`specture status`** — detailed view of one spec, including tasks and current task.\n\n```bash\nspecture status                          # Current in-progress spec\nspecture status --spec 3                 # Specific spec by number\nspecture status -f json                  # JSON output\n```\n\nTypical workflow: run `specture list` to find the spec you need, then `specture status --spec N` to see its tasks and progress.\n\n### specture new\n\nCreate a new spec file with automatic numbering and branch.\n\n```bash\n# Non-interactive: provide title via flag (required for agents)\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\"\n\n# Pipe full body content\ncat spec-body.md | specture new --title \"Feature name\"\n\n# Skip branch creation\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\" --no-branch\n\n# Skip opening editor\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\" --no-editor\n\n# Preview without creating anything\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\" --dry-run\n```\n\nAliases: `new`, `n`, `add`, `a`\n\n### specture validate\n\nValidate that specs follow the Specture System format.\n\n```bash\n# Validate all specs\nspecture validate\n\n# Validate a specific spec by number\nspecture validate --spec 3\nspecture validate -s 42\n```\n\nChecks: valid frontmatter (number and status), no duplicate numbers, description present, task list present. Warns on number/filename mismatch.\n\nAliases: `validate`, `v`\n\n### specture setup\n\nInitialize or update the Specture System in a repository.\n\n```bash\n# Non-interactive setup\nspecture setup --yes\n\n# Preview without changes\nspecture setup --dry-run\n\n# Force AGENTS.md update prompt\nspecture setup --update-agents --yes\n```\n\nAliases: `setup`, `update`, `u`\n\n### specture rename\n\nRename a spec file and update all markdown links in the specs directory.\n\n```bash\n# Rename spec 3 to status-command.md\nspecture rename --spec 3 status-command\n\n# Preview changes\nspecture rename --spec 3 status-command --dry-run\n```\n\n## Spec Status Workflow\n\nSpecs move through these statuses:\n\n1. **draft** — Being written and refined\n2. **approved** — Ready for implementation\n3. **in-progress** — Implementation underway (tasks being checked off)\n4. **completed** — All tasks done\n5. **rejected** — Reviewed and rejected\n\nIf a spec has no explicit `status` in frontmatter, it is inferred from tasks:\n- No task list or no complete tasks → `draft`\n- Mix of complete and incomplete → `in-progress`\n- All tasks complete → `completed`\n\n## Commit Messages\n\nUse conventional commits:\n\n- `feat:` — new features\n- `fix:` — bug fixes\n- `refactor:` — code restructuring\n- `docs:` — documentation\n- `test:` — test changes\n\n## Precedence\n\nHigher-numbered specs take precedence over lower-numbered ones when they conflict. Completed specs are historical records — do not retroactively update them (except to fix typos or factual errors).\n\n## Spec Format Reference\n\nFor detailed spec file format (frontmatter fields, sections, naming conventions), see [references/spec-format.md](references/spec-format.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:10:01.355Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring spec-driven software architecture systems and YAML frontmatter parsing capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要基于规格驱动的软件架构系统和YAML前置内容解析能力的代码审查代理。","ja":"規格駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステムとYAMLフロントマターの解析機能を必要とするコードレビュー代理に最適です。","ko":"코드 검토 에이전트가 규격 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템 및 YAML 프론티어 내용 파싱 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que requieren sistemas de arquitectura de software basados en especificaciones y capacidades de análisis de YAML frontmatter.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Revue de Code nécessitant des systèmes d''architecture logicielle basés sur des spécifications et des capacités d''analyse de YAML frontmatter.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die spezifikationsgetriebene Software-Architektursysteme und YAML-Frontmatter-Verarbeitungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem sistemas de arquitetura de software baseados em especificações e capacidades de parsing de frontmatter YAML.","ru":"Идеально для агентов проверки кода, требующих системы программной архитектуры, управляемые спецификациями, и возможности парсинга YAML-заголовков.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يتطلب أنظمة هندسة برمجية مدفوعة بالمواصفات وقدرات تحليل YAML frontmatter."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage spec documents in the `specs/` directory, leveraging YAML frontmatter `number` fields for efficient spec numbering and organization, while utilizing slug-only filenames for new specs and supporting legacy `NNN-slug.md` filenames.","zh":"赋予代理在`specs/`目录中管理规格文档的能力，利用YAML前置内容`number`字段进行高效的规格编号和组织，同时支持仅slug文件名的新规格和遗产`NNN-slug.md`文件名。","ja":"代理が`specs/`ディレクトリで仕様ドキュメントを管理できるようにし、YAMLフロントマターの`number`フィールドを使用して効率的な仕様番号付けと組織を行い、新しい仕様にはスラッグのみのファイル名を使用し、レガシーの`NNN-slug.md`ファイル名をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 `specs/` 디렉토리에서 규격 문서를 관리할 수 있도록 하며 YAML 프론티어 내용의 `number` 필드를 사용하여 효율적인 규격 번호 매기기 및 조직을 수행하며 새로운 규격에는 슬러그만 파일 이름을 사용하고 레거시 `NNN-slug.md` 파일 이름을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar documentos de especificaciones en el directorio `specs/`, aprovechando los campos `number` de YAML frontmatter para un numerado y organización de especificaciones eficientes, y utilizando nombres de archivo de solo slug para nuevas especificaciones y admitiendo nombres de archivo legados `NNN-slug.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les documents de spécifications dans le répertoire `specs/`, en exploitant les champs `number` de YAML frontmatter pour un numérotage et une organisation de spécifications efficaces, tout en utilisant des noms de fichiers slug-only pour les nouvelles spécifications et en prenant en charge les noms de fichiers hérités `NNN-slug.md`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Spezifikationsdokumente im Verzeichnis `specs/` zu verwalten, indem sie die YAML-Frontmatter-`number`-Felder für effizientes Spezifikationsnummern und -organisation nutzen und Dateinamen mit Slug-only für neue Spezifikationen verwenden und Dateinamen im legacy-Format `NNN-slug.md` unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar documentos de especificações no diretório `specs/`, aproveitando campos `number` de frontmatter YAML para numeração e organização eficientes de especificações, além de utilizar nomes de arquivos com slug apenas para novas especificações e suportar nomes de arquivos legados `NNN-slug.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять документами спецификаций в директории `specs/`, используя поля `number` заголовков YAML для эффективной нумерации и организации спецификаций, а также использует имена файлов только со slug для новых спецификаций и поддерживает устаревшие имена файлов `NNN-slug.md`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة مستندات المواصفات في الدليل `specs/` ، واستخدام حقول `number` من YAML frontmatter للترقيم والتنظيم الفعال للمواصفات ، بالإضافة إلى استخدام أسماء الملفات التي تحتوي على slug فقط للمواصفات الجديدة ودعم أسماء الملفات Legacy `NNN-slug.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating spec document management","Generating implementation task lists from spec documents","Parsing YAML frontmatter for spec metadata"],"zh":["自动化规格文档管理","从规格文档生成实现任务列表","解析YAML前置内容以获取规格元数据"],"ja":["仕様ドキュメントの管理を自動化する","仕様ドキュメントから実装タスクリストを生成する","YAMLフロントマターを解析して仕様メタデータを取得する"],"ko":["규격 문서 관리 자동화","규격 문서에서 구현 작업 목록 생성","YAML 프론티어 내용을 파싱하여 규격 메타데이터를 얻는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la gestión de documentos de especificaciones","Generación de listas de tareas de implementación a partir de documentos de especificaciones","Análisis de YAML frontmatter para metadatos de especificaciones"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion des documents de spécifications","Génération de listes de tâches d''implémentation à partir de documents de spécifications","Analyse de YAML frontmatter pour les métadonnées de spécifications"],"de":["Automatisierung der Verwaltung von Spezifikationsdokumenten","Generierung von Implementierungsaufgabenlisten aus Spezifikationsdokumenten","Analyse von YAML-Frontmatter für Spezifikationsmetadaten"],"pt":["Automatizar a gestão de documentos de especificações","Gerar listas de tarefas de implementação a partir de documentos de especificações","Parsing YAML frontmatter para metadados de especificações"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление документами спецификаций","Генерировать списки задач реализации из документов спецификаций","Парсинг YAML-заголовков для метаданных спецификаций"],"ar":["تحسين آلي لإدارة مستندات المواصفات","توليد قوائم مهام التنفيذ من مستندات المواصفات","تحليل YAML frontmatter لمتاديات المواصفات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the `specs/` directory","Limited to spec documents with YAML frontmatter"],"zh":["需要访问`specs/`目录","仅限于具有YAML前置内容的规格文档"],"ja":["`specs/`ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","YAMLフロントマターを持つ仕様ドキュメントのみに限定される"],"ko":["`specs/` 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요","YAML 프론티어 내용을 가진 규격 문서로만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `specs/`","Limitado a documentos de especificaciones con YAML frontmatter"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `specs/`","Limité aux documents de spécifications avec YAML frontmatter"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `specs/`","Begrenzt auf Spezifikationsdokumente mit YAML-Frontmatter"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao diretório `specs/`","Limitado a documentos de especificações com YAML frontmatter"],"ru":["Требует доступа к директории `specs/`","Ограничен документами спецификаций с YAML-заголовками"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `specs/`","محدود بمستندات المواصفات التي تحتوي على YAML frontmatter"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6666671a8a4c3f709e755338eb87877811718e5b3e2c762d8c71189dbbfb25a2","qualityScore":37}');
