,"ar":["معالجة مخططات قاعدة البيانات","دعم متعدد لقواعد البيانات","التكامل مع FastAPI","سهل الاستخدام والتهيئة","دعم التعاملات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用db-migration","什么是db-migration","db-migration替代品","db-migration与其他工具的比较","db-migration安装指南","db-migration设置教程","FastAPI应用开发","数据库迁移工具"],"ja":["db-migrationの使い方","db-migrationとは","db-migrationの代替","db-migrationと他のツールの比較","db-migrationのインストールガイド","db-migrationの設定チュートリアル","FastAPIアプリケーションの開発","データベース移行ツール"],"ko":["db-migration 사용 방법","db-migration이란","db-migration 대안","db-migration과 다른 도구 비교","db-migration 설치 가이드","db-migration 설정 튜토리얼","FastAPI 애플리케이션 개발","데이터베이스 마이그레이션 도구"],"es":["herramientas de migración de base de datos","db-migration","FastAPI","migración de datos","bases de datos relacionales","cómo utilizar db-migration","alternativas a db-migration","db-migration vs otras herramientas","instalación de db-migration","guía de configuración de db-migration"],"fr":["outils de migration de base de données","db-migration","FastAPI","migration de données","bases de données relationnelles","comment utiliser db-migration","alternatives à db-migration","db-migration vs autres outils","installation de db-migration","guide de configuration de db-migration"],"de":["Datenbankmigrationstools","db-migration","FastAPI","Datenmigration","relationale Datenbanken","wie man db-migration verwendet","Alternativen zu db-migration","db-migration vs andere Tools","Installation von db-migration","Konfigurationsanleitung für db-migration"],"pt":["como usar db-migration","o que é db-migration","db-migration vs alembic","instalar db-migration","guia de configuração db-migration","ferramentas de migração de banco de dados","desenvolvimento de aplicações FastAPI","migração de banco de dados","db-migration alternative"],"ru":["как использовать db-migration","что такое db-migration","db-migration vs alembic","установить db-migration","руководство по настройке db-migration","инструменты миграции баз данных","разработка приложений FastAPI","миграция баз данных","db-migration альтернатива"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة db-migration","ما هي أداة db-migration","أداة db-migration مقابل alembic","تثبيت أداة db-migration","دليل إعداد أداة db-migration","أدوات معالجة قاعدة البيانات","تطوير تطبيقات FastAPI","معالجة قاعدة البيانات","أداة db-migration بديلة"]}},"owner":"Deadwood-ai","repo":"deadtrees","repoPath":"Deadwood-ai/deadtrees","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.050Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"db-migration","description":"Implements and validates DeadTrees database schema changes through MCP-first local workflow. Use when the user asks for database migrations, schema updates, Supabase diffs, local DB changes, migration validation, or exporting migration files.","bodyPreview":"# DB Migration Workflow\n\n## Purpose\n\nUse this workflow to safely create and validate database migrations in DeadTrees with MCP-first database operations.\n\n## Core Rules\n\n- Never connect to the database directly with Python; use MCP tools.\n- Use local DB MCP (`user-deadtrees-local`) for schema changes and validation.\n- Before any change, verify local and production DB are in sync using MCP-only checks.\n- Keep test scope fast first: run only relevant, quick tests before broader checks.\n- Ask befor","body":"# DB Migration Workflow\n\n## Purpose\n\nUse this workflow to safely create and validate database migrations in DeadTrees with MCP-first database operations.\n\n## Core Rules\n\n- Never connect to the database directly with Python; use MCP tools.\n- Use local DB MCP (`user-deadtrees-local`) for schema changes and validation.\n- Before any change, verify local and production DB are in sync using MCP-only checks.\n- Keep test scope fast first: run only relevant, quick tests before broader checks.\n- Ask before committing; do not commit automatically.\n- Never push/apply migrations to production from the agent; production migration application is manual by the user.\n\n## Required Workflow\n\nFollow these steps in order.\n\n### 1) Verify local and production are in sync (MCP-only)\n\n- Compare local and production schemas via MCP (`user-deadtrees-local` and `user-deadtrees-prod`) before making changes.\n- Validate critical objects involved in the migration (tables, views, functions, policies, indexes, triggers).\n- If drift is found, stop and report it before proceeding.\n\n### 2) Make local dev DB changes via MCP\n\n- Apply schema/function/policy changes using MCP SQL execution against local DB.\n- Prefer safe SQL patterns:\n\t- Start with small, targeted statements.\n\t- Validate affected objects immediately after each change.\n- If view dependencies exist, handle drop/alter/recreate order explicitly.\n\n### 3) Validate with fast tests and MCP checks\n\n- Run relevant fast tests only (smallest affected scope first).\n- Follow project testing rules:\n\t- Use `deadtrees` CLI for tests.\n\t- Prefer focused test paths instead of full suites.\n- Review DB behavior with MCP:\n\t- Check updated schema objects.\n\t- Run validation queries that prove expected behavior.\n\t- Confirm no unintended side effects in related tables/views/functions.\n\n### 4) Fix breakages if found\n\n- If tests or MCP validation fail, fix code/SQL and re-run step 2.\n- Continue until fast tests pass and MCP validation confirms expected behavior.\n\n### 5) Export migration\n\nRun:\n\n```bash\nPGSSLMODE=disable supabase db diff -f name-of-migration-file\n```\n\n- Use a descriptive migration file name.\n- Ensure generated migration reflects only intended schema changes.\n\n### 6) Review migration file\n\n- Verify SQL ordering and dependency safety.\n- Confirm idempotence expectations and rollback safety where applicable.\n- Ensure no accidental changes are included.\n\n### 7) Ask to commit\n\n- Summarize what changed, what was tested, and MCP validation results.\n- Ask user for approval before `git add`/`git commit`.\n- Explicitly remind: do not apply/push migration to production; user applies it manually.\n\n## Fast-Path Test Selection Guidance\n\nWhen selecting tests, prefer this order:\n\n1. Direct unit/integration tests for changed module.\n2. Closely related API/processor test file via `--test-path`.\n3. Broader suite only if targeted tests indicate cross-cutting impact.\n\n## MCP Validation Checklist\n\nUse this checklist before exporting migration:\n\n- Local object exists and has expected definition.\n- Key queries against changed object return expected results.\n- Related policies/views/functions still work.\n- No obvious regressions in dependent paths.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:25:21.991Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for FastAPI Agents needing safe and validated database migration workflows with MCP-first database operations.","zh":"非常适合需要安全且经过验证的数据库迁移工作流，并优先采用 MCP 进行数据库操作的 FastAPI Agent。","ja":"MCPを優先したデータベース操作により、安全かつ検証済みのデータベース移行ワークフローを必要とする FastAPI Agent に最適です。","ko":"MCP 우선 데이터베이스 작업으로 안전하고 검증된 데이터베이스 마이그레이션 워크플로우가 필요한 FastAPI Agent에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de FastAPI que necesitan flujos de trabajo de migración de base de datos seguros y validados con operaciones de base de datos MCP-first.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents FastAPI nécessitant des flux de travail de migration de base de données sécurisés et validés avec des opérations de base de données MCP-first.","de":"Perfekt für FastAPI-Agents, die sichere und validierte Datenbank-Migrations-Workflows mit MCP-first-Datenbankoperationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes FastAPI que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de migração de banco de dados seguros e validados com operações de banco de dados MCP-first.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов FastAPI, которым требуются безопасные и проверенные рабочие процессы миграции базы данных с операциями MCP-first для базы данных.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء FastAPI الذين يحتاجون إلى سير عمل هجرة قاعدة بيانات آمنة وموثوقة مع عمليات قاعدة بيانات MCP-first."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage database schema changes using local DB MCP, ensuring data consistency and integrity through MCP-only checks and validation, while leveraging FastAPI for robust backend operations.","zh":"使 Agent 能够使用本地 DB MCP 管理数据库模式更改，通过仅限 MCP 的检查和验证确保数据一致性和完整性，同时利用 FastAPI 实现强大的后端操作。","ja":"ローカル DB MCP を使用してデータベーススキーマの変更を管理し、MCPのみのチェックと検証を通じてデータの一貫性と整合性を確保すると同時に、堅牢なバックエンド操作のために FastAPI を活用することを可能にします。","ko":"로컬 DB MCP를 사용하여 데이터베이스 스키마 변경을 관리하고 MCP 전용 점검 및 검증을 통해 데이터 일관성과 무결성을 보장하며, 강력한 백엔드 운영을 위해 FastAPI를 활용할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar cambios en el esquema de la base de datos utilizando DB MCP local, garantizando la consistencia y la integridad de los datos a través de controles y validaciones MCP-only, mientras aprovecha FastAPI para operaciones de backend robustas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les modifications du schéma de base de données en utilisant la base de données MCP locale, en garantissant la cohérence et l''intégrité des données grâce à des contrôles et des validations MCP-only, tout en exploitant FastAPI pour des opérations de backend robustes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Änderungen an der Datenbankschema-Verwaltung mit lokaler DB MCP durchzuführen, wodurch die Konsistenz und Integrität der Daten durch MCP-only-Prüfungen und Validierungen sichergestellt werden, während FastAPI für robuste Backend-Operationen genutzt wird.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerenciar alterações de esquema de banco de dados usando o DB MCP local, garantindo consistência e integridade dos dados por meio de verificações e validações exclusivas do MCP, enquanto aproveita o FastAPI para operações robustas de backend.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять изменениями схемы базы данных с использованием локального DB MCP, обеспечивая согласованность и целостность данных посредством проверок и валидации только через MCP, одновременно используя FastAPI для надежных бэкенд-операций.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة تغييرات مخطط قاعدة البيانات باستخدام DB MCP المحلي، مما يضمن اتساق وسلامة البيانات من خلال عمليات الفحص والتحقق الخاصة بـ MCP فقط، مع الاستفادة من إطار عمل FastAPI لعمليات الخلفية القوية."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating database schema changes","Generating and testing database migrations","Ensuring local and production DB sync using MCP tools"],"zh":["验证数据库模式更改","生成和测试数据库迁移","使用 MCP 工具确保本地和生产数据库同步"],"ja":["データベーススキーマ変更の検証","データベースマイグレーションの生成とテスト","MCPツールを使用したローカルと本番環境のDB同期の確保"],"ko":["데이터베이스 스키마 변경 사항 검증","데이터베이스 마이그레이션 생성 및 테스트","MCP 도구를 사용한 로컬 및 프로덕션 DB 동기화 보장"],"es":["Validar cambios en el esquema de la base de datos","Generar y probar migraciones de base de datos","Asegurar la sincronización de la base de datos local y de producción utilizando herramientas MCP"],"fr":["Valider les modifications du schéma de base de données","Générer et tester les migrations de base de données","Assurer la synchronisation de la base de données locale et de production à l''aide d''outils MCP"],"de":["Änderungen am Datenbankschema validieren","Datenbankmigrationen generieren und testen","Synchronisierung der lokalen und Produktions-Datenbank mithilfe von MCP-Tools sicherstellen"],"pt":["Validação de alterações no esquema do banco de dados","Geração e teste de migrações de banco de dados","Garantia de sincronização entre DB local e de produção usando ferramentas MCP"],"ru":["Проверка изменений схемы базы данных","Создание и тестирование миграций базы данных","Обеспечение синхронизации локальной и производственной БД с использованием инструментов MCP"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة تغييرات مخطط قاعدة البيانات","إنشاء واختبار هجرات قاعدة البيانات","ضمان مزامنة قاعدة البيانات المحلية والإنتاجية باستخدام أدوات MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MCP tools and local DB MCP setup","Limited to FastAPI applications","Needs Python environment for execution"],"zh":["需要 MCP 工具和本地 DB MCP 设置","仅限于 FastAPI 应用程序","需要 Python 环境才能执行"],"ja":["MCPツールとローカルDB MCPのセットアップが必要","FastAPIアプリケーションに限定される","実行にはPython環境が必要"],"ko":["MCP 도구 및 로컬 DB MCP 설정 필요","FastAPI 애플리케이션으로 제한됨","실행을 위해 Python 환경 필요"],"es":["Requiere herramientas MCP y configuración de DB MCP local","Limitado a aplicaciones FastAPI","Necesita entorno de Python para la ejecución"],"fr":["Nécessite des outils MCP et une configuration de base de données MCP locale","Limité aux applications FastAPI","Nécessite un environnement Python pour l''exécution"],"de":["Benötigt MCP-Tools und lokale DB-MCP-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf FastAPI-Anwendungen","Benötigt Python-Umgebung für die Ausführung"],"pt":["Requer ferramentas MCP e configuração de DB MCP local","Limitado a aplicações FastAPI","Necessita de ambiente Python para execução"],"ru":["Требует инструменты MCP и настройку локального DB MCP","Ограничено приложениями FastAPI","Требует среду Python для выполнения"],"ar":["يتطلب أدوات MCP وإعداد DB MCP المحلي","مقتصر على تطبيقات FastAPI","يحتاج إلى بيئة Python للتنفيذ"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"58e28525f6217de55763efe5599afde13b642ba8f78766647d86713140f05925","qualityScore":37}');
