ker、Docker-compose、nginx、Let''s Encrypt）を使用したデプロイのみに限定"],"ko":["npm 및 Docker 설치가 필요","지원되는 도구 및 프로토콜(예: Docker, Docker-compose, nginx, Let''s Encrypt)만을 사용하여 배포하는 경우에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de npm y Docker","Limitado a despliegues que utilizan herramientas y protocolos compatibles (por ejemplo, Docker, Docker-compose, nginx, Let''s Encrypt)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm et de Docker","Limité aux déploiements utilisant des outils et des protocoles pris en charge (par exemple, Docker, Docker-compose, nginx, Let''s Encrypt)"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von npm und Docker","Begrenzt auf Bereitstellungen, die unterstützte Tools und Protokolle verwenden (z. B. Docker, Docker-compose, nginx, Let''s Encrypt)"],"pt":["Exige instalação do npm e Docker","Limitado a implantações que usam ferramentas e protocolos suportados (por exemplo, Docker, Docker-compose, nginx, Let''s Encrypt)"],"ru":["Требует установки npm и Docker","Ограничен развертываниями, использующими поддерживаемые инструменты и протоколы (например, Docker, Docker-compose, nginx, Let''s Encrypt)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm و Docker","محدود بالتوزيعات التي تستخدم أدوات وبروتوكولات مدعومة (على سبيل المثال ، Docker ، Docker-compose ، nginx ، Let''s Encrypt)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fed45b50e3b743720b3329792723fca444a43383e3bc969b1f5cee5751c4fb90","qualityScore":36}');
