n"],"fr":["Migration de AG_* avec miroir GEN_OS","Partage de compétences avec satellite antigravité","Technologies de pointe pour le développement de projets","Intégration avec des outils de développement de logiciels","Support pour plusieurs plateformes et langages de programmation"],"de":["Migration von AG_* mit GEN_OS-Spiegel","Teilen von Fähigkeiten mit Antigravitations-Satellit","Innovative Technologien für die Entwicklung von Projekten","Integration mit Software-Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen und Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Integração com ferramentas de IA","Compartilhamento de habilidades em tempo real","Tecnologia de satélite antigravidade","Desenvolvimento de projetos avançados","Melhoria da produtividade"],"ru":["Интеграция с ИИ агентами","Обмен навыками в режиме реального времени","Технология антигравитационного спутника","Разработка передовых проектов","Повышение производительности"],"ar":["دمج أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مشاركة المهارات في الوقت الفعلي","تكنولوجيا قمر صناعي مناهض للجاذبية","تنمية مشاريع متقدمة","تحسين الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","共享技能","Antigravity卫星项目","GEN_OS镜像","代码共享","开发效率","多语言开发","AIエージェント"," cómo usar AI工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","共有スキル","アンチグラビティ衛星プロジェクト","GEN_OSミラー","コードの共有","開発効率","多言語開発","AI工具の代替","AIエージェントのセットアップガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","공유 기술","안티 그래비티 위성 프로젝트","GEN_OS 미러","코드 공유","개발 효율성","다중 언어 개발","AI 도구 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de AI","qué es el proyecto de satélite antigravedad","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","satélite antigravedad vs otros proyectos","instalación de herramientas de AI","guía de configuración de satélite antigravedad","desarrollo de proyectos con tecnologías de vanguardia"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''IA","qu''est-ce que le projet de satellite antigravité","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","satellite antigravité vs autres projets","installation d''outils d''IA","guide de configuration de satellite antigravité","développement de projets avec des technologies de pointe"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist das Antigravitations-Satelliten-Projekt","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Antigravitations-Satellit vs andere Projekte","Installation von KI-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für Antigravitations-Satellit","Entwicklung von Projekten mit innovativen Technologien"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","compartilhamento de habilidades","satélite antigravidade","desenvolvimento de projetos","produtividade","tecnologia avançada","como usar ferramentas de IA","o que é compartilhamento de habilidades"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","обмен навыками","антигравитационный спутник","разработка проектов","производительность","передовая технология","как использовать ИИ агенты","что такое обмен навыками"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مشاركة المهارات","قمر صناعي مناهض للجاذبية","تنمية مشاريع","الإنتاجية","التكنولوجيا المتقدمة","كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي مشاركة المهارات"]}},"owner":"ITATA93","repo":"G_DeepResearch_Salud_Chile","repoPath":"ITATA93/G_DeepResearch_Salud_Chile","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T16:44:07Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Sharing Skills","description":"Contribute skills back to upstream via branch and PR","version":"2.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Sharing Skills\n\n## Overview\n\nContribute skills from your local branch back to the upstream repository.\n\n**Workflow:** Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR\n\n## When to Share\n\n**Share when:**\n- Skill applies broadly (not project-specific)\n- Pattern/technique others would benefit from\n- Well-tested and documented\n- Follows skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines\n\n**Keep personal when:**\n- Project-specific or organization-specific\n- Experimental or unstable\n- Contains sensitive informatio","body":"# Sharing Skills\n\n## Overview\n\nContribute skills from your local branch back to the upstream repository.\n\n**Workflow:** Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR\n\n## When to Share\n\n**Share when:**\n- Skill applies broadly (not project-specific)\n- Pattern/technique others would benefit from\n- Well-tested and documented\n- Follows skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines\n\n**Keep personal when:**\n- Project-specific or organization-specific\n- Experimental or unstable\n- Contains sensitive information\n- Too narrow/niche for general use\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `gh` CLI installed and authenticated\n- Working directory is `~/.config/superpowers/skills/` (your local clone)\n- Skill has been tested (see skills/meta/writing-skills for TDD process)\n\n## Sharing Workflow\n\n### 1. Ensure You''re on Main and Synced\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.config/superpowers/skills/\ngit checkout main\ngit pull upstream main\ngit push origin main  # Push to your fork\n```\n\n### 2. Create Feature Branch\n\n```bash\n# Branch name: add-skillname-skill\nskill_name=\"your-skill-name\"\ngit checkout -b \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\n```\n\n### 3. Create or Edit Skill\n\n```bash\n# Work on your skill in skills/\n# Create new skill or edit existing one\n# Skill should be in skills/category/skill-name/SKILL.md\n```\n\n### 4. Commit Changes\n\n```bash\n# Add and commit\ngit add skills/your-skill-name/\ngit commit -m \"Add ${skill_name} skill\n\n$(cat <<''EOF''\nBrief description of what this skill does and why it''s useful.\n\nTested with: [describe testing approach]\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### 5. Push to Your Fork\n\n```bash\ngit push -u origin \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\n```\n\n### 6. Create Pull Request\n\n```bash\n# Create PR to upstream using gh CLI\ngh pr create \\\n  --repo upstream-org/upstream-repo \\\n  --title \"Add ${skill_name} skill\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\nBrief description of the skill and what problem it solves.\n\n## Testing\nDescribe how you tested this skill (pressure scenarios, baseline tests, etc.).\n\n## Context\nAny additional context about why this skill is needed and how it should be used.\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n## Complete Example\n\nHere''s a complete example of sharing a skill called \"async-patterns\":\n\n```bash\n# 1. Sync with upstream\ncd ~/.config/superpowers/skills/\ngit checkout main\ngit pull upstream main\ngit push origin main\n\n# 2. Create branch\ngit checkout -b \"add-async-patterns-skill\"\n\n# 3. Create/edit the skill\n# (Work on skills/async-patterns/SKILL.md)\n\n# 4. Commit\ngit add skills/async-patterns/\ngit commit -m \"Add async-patterns skill\n\nPatterns for handling asynchronous operations in tests and application code.\n\nTested with: Multiple pressure scenarios testing agent compliance.\"\n\n# 5. Push\ngit push -u origin \"add-async-patterns-skill\"\n\n# 6. Create PR\ngh pr create \\\n  --repo upstream-org/upstream-repo \\\n  --title \"Add async-patterns skill\" \\\n  --body \"## Summary\nPatterns for handling asynchronous operations correctly in tests and application code.\n\n## Testing\nTested with multiple application scenarios. Agents successfully apply patterns to new code.\n\n## Context\nAddresses common async pitfalls like race conditions, improper error handling, and timing issues.\"\n```\n\n## After PR is Merged\n\nOnce your PR is merged:\n\n1. Sync your local main branch:\n```bash\ncd ~/.config/superpowers/skills/\ngit checkout main\ngit pull upstream main\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n2. Delete the feature branch:\n```bash\ngit branch -d \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\ngit push origin --delete \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**\"gh: command not found\"**\n- Install GitHub CLI: https://cli.github.com/\n- Authenticate: `gh auth login`\n\n**\"Permission denied (publickey)\"**\n- Check SSH keys: `gh auth status`\n- Set up SSH: https://docs.github.com/en/authentication\n\n**\"Skill already exists\"**\n- You''re creating a modified version\n- Consider different skill name or coordinate with the skill''s maintainer\n\n**PR merge conflicts**\n- Rebase on latest upstream: `git fetch upstream && git rebase upstream/main`\n- Resolve conflicts\n- Force push: `git push -f origin your-branch`\n\n## Multi-Skill Contributions\n\n**Do NOT batch multiple skills in one PR.**\n\nEach skill should:\n- Have its own feature branch\n- Have its own PR\n- Be independently reviewable\n\n**Why?** Individual skills can be reviewed, iterated, and merged independently.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **skills/meta/writing-skills** - How to create well-tested skills\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T03:14:31.790Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Collaborative AI Agents needing streamlined skill contribution and repository management.","zh":"非常适合需要简化技能贡献和仓库管理的协作AI代理。","ja":"コラボレーションAIエージェントがスキル貢献とリポジトリ管理を効率化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"협업 AI 에이전트가 보다 효율적인 스킬 기여 및 저장소 관리를 필요로 할 때 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Colaborativos que necesitan contribución de habilidades y gestión de repositorios simplificadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA Collaboratifs ayant besoin d''une contribution de compétences et d''une gestion de référentiels simplifiées.","de":"Perfekt für kollaborierende KI-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Fähigkeitsbeitrag und Repository-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Colaborativos que necessitam de contribuição de habilidades e gestão de repositório simplificadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Коллаборативных ИИ-агентов, которым необходима упрощенная вкладка навыков и управление репозиторием.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين التعاونيين الذين يحتاجون إلى مساهمة مهارات وادارة مستودع مبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to contribute skills back to the upstream repository using a standardized workflow with Git, following skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines and leveraging Commit, Push, and PR protocols for efficient collaboration and version control.","zh":"赋予代理使用标准化工作流和Git、遵循技能/元数据/写作技能指南，并利用提交、推送和PR协议实现高效协作和版本控制的能力，以便将技能贡献回上游仓库。","ja":"エージェントが、標準化されたワークフローとGitを使用し、スキル/メタデータ/書き込みスキルガイドラインに従い、コミット、プッシュ、PRプロトコルを利用して効率的なコラボレーションとバージョン管理を実現し、スキルを上流リポジトリに貢献できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 표준화된 워크플로와 Git를 사용하여 스킬/메타데이터/작성 스킬 가이드라인을 따르고 커밋, 푸시 및 PR 프로토콜을 활용하여 효율적인 협업 및 버전 관리를 실현하여 스킬을 업스트림 저장소에 기여할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a contribuir habilidades al repositorio upstream utilizando un flujo de trabajo estandarizado con Git, siguiendo las pautas de habilidades/meta/habilidades de escritura y aprovechando los protocolos de Commit, Push y PR para una colaboración y control de versiones eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de contribuer des compétences au référentiel upstream en utilisant un flux de travail standardisé avec Git, en suivant les directives de compétences/meta/écriture de compétences et en exploitant les protocoles Commit, Push et PR pour une collaboration et un contrôle de version efficaces.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Fähigkeiten an das upstream-Repository beizutragen, indem sie einen standardisierten Workflow mit Git verwenden, der die Richtlinien für Fähigkeiten/meta/Schreibfähigkeiten befolgt und die Commit-, Push- und PR-Protokolle für eine effiziente Zusammenarbeit und Versionskontrolle nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a contribuir habilidades de volta ao repositório upstream usando um fluxo de trabalho padronizado com Git, seguindo as diretrizes skills/meta/writing-skills e aproveitando os protocolos Commit, Push e PR para colaboração eficiente e controle de versão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью вносить вклад навыки обратно в репозиторий upstream, используя стандартизированный рабочий процесс с Git, следующий руководящим принципам skills/meta/writing-skills и использующий протоколы Commit, Push и PR для эффективного сотрудничества и контроля версий.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من المساهمة في المهارات إلى المستودع الرئيسي باستخدام سير عمل معياري مع Git ، مع اتباع إرشادات skills/meta/writing-skills وتحقيق بروتوكولات Commit و Push و PR من أجل التعاون الفعال والتحكم في الإصدار."},"useCases":{"en":["Migrating project-specific skills to upstream repositories","Sharing broadly applicable patterns and techniques","Documenting and testing skills for community benefit"],"zh":["将项目特定的技能迁移到上游仓库","共享广泛适用的模式和技术","为社区利益而记录和测试技能"],"ja":["プロジェクト固有のスキルを上流リポジトリに移行する","広く適用可能なパターンとテクニックを共有する","コミュニティの利益のためにスキルを文書化してテストする"],"ko":["프로젝트 고유의 스킬을 업스트림 저장소로 마이그레이션","널리 적용 가능한 패턴 및 기술을 공유","커뮤니티 이익을 위해 스킬을 문서화하고 테스트"],"es":["Migrar habilidades específicas de proyecto a repositorios upstream","Compartir patrones y técnicas de aplicación general","Documentar y probar habilidades para beneficio de la comunidad"],"fr":["Migration de compétences spécifiques au projet vers des référentiels upstream","Partage de modèles et de techniques d''application générale","Documentation et test de compétences pour le bénéfice de la communauté"],"de":["Migration von projektspezifischen Fähigkeiten in upstream-Repositorys","Teilen von allgemein anwendbaren Mustern und Techniken","Dokumentation und Testen von Fähigkeiten zum Nutzen der Community"],"pt":["Migrar habilidades específicas do projeto para repositórios upstream","Compartilhar padrões e técnicas aplicáveis amplamente","Documentar e testar habilidades para benefício da comunidade"],"ru":["Миграция проектно-специфичных навыков в репозитории upstream","Обмен широко применимыми шаблонами и техниками","Документирование и тестирование навыков для пользы сообщества"],"ar":["نقل المهارات المحددة للمشروع إلى المستودعات الرئيسية","مشاركة الأنماط والأشكال المطبقة على نطاق واسع","توثيق واختبار المهارات لمنفعة المجتمع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git workflow understanding","Skills must be well-tested and documented","Project-specific or sensitive information should be kept personal"],"zh":["需要Git工作流理解","技能必须经过良好的测试和文档记录","项目特定或敏感信息应保密"],"ja":["Gitワークフローの理解が必要","スキルは十分にテストされ、文書化されている必要がある","プロジェクト固有の情報や機密情報は個人情報として扱う"],"ko":["Git 워크플로 이해가 필요","스킬은 충분히 테스트되고 문서화되어야 함","프로젝트 고유 또는 민감한 정보는 개인 정보로서 유지"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del flujo de trabajo de Git","Las habilidades deben estar bien probadas y documentadas","La información específica del proyecto o sensible debe mantenerse personal"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du flux de travail Git","Les compétences doivent être bien testées et documentées","Les informations spécifiques au projet ou sensibles doivent être conservées personnelles"],"de":["Benötigt ein Verständnis des Git-Workflows","Fähigkeiten müssen gut getestet und dokumentiert sein","Projektspezifische oder sensible Informationen sollten persönlich gehalten werden"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do fluxo de trabalho do Git","As habilidades devem ser bem testadas e documentadas","Informações específicas do projeto ou sensíveis devem ser mantidas pessoais"],"ru":["Требует понимания рабочего процесса Git","Навыки должны быть хорошо протестированы и задокументированы","Проектно-специфичная или конфиденциальная информация должна быть сохранена в личном порядке"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم سير عمل Git","يجب أن تكون المهارات مدروسة جيدًا ومدوّنة","يجب giữ معلومات المشروع أو الحساسة شخصيًا"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c896e646f1ea27b6e897f55b732fb9e269365593df34071694d5d0ab68a2e888","qualityScore":36}');
